<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- Nyamwezi</book>
  <para style="toc1">Ki'tabu cha Mbu'ki'</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mbu'ki'</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mbk</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mbu'ki'</para>
  <para style="imt">Mihayo zya Mbele zya Ki'tabu cha Mbu'ki'</para>
  <para style="ip">Ki'tabu cha Mbu'ki' ki'li' ki'tabu cha kwandya cha Ilagano lya Kale. Wu'tone wa Ki'ebulania wa ki'tabu cheni'chi' wu'lamulile na mihayo, “Ha mbu'ki'.” Ki'tabu cheni'chi' ki'li'lagi'la vintu' vyose u'ko vyalamuli'la, na i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu walamula ku'v'a bi'hi' na v'antu'.</para>
  <para style="ip">V'asomi nsiku' i'zi v'ali' na miganiko hekeheke ku'v'a chatonwa na nde na chatonwa ku' itungo ki'. V'ingi v'ali'wiganika ku'v'a ki'tabu cheni'chi' chagelani'ziwa ha itungo lya myaka 600 mpaka 500 K.K. (aho akaali' ku'v'yalwa Kilisito), mu itungo i'lo v'av'age v'asese ku' nsi' ya Babuloni. V'angi' v'ali'zumani'zya ku'v'a Mose hu' mwene watona ki'tabu cha Mbu'ki', haki'mo na vitabu vingi' vine vya Tolati (Ku'fuma, Magambo ga V'alawi, Lu'v'alo na Mwizu' gwa Nhama), hagati' na myaka 1500 mpaka 1400 K.K., ku' itungo lya myaka zya ku' nnuma muno.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ki'tabu cha Mbu'ki' ki'sombile mmola nhanya muno i'zyo zili'v'agwasya V'akelesito ku'manya ki'la lwandi' lwa Bibiliya, lu'v'e lwa Ilagano lya Kale ninga Ilagano Ipya. Ki'tabu cheni'chi' ki'li'ku'lagi'la wu'kenagu'zi i'vyo wingi'la mu welelo, na i'vyo v'antu' v'ose v'ali'mukoov'a mupi'zya. Hangi' ki'tabu cheni'chi' ki'li'lagi'la ndaka yamwa Mulungu ku'v'akomola v'antu'. Lyeni'li' li'kowolile kwigengeleka ku'londana na wu'fumbu'zi wa kwandya u'wo wu'li'mufumbu'la Yesu (Mbu'ki' 3:15), na i'vyo Mulungu wamulaganaga Abalahamu ku'v'a alagadosye makabi'la gose ga mu welelo (Mbu'ki' 12:3).</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">Mihayo ku' Wu'guhi':</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Ifungu lya 1 mpaka lya 2 li'li'welezezya i'vyo Mulungu wali'tundaga li'welelo, na i'vyo wav'atundaga Adamu na Eva.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ifungu lya 3 mpaka lya 5 li'li'v'elezezya Adamu na Eva, ku'gwa kwav'o mu wu'kenagu'zi, na wu'v'yazi wav'o.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ifungu lya 6 mpaka lya 9 li'li'welezezya mmola yamwa Nowa na kamilamasenga.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ifungu lya 10 mpaka lya 11 li'li'welezezya itungo lya hagati' lyamwa Nowa na Abalahamu haki'mo na mmola ya chamba cha Babele.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Ifungu lya 12 mpaka lya 50 li'li'welezezya mmola yamwa Abalahamu, mugana gwakwe na nnandyo ya nsi' ya Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="io2">A. Ifungu lya 12 mpaka lya 25 li'li'welezezya wikalo wamwa Abalahamu na muki' wakwe Sala.</para>
  <para style="io2">B. Ifungu lya 21 mpaka lya 28 li'li'welezezya wikalo wamwa Isaka, na muki' wakwe Lebeka, na ifungu lya 35 li'li'welezezya lu'fu lwakwe.</para>
  <para style="io2">C. Ifungu lya 25 mpaka lya 50 li'li'v'elezezya v'ana v'amwa Isaka, Yakobo na Esau.</para>
  <para style="io2">D. Ifungu lya 37 mpaka lya 50 lyokalile mmola zyamwa Yosefu, mwana wamwa Yakobo u'yo mutoneke, na i'vyo wav'eziwa ku'v'a mutemi wa nsi' ya Misili.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu ali'tunda li'welelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />19 Ha mbu'ki', Mulungu watundaga ilunde na li'welelo. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Mu itungo lyeni'lo li'welelo lyav'age li'li' wu'du'hu' ki'ntu', ninga wu'tundwa, na giti yav'age yi'kumbile ha igu'lya na nyanza, na Loho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhayo “loho” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “loho” ninga “muyaga.”</char></note> ya Mulungu yav'age yi'li'elela ha igu'lya na welekela wa minzi'.<verse eid="GEN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Haho Mulungu wayombaga, “Gu'v'e mwanga,” na gwav'aga mwanga. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Nago wagu'wonaga mwanga ku'v'a gu'li' musoga, na wagu'lekaniaga mwanga na giti. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Mulungu wagwitanaga mwanga “Lyu'v'a,” na giti wayitanaga “Wu'ziku'.” Yav'aga mpi'ndi' yav'aga ndiyu', lu'siku' lwa kwandya.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Hangi' Mulungu wayombaga, “Ku'v'eho na chelela hagati' na minzi', ki'gele ki'lekanie minzi' gav'e lwandi' lwa ku' igu'lya na ha nsi'li'li'.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Hu' vyene watundaga chelela, na wagalekaniaga minzi' ago gav'age ha igu'lya na chelela nago gav'age ha nsi'li'li' ya chelela, na yav'aga vyeni'vyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Mulungu wakitanaga chelela cheni'cho “Ilunde.” Yav'aga mpi'ndi' yav'aga ndiyu', lu'siku' lwa wu'v'i'li'.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Haho Mulungu wayombaga, “Minzi' ago gali' ha nsi'li'li' ya ilunde gikuminge haki'mo, ki'gele yigele nsi' nkazu,” na yav'aga vyeni'vyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Hohene wahitanaga hakazu “Nsi'” na ha wokale wa minzi' wahitanaga “Nyanza,” nawe wawonaga ku'v'a yi'li' visoga. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Hangi' Mulungu wayombaga, “Nsi' yi'mezye mimelo zya ku'pambya mbiyu', na miti' zya ku'pambya visumo vya mbiyu' hekeheke ku' wu'tundwa wazyo,” na yav'aga vyeni'vyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Haho, nsi' yamezyaga mimelo zya ku'pambya mbiyu' hekeheke ku' wu'tundwa wazyo na miti' zya ku'pambya visumo vya mbiyu' hekeheke ku' wu'tundwa wazyo, na Mulungu wawonaga ku'v'a yi'li' visoga. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Yav'aga mpi'ndi', yav'aga ndiyu', lu'siku' lwa wu'datu'.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Hangi' Mulungu wayombaga, “Ku'v'eho na myanga ku' chelela cha ilunde ki'gele zilekanie lyu'v'a na wu'ziku', na zyeni'zi ziku'v'a hu' lu'manyi'lo lwa ku'manyi'la matungo, nsiku' na myaka. <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />Nazyo ziv'e myanga ku' ilunde na ku'li'mu'li'ki'la li'welelo,” na yav'aga vyeni'vyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Mulungu watundaga myanga iv'i'li' mihanya zya hekeheke, gu'mo gu'teme lyu'v'a, na gu'ngi' gu'teme wu'ziku'. Hangi' watundaga na nsonda. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Haho wazitu'u'laga myanga zyeni'zyo ku' chelela cha ilunde, ki'gele zili'mu'li'ki'le li'welelo, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />ki'gele ziteme lyu'v'a na wu'ziku', na ku'lekania mwanga na giti. Mulungu wawonaga ku'v'a yi'li' visoga. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Yav'aga mpi'ndi' yav'aga ndiyu', lu'siku' lwa wu'ne.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Hangi' Mulungu wayombaga, “Ku'v'e na vitundwa vya myu'ye ya wu'panga vyokale mu minzi', na nnoni zibulumuke mu igu'lya mu chelela.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Haho watundaga vitundwa vyose vihanya vya mu minzi', na vitundwa vingi' vya ku'yu'mba mu minzi' ku' wu'tundwa wavyo, haki'mo na nnoni zyose ku' wu'tundwa wazyo, nawe wawonaga ku'v'a yi'li' visoga. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Mulungu wavidosyaga ku' ku'yomba ati', “Mwiwu'te, mwingi'he, mokale mu minzi' ga mu nyanza, na nnoni zingi'he ha nsi'.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Yav'aga mpi'ndi' yav'aga ndiyu', lu'siku' lwa wu'tano.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Hangi' Mulungu wayombaga, “Nsi' yi'v'yale vitundwa vya myu'ye ya wu'panga ku' wu'tundwa wavyo, ndimu zya mu ipolu na zya ku'sav'a, na vitundwa vingi' vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi' ku' wu'tundwa wavyo,” na yav'aga vyeni'vyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Haho watundaga ndimu zya mu ipolu na zya ku'sav'a na vitundwa vingi' vyose vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi' ku' wu'tundwa wavyo, nawe wawonaga ku'v'a yi'li' visoga.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Hangi' Mulungu wayombaga, “Gi'si' ku'tunde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku' ki'tabu cha Mbu'ki' Gu'ku' Mulungu aho ali'wiyombela mu moyo gwakwe ali'tu'mi'la mihayo zya lu'sangi' ninga i'vi ali' inene. V'antu' v'angi' v'ali'wiganika ku'v'a hamo ku'nguno ya Wu'datu' wu'sondo ninga wu'temi wakwe. </char></note> v'antu' ku' wikole wiswe, v'ikole niswe, ki'gele v'akateme nsonvi zya mu minzi', nnoni zya mu chelela, visawa vyose na vitundwa vyose vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi' mu welelo yose.”<verse eid="GEN 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Hohene wav'atundaga v'antu' ku' wikole wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 1:27">ku' wikole wakwe mweni'ki'li' wav'atundaga mugosya na muki'ma.<verse eid="GEN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Mulungu wav'adosyaga ku' ku'v'awi'la, “Muv'e na wu'v'yalwa wingi muno, mwingi'he, muyokazye welelo, na muv'e ha igu'lya na vyose. Muteme nsonvi zya mu minzi', nnoni zyose na ki'la ki'tundwa cha ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi'.”<figure style="fig" file="C-003.jpg" size="col" ref="1:28" /><verse eid="GEN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Mulungu wayombaga, “Lingagi, namupaga ki'la mumelo gwa mbiyu' u'go gu'li' ha nsi' mu welelo yose, na ki'la muti' u'go gu'li' na visumo vya mbiyu', viku'v'a viliwa vinywe. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Nazyo ndimu zyose zya mu welelo, nnoni zya mu chelela, na vitundwa vingi' vyose vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', ki'la ki'tundwa cha myu'ye ya wu'panga, nu'vipa mimelo zyose zya madu'tu' viv'e viliwa vyavyo.” Yav'aga vyeni'vyo.<verse eid="GEN 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Yav'aga aho Mulungu wamali'laga ku'tunda, lingaga, wawonaga ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho watundaga ki'li' ki'soga muno. Yav'aga mpi'ndi' yav'aga ndiyu', lu'siku' lwa mukaga.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Hu' vyene vyeni'vyo ilunde na li'welelo haki'mo na vyose i'vyo vili'mo vyagelani'laga ku'tundwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Mu lu'siku' lwa mupungati' Mulungu wasangwa wamalaga mili'mo zyakwe zyose zya wu'tundi, haho wasuuhaga na akatu'mamile hangi' mili'mo i'zyo waziv'ezyage. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Haho Mulungu walu'dosyaga lu'siku' lwa mupungati' na ku'lu'v'ezya lu'sondo, ku'nguno lu'siku' lwenu'lo Mulungu wasuuhaga mili'mo zyose zya wu'tundi. <verse eid="GEN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />I'vi hu' vyene yi'li' mmola ya wu'tundwi wa ilunde na li'welelo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 2:4">Mulungu ali'v'atu'u'la v'antu' mu mugu'nda gwa Edeni</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Mu itungo i'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu watundaga ilunde na li'welelo, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />nsi' yav'age yi'kaali' ku'mezya mimelo zya mu ipolu ninga mimelo zya mu ilale ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'age akaali' ku'yi'leku'li'la nvula ku'tonya, na hav'age hadu'hu' muntu' wa ku'yi'li'ma nsi'. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Ali'vi kasela zyadu'li'kaga ha nsi' na minzi' gafumaga na ku'yi'tosya nsi' yose. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamutundaga muntu'<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhayo “Muntu'” ku' Ki'ebulania gu'li' “Adam” na likolile na muhayo “wu'longo.”</char></note> ku' lu'wuwu lwa nsi', na wamupugi'laga myu'ye ya wu'panga mu nnindo, nawe muntu' wazuwu'kaga.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wahambaga mugu'nda musoga gwa kwiv'elela mugati' na Edeni, ku' lwandi' lwa mu ki'ya, na mwenu'mo wamutu'u'laga mwenu'yo muntu' u'yo wamutundaga. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamezyaga miti' zya hekeheke ku'fuma ha nsi', miti' zya kwiv'elela mu minso, hangi' zigelani'lile mu ku'liwa. Muti' gwa wu'panga nago gwav'age hagati' na mugu'nda, haki'mo na muti' gwa ku'manya tu'soga na tu'v'i.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Mwenu'mo mu mugu'nda gwa Edeni gwav'age gu'li'ho mongo u'go gwayelage minzi' na kwiti'li'zya mugu'nda gwenu'go, na ku'fumi'i'la henanho mongo gwenu'go gwigawu'laga ku'v'a myongo ine. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Lina lya mongo gwa kwandya gu'li'witanwa Pishoni, gwenu'go gu'yi'pilimile nsi' yose ya Havila u'ko ku'li' na zahabu, <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />nayo zahabu ya nsi' yeni'yo nsoga muno. Hangi' yi'li' na wisu'lyu' wa ku'mota u'wo wu'li'witanwa bedola, na mawe ga mupango ago gali'witanwa shohamu. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Lina lya mongo gwa wu'v'i'li' gu'li'witanwa Gihoni, u'go gu'yi'pilimile nsi' yose ya Kushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Lina lya mongo gwa wu'datu' gu'li'witanwa Tigili, nago gu'yelelile lwandi' lwa mu ki'ya ya kaya ya Ashulu, na lina lya mongo gwa wu'ne gu'li'witanwa Efulate.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Hohene Gu'ku' Mulungu wamusolaga mwenu'yo muntu', na wamutu'u'laga mu mugu'nda gwa Edeni agu'li'me na ku'gwangali'la. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wafumyaga ilagi'li'zyo ku' muntu' mwenu'yo ati', “U'kowolile ku'lya visumo vya muti' ki'la muti' mu mugu'nda, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />sumbwa visumo vya muti' gwa ku'manya tu'soga na tu'v'i ku'du' wize u'lye, ku'nguno lu'siku' u'lalye visumo vya muti' gwenu'go, nhana u'lafwe.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombaga, “Yi'kav'ile visoga muntu' mwenu'yu' ku'v'a inene. Nku'muv'ezezya mugwasya wa ku'mugelani'la.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wasangwa watundile ndimu zyose zya mu ipolu na nnoni zyose zya mu chelela ku'fuma ku' wu'longo. Haho wamuletelaga mwenu'yo muntu' ki'gele awone aku'zipa mina ku'he, na mina ago wavipaga vitundwa vya myu'ye ya wu'panga hu' gav'aga mina gavyo. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Nawe muntu' mwenu'yo wazipaga mina ndimu zyose zya mu ipolu na zya ku'sav'a haki'mo na nnoni zyose zya mu chelela, ali'vi wav'age akaali' kwigela mugwasya wa ku'mugelani'la.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuletelaga mwenu'yo muntu' tu'lo tu'timbu, na aho walalaga wamusiniaga lu'v'azu lu'mo, na henanho wahakumbi'laga na nyama. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Ku' lu'v'azu lwenu'lo u'lo walu'fumyaga ku' mugosya mwenu'yo, Gu'ku' Mulungu walu'v'ezyaga muki'ma na wamuletaga ku' mugosya mwenu'yo. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Haho mugosya mwenu'yo wayombaga,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 2:23" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Gi'si' mwenu'yu' ali' iguha ku'fuma ku' maguha ganne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">na nyama ku'fuma ku' nyama zyanne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">mwenu'yu' akwitanwa ‘Muki'ma’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">ku'nguno wafumi'i'laga ku' mugosya.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo mugosya ali'v'aleka ise na nnina na ku'v'a haki'mo na muki' wakwe, na v'enav'a v'av'i'li' v'aku'v'a muv'i'li' gu'mo.<verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Mwenu'yo mugosya na muki' wakwe v'av'age du'u'hu', ali'vi v'akawine nsoni.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Wu'gwe wa kwandya wa v'antu' mu wu'kenagu'zi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Ali'vi nzoka yav'age mbeleganu ku'ki'la vitundwa vyose vya mu ipolu i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wavitundaga. Nzoka yeni'yo yamuwi'laga muki'ma, “Angu', yi'li' nhana Mulungu wayombile ati', ku'du' mwize mulye visumo vya ki'la muti' gwa mu mugu'nda?” <verse eid="GEN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Nawe muki'ma wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ayi', ku'kowolile ku'lya visumo mu miti' zya mu mugu'nda gwenu'gu', <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />sumbwa visumo vya muti' gwa hagati' na mugu'nda Mulungu wayombile, ‘Ku'du' mwize mulye ninga ku'gu'kuumya. U'lu' mwize mulye, ninga ku'gu'kuumya, mulafwe.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Haho nzoka yamuwi'laga muki'ma mwenu'yo, “Mukakowola ku'fwa! <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Ku'nguno Mulungu amanyile ku'v'a lu'siku' mulalye visumo vya muti' gwenu'go, minso ginywe galakundu'ku'lwe, na inywe mulav'e ki'ti' Mulungu, mulamanye tu'soga na tu'v'i.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Nawe muki'ma mwenu'yu' aho wawonaga ku'v'a visumo vya muti' gwenu'go vili' visoga ku'liwa, na vya kwiv'elela mu minso, hangi' vili' vya ku'tamani'lwa na ku'mupa muntu' wu'manyi, haho wayav'aga visumo vyago, walyaga, na wamupaga mugosi wakwe, nawe walyaga. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Hene haho minso gav'o v'ose v'av'i'li' gakundu'ku'lagwa, nav'o v'imanyaga ku'v'a v'ali' du'u'hu'. Haho v'asolaga madu'tu' ga muti' gwa mutini, v'isumi'laga vizwalo na v'ikumbi'laga mu miki'mbi'li' zyav'o.<figure style="fig" file="C-005.jpg" size="col" ref="3:7" /><verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Yav'aga mu mafuulo ga mpi'ndi', mugosya mwenu'yo haki'mo na muki' wakwe aho v'igagwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'yu'mbayu'mba mu mugu'nda, haho v'ayaga ku'kiv'isa mu miti' zya mu mugu'nda, ki'gele Gu'ku' Mulungu aleke ku'v'awona. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwitanaga mugosya na ku'muwu'zya, “Adamu, u'li' ku'he?” <verse eid="GEN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Nawe Adamu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nakwigagwa u'li'yu'mbayu'mba mu mugu'nda, nali' nogoha, na niv'isaga ku'nguno ene ni' du'u'hu'.” <verse eid="GEN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwu'zyaga, “Nde u'yo waku'wi'laga ku'v'a u'li' du'u'hu'? Mbela, walyaga visumo vya muti' u'go naku'kaani'zya?” <verse eid="GEN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Nawe Adamu wasu'v'yaga, “Muki'ma mwenu'yu' wampile av'e haki'mo nanne mwene wampaga visumo vya muti' gwenu'go nanne navilyaga.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwu'zyaga muki'ma mwenu'yo, “Wav'ezyaga vihe ev'e?” Muki'ma wasu'v'yaga, “Nzoka yene yanhu'mbyaga nanne nalyaga.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nfwizi' zyamwa Mulungu ku' v'akenagu'zi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wayi'wi'laga nzoka,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 3:14" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">“Ku' ki' wav'ezyaga genaga, wafwizi'i'lagwa ev'e</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">mugati' na vitundwa vyose vya ku'sav'a na zya mu ipolu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">Ku'yu'mba kwako u'ku'v'a u'li'yu'mbi'la nda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">lu'wuwu lwa nsi' lu'ku'v'a ki'liwa chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:14">mugati' na nsiku' zya wikalo wako wose.<verse eid="GEN 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Nanne nu'tu'u'la wanisi ku' wako na ku' muki'ma mwenu'yu',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">ku' wu'v'yalwa wako na wu'v'yalwa wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">ev'e alaku'tune mutwe gwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:15">nanho u'lamulume kasinsila kakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Haho wamugalu'ki'laga muki'ma na ku'muwi'la,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 3:16" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">“Nku'kwingi'hi'zya wu'su'ngu' wingi mu itungo lya ku'v'yala kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">u'lav'yale v'ana ku' wu'su'ngu'.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">Ninga vyeni'vyo u'ku'mutamani'lwa mugosi wako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:16">nawe alaku'teme.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Hangi' wamuwi'laga mugosya,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 3:17" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">“Ku'nguno ev'e wamuzumani'zyaga muki' wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">na ku'lya visumo vya muti' u'go naku'kaani'zya ku'du' u'lye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">nsi' yafwizi'i'lagwa ku'nguno yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">na ku'lya kwako ku'ku'v'a ku' mili'mo mitimbu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:17">mu wikalo wako mu nsiku' zyako zyose.<verse eid="GEN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Nsi' yeni'yi' yi'ku'ku'v'yali'la minvwa na mbi'gi'li',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:18">na yi'ku'ku'dima ku'lya mimelo zya mu migu'nda zya nsi' yeni'yo.<verse eid="GEN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Ku' lu'yi'lo lwa wu'syu' wako yi'ku'v'a hu' ku'lya kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">mpaka aho u'lasu'v'e ha nsi' aho wafumi'i'la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 3:19">na ku'nguno u'li' lu'wuwu ev'e, ku' lu'wuwu u'lasu'v'eko.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Haho Adamu wamupaga lina muki' wakwe, “Eva”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Eva” ku' Ki'ebulania “Hawa” li'li' na nguno ya muhayo “mupanga.” </char></note> ku'nguno aku'v'a mayu' wa v'antu' v'ose v'a wu'panga. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'av'ezezyaga Adamu na muki' wakwe vizwalo vya ndi'li', na wav'azwi'kaga.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombaga, “Lingaga, mwenu'yu' muntu' wav'aga ki'ti' iswe, mu ku'manya tu'soga na tu'v'i. Yi'li'ku'dima ku'mugizya ku'du' ize ayav'e visumo vya muti' gwa wu'panga, ku'nguno u'lu' ize alye alav'e na wikalo wa nhananhana.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'asagaga ku'fuma mu mugu'nda gwa Edeni, ki'gele Adamu aye akayi'li'me nsi' i'yo watundi'lwa. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Aho wav'asagaga v'antu' v'enav'a, wav'atu'u'laga v'amalaika v'akelubi mu lwandi' lwa mu ki'ya ya mugu'nda gwa Edeni, na lu'panga lwa moto u'lo lu'li'galu'ka kosekose ku'yi'lindi'li'zya nzi'la ya ku'ya ku' muti' gwa wu'panga.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s">Kaini ali'muwu'laga mudu'gu'ye Habele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Yav'aga aho Adamu walalaga na muki' wakwe Eva, nawe wapandi'kaga mwitungo, na wav'yalaga mwana wa ki'gosya nawe wamupaga lina Kaini. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Kaini” li'li' ki'ti' muhayo gwa Ki'ebulania u'go gu'li' na nguno ya “Napandi'ka” ninga “Natunda.” </char></note>Eva wayombaga, “Napandi'ka mwana ku' wu'kowozi wamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.” <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Aho lyav'i'taga itungo, wav'yalaga hangi' mwana wa ki'gosya, mudu'gu' wamwa Kaini, na wamupaga lina lyakwe Habele. Habele wav'age mudi'mi wa nkolo na mbu'li na Kaini wav'age muli'mi. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Yav'aga lu'siku' lu'mo, Kaini wamufumi'zyaga Gu'ku' Mulungu kalu'mbi'lo ka viliwa ku'fuma ku' mugu'nda gwakwe. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Nawe Habele wafumyaga kalu'mbi'lo ku'fuma ku' tu'di'lana twa mbele na maguta gato. Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu watogeziv'agwa na Habele na kalu'mbi'lo kakwe. <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />Ali'vi akatogeziv'ilwe na Kaini ninga kalu'mbi'lo kakwe. Haho Kaini wagayaga muno na wu'syu' wakwe wasininkalaga. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwu'zyaga Kaini, “Wagayi'laga ki'? Na ku' ki' wu'syu' wako wasininkalaga? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Vihe, u'lu' u'v'ezye visoga u'kakowolile ku'zumiwa? Ali'vi u'lu' u'kav'ile ku'v'ezya visoga, wu'kenagu'zi wu'li'kwitegela ha muzigo. Wu'li'kwigomelwa, ali'vi yi'li'ku'dima u'wu'kinde.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Aho lyav'i'taga itungo Kaini wamuwi'laga muzunaye Habele, “Ku'yage ku' mugu'nda.” Yav'aga aho v'av'aga kwenu'ko Kaini wamugwi'li'laga Habele na wamuwu'lagaga.<figure style="fig" file="C-009.jpg" size="col" ref="4:8" /> <verse eid="GEN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwu'zyaga Kaini, “Mudu'gu'yo Habele ali' ku'he?” Kaini wasu'v'yaga, “Ene nkamanya. Vihe, ene hu' ni' musu'ngi wa muzuna wanne?” <verse eid="GEN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwu'zyaga, “Wav'ezyaga vihe ev'e? Magazi ga muzunayo gali'ndi'li'la ku'fuma ha nsi'. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Gi'si' ev'e wafwizi'i'lagwa u'ku'v'a ku'le na nsi' i'yo yapokelaga magazi ga mudu'gu'yo na ku'ganywa ku'fuma mu makono gako. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Aho u'lav'e u'li'yi'li'ma nsi' yi'laleke ku'ku'fumi'zya hangi' viliwa vingi. U'ku'v'a muntu' wa ku'yegayega na ku'gayiwa wikalo mu welelo.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Kaini wamuwi'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu, ati', “Lu'duko lwanne lu'li' lu'hanya muno ku'lu'kowola ng'o!<verse eid="GEN 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />“Lingaga, walelo wansagaga ku'fuma mu nsi' yeni'yi' nikale ku'le nanho, nanne nku'v'a wa ku'yegayega mu welelo, na muntu' u'yo alambone alambu'lage.” <verse eid="GEN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ayi', yi'kav'ile vyene. U'yo alaku'wu'lage ev'e alali'pi'ki'ziwe kali' mupungati' yakwe.” Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamutu'u'li'laga lu'manyi'lo ki'gele u'yo alamuwone aleke ku'muwu'laga.<verse eid="GEN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Hangi' Kaini wahafumaga ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, na wayaga ku'kikala ku' nsi' ya Nodi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Nodi” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “ku'yegayega”. </char></note> ku' lwandi' lwa ku' ki'ya ya Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu'v'yalwa wamwa Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Kaini walalaga na muki' wakwe, nawe wapandi'kaga mwitungo na ku'v'yala mwana u'yo wamupaga lina Enoki. Ha itungo lyeni'lo Kaini wasangwa ali'zyenga kaya na ku'hapa lina lya mwana wakwe Enoki. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Nawe Enoki wapandi'kaga mwana lina Iladi, Iladi wapandi'kaga mwana lina Mehuyaeli, Mehuyaeli wapandi'kaga mwana lina Metushaeli, na Metushaeli wapandi'kaga mwana lina Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lameki watoolaga v'aki'ma v'av'i'li', yu'mo witanagwe Ada na wa wu'v'i'li' Sila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada wamuv'yalaga Yabali u'yo wav'age sav'o lya v'asav'i v'a mitugo, av'o v'av'age v'ikazi v'a mu mbaga. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Lina lya mudu'gu'ye witanagwe Yubali, na mwenu'yo hu' wav'age sav'o lya v'ose v'agomba tu'dono na minyonge. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Nawe Sila wamuv'yalaga Tubali-kaini u'yo wav'age musuli wa viseme vyose vya shaba na chu'ma. Na ilu'mbu'ye na Tubali-kaini witanagwe Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, Lameki wav'awi'laga v'aki' v'akwe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 4:23" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada na Sila mumpu'li'ki'zye muzwi gwanne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">inywe v'aki' v'amwa Lameki degeleki i'cho nu'yomba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">ene nawu'lagile muntu' u'yo ndi' wanvulazya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">nawu'lagile musu'mbana ku'nguno ya ku'nsatya.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />U'lu' muntu' u'yo alamuwu'lage Kaini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">alali'pi'ki'ziwe kali' mupungati' yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">sumbwa ku'mwa Lameki u'yo alamuwu'lage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">alali'pi'ki'ziwe kali' maku'mi mupungati' na mupungati' yakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu'v'yalwa wamwa Adamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Hohene Adamu walalaga na muki' wakwe, nawe wav'yalaga hangi' mwana wa ki'gosya, na wamupaga lina Seti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Seti” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “ku'yali'lwa”. </char></note> Wayombaga ati', “Nayali'lagwa na Mulungu ku'pandi'ka mwana yu'ngi' ha lwandi' lwamwa Habele u'yo Kaini wamuwu'lagile.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Nawe Seti wapandi'kaga mwana wa ki'gosya, na wamupaga lina Enoshi. Na hene haho v'antu' v'asangwa v'alamulaga ku'mwisenga Gu'ku' Mulungu ku' lina lyakwe Yahweh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Yahweh” ninga “Yehova” li'li' lina lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku' Ki'ebulania.</char></note>.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />I'yi' hu' mmola ya mina ga v'av'yalwa v'amwa Adamu. Itungo i'lo Mulungu wav'atundaga v'antu', wav'atundaga ku' wikole wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Wav'atundaga mugosya na muki'ma, haho wav'adosyaga na wav'apaga lina “V'antu'.”<verse eid="GEN 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adamu aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi adatu', hangi' wapandi'kaga mwana wa ku'mwikola, ku' wikole wakwe, wamupaga lina Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Seti, Adamu wikalaga myaka magana munane. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana, v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Wikalo wakwe wose mu welelo Adamu wikalaga myaka magana kenda na maku'mi adatu', haho wagulalaga.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Nawe Seti aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka igana li'mo na itano, haho wapandi'kaga mwana lina Enoshi. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Enoshi, Seti wikalaga myaka magana munane na mupungati'. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana, v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Wikalo wakwe wose mu welelo Seti wikalaga myaka magana kenda na iku'mi na iv'i'li', haho wagulalaga.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Nawe Enoshi aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi kenda, haho wapandi'kaga mwana lina Kenani. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Kenani, Enoshi wikalaga myaka magana munane na iku'mi na itano. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana, v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Wikalo wakwe wose mu welelo Enoshi wikalaga myaka magana kenda na itano, haho wagulalaga.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Nawe Kenani aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi mupungati', haho wapandi'kaga mwana lina Mahalaleli. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Mahalaleli, Kenani wikalaga myaka magana munane na maku'mi ane. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana, v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Wikalo wakwe wose mu welelo Kenani wikalaga myaka magana kenda na iku'mi, haho wagulalaga.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Nawe Mahalaleli aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi mukaga na itano, haho wapandi'kaga mwana lina Yaledi. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Yaledi, Mahalaleli wikalaga myaka magana munane na maku'mi adatu'. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana, v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Wikalo wakwe wose mu welelo Mahalaleli wikalaga myaka magana munane na maku'mi kenda na itano, haho wagulalaga.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Nawe Yaledi aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka igana na maku'mi mukaga na iv'i'li', haho wapandi'kaga mwana lina Enoki. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Enoki, Yaledi wikalaga myaka magana munane. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana, v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Wikalo wakwe wose mu welelo Yaledi wikalaga myaka magana kenda na maku'mi mukaga na iv'i'li', haho wagulalaga.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Nawe Enoki aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi mukaga na itano, haho wapandi'kaga mwana lina Metusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Metusela, Enoki wikalaga myaka magana adatu'. Nawe walondaga nzi'la yamwa Mulungu. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana, v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Wikalo wakwe wose mu welelo, Enoki wikalaga myaka magana adatu' na maku'mi mukaga na itano. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Enoki wav'age ali' bi'hi' na Mulungu, haho walekaga kwigela ku'nguno Mulungu wamusolaga.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Nawe Metusela aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi munane na mupungati', haho wapandi'kaga mwana lina Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Lameki, Metusela wikalaga myaka magana mupungati' na maku'mi munane na iv'i'li'. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana, v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Wikalo wakwe wose mu welelo, Metusela wikalaga myaka magana kenda na maku'mi mukaga na kenda, haho wagulalaga.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Nawe Lameki aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi munane na iv'i'li', haho wapandi'kaga mwana wa ki'gosya. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Wamupaga lina Nowa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Nowa” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “ku'suuha.”</char></note> na ku'yomba, “Mwenu'yu' hu' aku'ku'lembezya ku' mili'mo ziswe milambu haki'mo na lu'duko lwa makono giswe, i'yo ku'tu'mama ku' nsi' i'yo yafwizi'i'lwa na Gu'ku' Mulungu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Nowa, Lameki wikalaga myaka magana atano na maku'mi kenda na itano. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana, v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Wikalo wakwe wose mu welelo, Lameki wikalaga myaka magana mupungati' na maku'mi mupungati' na mupungati', haho wagulalaga.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Nawe Nowa aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka magana atano, haho wapandi'kaga mwana lina lyakwe Shemu, hangi' wapandi'kaga v'ana v'angi' Yafeti na Hamu.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Wu'kenagu'zi wa v'antu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Yav'aga v'antu' aho v'alamulaga kwingi'ha na ku'sambala mu welelo, na v'ana v'a ki'ki'ma v'av'yalagwa ku' wav'o. <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />V'atundwa v'a ki'loho v'a Mulungu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“V'atundwa v'a ki'loho v'a Mulungu,” Ku' Ki'ebulania v'ali' “V'ana v'a Mulungu v'a ki'gosya.” V'ingi v'ali'wiganika ku'v'a v'ali' v'atundwa v'a ku' ilunde ninga v'ali' v'amalaika v'a wu'gwe.</char></note> v'av'awonaga v'enav'o v'aniki' v'a v'antu' ku'v'a v'ali' v'asoga, na v'isogolelaga v'aki'ma ki'ti' i'vi v'atogilwe na ku'v'atoola.<verse eid="GEN 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombaga, “Myu'ye yanne ya wu'panga yi'kakowola kwikala mu muntu' nhananhana ku'nguno mweni'ki'li' ali' wa ku'fwa, na wikalo wakwe mu welelo wu'ku'v'a myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi av'i'li' du'.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Mu nsiku' zyeni'zyo na zya ha mbele, gav'age gali'ho mantu' mu welelo ago gav'age mav'yalwa ga v'atundwa v'a ki'loho ago ndi' galala na v'aniki' v'a v'antu'. Genago hu' gav'age mantu' makowozi ago gitanagwe Manefili, mantu' genago gav'age makumalu'ku mu itungo lya nsiku' zyeni'zyo zya kale.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wawonaga ku'v'a wu'kenagu'zi wa v'antu' wu'li' wu'hanya mu welelo, na ki'la ndaka ya miganiko ga v'antu' nsiku' zyose gav'aga ga wu'kenagu'zi du'. <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wasayaga ku'v'atunda v'antu' mu welelo, na moyo gwakwe gwav'aga na wu'satu. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombaga, “Nku'v'azimangu'zya v'antu' v'ose mu welelo av'o nav'atundile, haki'mo na ndimu zyose na vitundwa vingi' vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', na nnoni zyose. Ku'nguno nu'saya ku'vitunda.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Sumbwa Nowa wapandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu ali'mupi'zya Nowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />I'yi' hu' mmola yamwa Nowa na wu'v'yalwa wakwe. Mwenu'yu' wav'age muntu' mugololoku ku' Mulungu na wa lole mugati' na v'antu' v'a ha itungo lyakwe, hangi' mugati' na kwikala kwakwe wav'age ali' bi'hi' na Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Nowa wav'age na v'ana v'adatu' v'a ki'gosya: Shemu, Hamu na Yafeti. <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Ha itungo lyeni'lo Mulungu wayi'wonaga welelo ku'v'a yav'ipaga na kokala wu'kandi, <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />ku'nguno yi'li' nhana ki'la yu'mo wav'ipyaga nzi'la yakwe mu welelo.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Mulungu wamuwi'laga Nowa, “Gi'si' ni'na ndaka ya ku'v'azimangu'zya v'antu' v'ose, ku'nguno v'okazyaga welelo wu'kenagu'zi. Nhana nku'v'azimangu'zya v'antu' v'ose mu welelo! <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Sumbwa ev'e wiv'ezezye safina ku' mbawo zya muti' gwa muvinje, u'gawu'le masenge, na u'gav'ile lami mugati' na ha ibala. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />U'layi'v'ezye i'vi: Wu'lihu wayo makono<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mukono gu'mo gu'gelani'lile na mita yi'mo. Vipimo ku' Ki'ebulania vili': wu'lihu zilaa magana adatu', wu'gali'nhu zilaa maku'mi atano, na wi'i'ma zilaa maku'mi adatu'.</char></note> igana li'mo na maku'mi adatu' na kenda, wu'gali'nhu wayo makono maku'mi av'i'li' na itano, na wi'i'ma wayo makono iku'mi na atano. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Safina yeni'yo u'yi'tu'u'li'le muzigo mu lu'v'azu lwayo. U'v'ezye twano tu'datu': kamo ka ha nsi'li'li', ka hagati' na ka ha igu'lya. U'yi'vimbe ha igu'lya, na u'lekele kapunye ka wu'lihu wa mukono hagati', kav'e hagati' ya kano na wu'vimbe. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Nhana, ndalete kamilamasenga ya minzi' ku'zimangu'zya vitundwa vyose vya myu'ye ya wu'panga. Ki'la ki'tundwa mu welelo ki'lafwe.<verse eid="GEN 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />“Ali'vi ev'e ku' wako ndaki'ndi'ke ilagano lyanne. Ev'e u'lingi'le mu safina haki'mo na muki' wako, v'ana v'ako na v'aki' v'av'o. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Mugati' na vitundwa vyose vya muv'i'li' vya myu'ye ya wu'panga, u'sole vya ki'gosya na vya ki'ki'ma u'viyane mu safina, ki'gele u'vipi'zye na lu'fu viv'e na wu'zuwu'ku haki'mo nanho.<verse eid="GEN 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />“U'latu'u'lemo nnoni, ndimu, na vitundwa vingi' vyose vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', na ki'la ki'mo ku' wu'tundwa wacho, vilize ku' wako viv'i'li' viv'i'li' ki'gele u'vitu'u'le viv'e na wu'zuwu'ku. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />U'kuminge ki'la ki'liwa, u'sole vyose hekeheke ku'nguno yinywe na vitundwa i'vyo u'lingi'le navyo.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Nawe Nowa wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo. Wav'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Mulungu wamulagi'li'zyaga.<figure style="fig" file="OT-08 Noah_s Ark.jpg" size="col" ref="6:22" /><verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s">Kamilamasenga yi'li'lamula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Nowa, “Ingi'la mu safina, ev'e haki'mo na mugana gwako gose, ku'nguno mugati' na v'antu' v'a itungo lyeni'li', naku'wonaga ev'e winene hu' u'li' wa lole ha mbele yanne. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />U'sole na ndimu nsoga mupungati' zya ki'gosya na mupungati' zya ki'ki'ma zya hekeheke, na ndimu zya zoma iv'i'li' iv'i'li', zya ki'gosya na zya ki'ki'ma, ku' ki'la ndimu ku' wu'tundwa wayo. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Hangi' u'sole na nnoni mupungati' mupungati' zya hekeheke, ngosya na nki'ma, ki'gele ku'zitu'u'la mbiyu' zyazyo ku'du' zigayiwe mu welelo. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Ku'nguno u'lu' zyamala nsiku' mupungati' ku'fuma walelo haho ndalete nvula. Yi'latonye mu welelo yose, nsiku' maku'mi ane lyu'v'a na wu'ziku', na ki'la ki'tundwa cha myu'ye ya wu'panga i'cho naki'tundaga mu welelo ndaki'zimangu'zye.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Nawe Nowa wav'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Mu itungo lyeni'lo lya kamilamasenga mu welelo, Nowa wav'age na musimo gwa myaka magana mukaga. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Hu' vyene Nowa, muki' wakwe, v'ana v'akwe na v'aki' v'av'o v'ingi'laga mu safina ku'nguno ya ku'yi'hega kamilamasenga. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Mugati' na ndimu nsoga, zya zoma, nnoni na vitundwa vingi' vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />iv'i'li' iv'i'li' zya ki'gosya na zya ki'ki'ma, zizaga ku' wakwe na zingi'laga mu safina ki'ti' i'vyo Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Nowa. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Yav'aga aho zyav'i'taga nsiku' mupungati', minzi' ga kamilamasenga galamulaga kokala ha nsi'.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Aho Nowa wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka magana mukaga, lu'siku' lwa iku'mi na mupungati' mu mwezi gwa wu'v'i'li', lu'siku' lwenu'lo hu' zyadu'li'kaga nzwi'lo zya minzi' ha nsi' ku' nguzu, na malunde ga nvula mu igu'lya galugu'li'lagwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Nvula yatonyaga ha igu'lya na nsi', nsiku' maku'mi ane lyu'v'a na wu'ziku'. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Lu'siku' lwenu'lo lwa ku'lamula ku'tonya nvula, Nowa, muki' wakwe, na v'ana v'akwe v'adatu' Shemu, Yafeti na Hamu, haki'mo na v'aki' v'av'o, v'ose v'asangwa v'akiingi'la mu safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />V'ingi'laga haki'mo na ndimu zya mu ipolu, ndimu zya ku'sav'a, vitundwa vingi' vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', na nnoni zyose, ki'la ki'mo ku' wu'tundwa wacho. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Vitundwa vyose vya myu'ye ya wu'panga vizaga ku'mwa Nowa viv'i'li' viv'i'li', na vingi'laga mu safina. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Vitundwa vyose i'vyo vingi'laga mu safina vyav'age vya ki'gosya na vya ki'ki'ma, ki'ti' i'vyo Mulungu ndi' wafumya ilagi'li'zyo ku'mwa Nowa. Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wagu'lugalaga muzigo.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Nvula ya kamilamasenga yav'aga mu welelo ku' itungo lya nsiku' maku'mi ane. Nago minzi' gayo gokalaga muno ha nsi' na gayi'wu'syaga safina mu igu'lya. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Minzi' genago gav'aga gali'wingi'ha ku' nguzu, nago gokalaga muno ha nsi', nayo safina yembelaga ha igu'lya na minzi'. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Minzi' genago gingi'haga muno ha igu'lya na nsi', mpaka gazikumbi'laga ngu'lu' zyose ndihu zya mu welelo. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Gingi'haga mpaka ngu'lu' zyakumbi'lagwa wu'tihu wa makono mupungati'. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Vitundwa vyose mu welelo vyafwaga: nnoni zyose, ndimu zya ku'sav'a na zya mu ipolu, na vitundwa vingi' vyose vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', haki'mo na v'antu' v'ose. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Ki'la ki'tundwa cha myu'ye ya wu'panga cha ha igu'lya na nsi' chafwaga. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Mulungu wavizimangu'zyaga vitundwa vyose mu welelo. V'antu', ndimu, nnoni, na vitundwa vingi' vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', vyose vyazimangu'ziv'agwa. V'asigalaga Nowa haki'mo na mugana gwakwe du' av'o wav'age nav'o mu safina.<verse eid="GEN 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Minzi' genago gayi'kumbaga welelo ku' nsiku' igana li'mo na maku'mi atano.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Kamilamasenga yi'li'mala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Haho Mulungu wamulawaga Nowa, haki'mo na vitundwa vyose vya myu'ye ya wu'panga vya mu ipolu na vya ku'sav'a i'vyo vyav'age mu safina haki'mo nawe. Haho wagu'tu'maga muyaga ha igu'lya na nsi', nago gwayumaga na minzi' galamulaga ku'doha. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Nzwi'lo zya ha nsi' zyalugalagwa, na malunde ga nvula gahangagwa, nayo nvula yalekaga ku'tonya. <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />Nago minzi' gendeleyaga ku'kama hado hado mu nsi'. Ku'fiki'la nsiku' igana na maku'mi atano ku'fuma aho yalamuli'la kamilamasenga, minzi' gadohaga muno. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Lu'siku' lwa iku'mi na mupungati' mwezi gwa mupungati' safina yahagaga ha ngu'lu' zya nsi' ya Alalati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Minzi' gav'aga gali'doha hado hado ku'fiki'la lu'siku' lwa kwandya lwa mwezi gwa iku'mi, nsoto zya ngu'lu' zingi' zyalamulaga kwigela.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Aho zyav'i'taga nsiku' maku'mi ane hangi' Nowa walugu'laga idilisya i'lo ndi' wav'ezya ku' safina yeni'yo, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />wali'fumyaga iku'ngu'u'lu' ha ibala, nalyo lyav'aga li'li'ya u'ko na u'ko na ku'su'v'a, mpaka aho gakamaga minzi' mu nsi'. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Hangi' wayi'fumyaga nkunda ki'gele awone u'lu' minzi' gadohaga mu nsi'. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Ali'vi minzi' gav'age gakaali' gayi'kumbile nsi' yose, nayo nkunda yi'kawine ha ku'dema, yasu'v'aga ku'mwa Nowa. Nawe wagololaga mukono gwakwe na ku'yi'pokela nkunda na wayi'su'v'yaga mu safina.<verse eid="GEN 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Nowa walindi'laga hangi' nsiku' mupungati', haho wayi'fumyaga nkunda yeni'yo. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Mu itungo lya mpi'ndi', kasinaga nkunda yasu'v'aga yi'lumile idu'tu' itoto lya muti' gwa muzeituni mu mulomo gwayo. Haho Nowa wamanyaga ku'v'a minzi' gadohaga mu nsi'. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Walindi'laga hangi' nsiku' mupungati', na aho zyav'i'taga hu' wayi'lugu'li'laga nkunda, ali'vi lu'gendo lwenu'lu' yi'kasu'v'ile hangi'.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Yav'aga Nowa aho wafikyaga myaka magana mukaga na gu'mo ha mwezi gwa kwandya lu'siku' lwa kwandya lwa mwezi, gasangwa minzi' gakakama mu nsi'. Haho wayi'fundu'ku'laga nfundi' ya safina, nawe wawonaga nhana nsi' yalamulaga ku'u'ma. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Mu mwezi gwa wu'v'i'li' lu'siku' lwa maku'mi av'i'li' na mupungati' nsi' yasangwa yamalile ku'u'ma.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Haho Mulungu wamuwi'laga Nowa, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“U'fume mu safina, ev'e na muki' wako, v'ana v'ako na v'aki' v'av'o. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />U'fumye ki'la ki'tundwa i'cho chali' ki'li' haki'mo nanho, ki'gele vikiwu'te vingi'he na ku'kwi'la mu welelo: nnoni, ndimu na vitundwa vingi' vyose vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi'.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Hohene Nowa wafumaga mu safina haki'mo na muki' wakwe, v'ana v'akwe na v'aki' v'av'o. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Ndimu, nnoni haki'mo na vitundwa vingi' vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', vyose ku' wu'tundwa wavyo hekeheke vyafumaga mu safina.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu ali'tu'u'la ilagano ku'mwa Nowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Haho Nowa wamuzyengelaga Gu'ku' Mulungu ihozezyo, na wasolaga mugati' na ndimu nsoga na nnoni nsoga, wafumyaga ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ku'mwa Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu watogeziv'agwa na wu'motu wa kalu'mbi'lo, na wiyombelaga mu moyo gwakwe, “Nkasye nji'fwizi'i'le hangi' nsi' ku'nguno ya v'antu', ninga i'vi ndaka ya miganiko gav'o nsiku' zyose gav'aga ga wu'kenagu'zi ku'fuma wu'yanda wav'o. Hangi' nkasye nzimangu'zye vitundwa vyose vya myu'ye ya wu'panga ki'ti' i'vyo nav'ezizye.<verse eid="GEN 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />“Ku' itungo i'lo welelo yi'lav'e yi'li'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 8:22">matungo ga ku'hamba na kwi'mbu'la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 8:22">matungo ga mbeho na idu'ta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 8:22">matungo ga ki'pwa na ki'diku',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 8:22">na matungo ga wu'ziku' na lyu'v'a gakasye gaduge.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Haho Mulungu wav'adosyaga Nowa haki'mo na v'aane ku' ku'yomba, “Muv'e na wu'v'yalwa wingi muno, mukingi'he, mukayokazye hangi' welelo. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Ndimu zyose zya mu welelo, vitundwa vingi' vyose vya ku'yu'mba ha igu'lya na nsi', nnoni zyose zya mu chelela, na nsonvi zyose zya mu nyanza ziku'musu'pi'la na ku'mogoha inywe. Zyose namupaga mu makono ginywe. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Ki'la ki'tundwa cha myu'ye ya wu'panga gi'si' ki'ku'v'a ki'liwa chinywe. Ki'ti' i'vyo namupile mimelo zya madu'tu', hu' vyene nu'mupa ni'vi vyose viv'e viliwa vinywe. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Ali'vi nyama ya wu'su'lu'le magazi ku'du' mwize mulye, ku'nguno wu'zuwu'ku wayo wu'li' mu magazi. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Nhana magazi ndagakoov'e ku' ki'la muntu' u'yo alamuwu'lage mwiye. Ndawu'koov'e wu'zuwu'ku ku'fuma ku' ki'la ki'tundwa na ki'la muntu' u'yo alite magazi ga muntu'.<verse eid="GEN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />U'yo alite magazi ga muntu',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:6">na mwene magazi gakwe galitwe na muntu',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:6">ku'nguno muntu' watundagwa ku' wikole wanne.<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />“Inywe gi'si' muv'e na wu'v'yalwa wingi muno, mukiv'yale, mwingi'he, mukayokazye welelo.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Haho Mulungu wav'awi'laga Nowa haki'mo na v'aane ati', <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Lingagi, gi'si' ene nu'ki'ndi'ka ilagano lyanne na inywe, na wu'v'yalwa winywe u'wo wu'lalonde, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />na ki'la ki'tundwa i'cho mwali' muli'nacho: nnoni, mitugo, na vitundwa vyose i'vyo vyafumaga mu safina haki'mo na inywe, hangi' na ki'la ki'tundwa cha myu'ye ya wu'panga mu welelo. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Nu'ki'ndi'ka ilagano lyanne na inywe ati', nkasye nvizimangu'zye hangi' vitundwa vyose ku' nzi'la ya kamilamasenga. Yi'kasye yize hangi' kamilamasenga ya minzi' ya ku'yi'zimangu'zya welelo.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Hangi' Mulungu wayombaga ati', “Nu'tu'u'la itav'angwa lyanne mu malunde. Lyeni'li' hu' li'ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa ilagano i'lo nu'ki'ndi'ka mugati' yanne na inywe, haki'mo na ki'la ki'tundwa cha myu'ye ya wu'panga i'cho ki'li' na inywe, mu wu'v'yalwa wose u'wo wu'lalonde. <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Nalyo li'ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa ilagano lyanne na welelo. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Yi'ku'v'a ki'la aho ndav'e nu'himbazya malunde ha igu'lya na welelo, na itav'angwa li'ligele mu malunde, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />haho ndizu'ki'le ilagano lyanne na inywe, i'lo li'li' mugati' yanne na inywe, haki'mo na vitundwa vyose vya myu'ye ya wu'panga. Nhana kamilamasenga ya minzi' yi'kasye yize hangi' ku'zimangu'zya vitundwa vyose. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Aho li'lav'e li'li'fumi'i'la itav'angwa mu malunde, ndali'wone na kwizu'ki'la ilagano lya nhananhana mugati' yanne na vitundwa vyose vya muv'i'li' na myu'ye ya wu'panga mu welelo.”<verse eid="GEN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Hangi' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Nowa ati', “Lwenu'lu' hu' lu'manyi'lo lwa ilagano i'lo naki'ndi'kaga mugati' yanne na vitundwa vyose mu welelo.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nowa na v'aane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />V'ana v'amwa Nowa av'o v'afumaga mu safina v'av'age: Shemu, Yafeti na Hamu. Hamu hu' mwene wav'age ise wamwa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />V'enav'a hu' v'ana v'adatu' v'amwa Nowa, na ku' v'enav'o v'antu' v'ingi'haga mu welelo. <verse eid="GEN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Mweni'ki'li' Nowa wav'age muli'mi, wav'aga muntu' wa kwandya ku'hamba mizabibu. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, wanywaga malwa ga muzabibu, na wakolwaga. Haho walalaga du'u'hu' mu ihema. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Hamu, ise wamwa Kanaani, wayi'wonaga du'u'hu' yamwa ise, nawe wafumaga ha ibala na ku'v'awi'la v'aku'lu'ye Shemu na Yafeti ati' sav'o ali' du'u'hu'. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Ali'vi v'aku'lu'ye v'enav'o v'asolaga mwenda, na v'agu'dimaga ku' mapembo v'ose v'av'i'li', haho v'ayaga ki'nsengelenyuma, na v'amukumbi'laga sav'o, ku'no minso gav'o v'alingile ku'ngi' ki'gele ku'du' v'amuwoneele sav'o.<verse eid="GEN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Nawe Nowa aho wakolokwaga ki'neneko, wizu'ki'laga na ku'manya gose ago mwane mudo wamuv'ezezyaga.<verse eid="GEN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />Haho wayombaga,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 9:25" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Afwizi'i'lwe Kanaani!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Akav'e musese muhanya wa v'adu'gu'ye.<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Akumu'kiwe Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wamwa Shemu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaani akav'e musese wamwa Shemu.<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Mulungu amongezye Yafeti,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Yafeti” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “kongezya.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">akav'e na wikalo wu'soga mugati' na makutu gamwa Shemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">sumbwa Kanaani akav'e musese wakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Yav'aga ku'fuma aho gamalaga minzi' ga kamilamasenga, Nowa wikalaga myaka zingi' magana adatu' na maku'mi atano. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Wikalo wakwe wose mu welelo, Nowa wikalaga myaka magana kenda na maku'mi atano, haho wagulalaga.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Wu'v'yalwa wamwa Nowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />I'yi' hu' mmola ya v'ana v'amwa Nowa na wu'v'yalwa wav'o. Ku'fuma aho yav'i'taga kamilamasenga, Shemu, Yafeti na Hamu haho v'apandi'kaga v'ana.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Yafeti v'av'age: Gomeli, Magogu, Madai, Yavani, Tubali, Mesheki na Tilasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Gomeli v'av'age: Ashikenazi, Lifati na Togama. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Yavani v'av'age: Elisha, Talishishi, Kitimu na Dodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Ku'fumi'i'la ku' wu'v'yalwa wamwa Yavani, v'antu' v'asambalaga ku' mpwani mu nsi' zyav'o, ki'la v'ene na ki'yombele chav'o, magongo gav'o na makabi'la gav'o.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Hamu v'av'age: Kushi, Misili, Putu na Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Kushi v'av'age: Seba, Havila, Sabuta, Laama na Sabuteka. V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Laama v'av'age: Sheba na Dedani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Hangi' Kushi wapandi'kaga mwana yu'ngi', lina lyakwe Nimulodi. Mwenu'yu' hu' wav'age mukowozi wa kwandya mu welelo. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwonaga ku'v'a ali' na wu'kowozi wu'hanya wa ku'v'enda ndimu. Ku'nguno yeni'yo v'antu' v'ali'yomba, “Muntu' mwenu'yu' ali' ki'ti' Nimulodi, mukowozi muhanya wa ku'v'enda ndimu ha mbele ya minso gamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.”<verse eid="GEN 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Mbu'ki' ya wu'temi wakwe walamuli'laga ku' kaya zya Babele, Eleki, Akadi na Kaline mu lwandi' lwa Shinali. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Nimulodi aho wafumaga kwenu'ko, wasami'laga ku' lwandi' lwa Ashulu, nako wazyengaga kaya zya Ninawi, Lehoboti-ili, Kala <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />na Leseni, hu' yav'age hagati' ya Ninawi na Kala, na lyeni'lo hu' li'kaya ihanya.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Misili wav'age sav'o lya V'aludi, V'aanamu, V'alehabi, V'anafutuhi, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />V'apatulusi, V'akafutoli na V'akasuluhi, na v'enav'o hu' nfumi'i'lo ya V'afilisiti.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanaani wav'age ise wamwa Sidoni, muv'yalwa wakwe wa mbele, na Heti. <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />Hangi' hu' mwene gu'ku' wav'o na V'ayebusi, V'aamoli, V'agiligashi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />V'ahivi, V'aaliki, V'asini, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />V'aalivadi, V'asemali na V'ahamati. Ha itungo lya mbele magongo ga V'akanaani gasambalaga. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Lu'v'i'mbi' lwa V'akanaani lwandi'zyaga ku'fuma Sidoni ku' nzi'la ya Gelali mpaka Gaza, hangi' ku'v'i'ti'la nzi'la ya Sodoma, Gomola, Adima na Seboimu mpaka Lasha.<verse eid="GEN 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />V'enav'o hu' v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Hamu ku' magongo gav'o, viyombele vyav'o, makabi'la gav'o na nsi' zyav'o.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Shemu, muku'lu'ye na Yafeti, u'yo wav'age gu'ku' wa v'ana v'ose v'amwa Ebeli, wapandi'kaga v'ana. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Shemu v'av'age: Elamu, Ashulu, Alifakisadi, Ludi na Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Alamu v'av'age: Usi, Huli, Geteli na Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Alifakisadi wav'age ise wamwa Sela, na Sela wapandi'kaga mwana lina lyakwe Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Ebeli wapandi'kaga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'av'i'li'. Mwane wa mbele wamupaga lina Pelegi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Pelegi” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “kwigawu'la.”</char></note> ku'nguno ha itungo lyeni'lo welelo yasangwa yi'li'wigawu'la, na wa wu'v'i'li' witanagwe Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yokitani wapandi'kaga v'ana v'a ki'gosya: Alimodadi, Shelefu, Hasalimaweti, Yela, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadolamu, Uzali, Dikila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obali, Abimaeli, Sheba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofili, Havila na Yobabu. V'enav'o v'ose v'av'age v'ana v'amwa Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Wikalo wav'o wav'age ku'fuma ku' lwandi' lwa Mesha mpaka ku' Sefali ku' ngu'lu' zya mu ki'ya.<verse eid="GEN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />V'enav'o hu' v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Shemu ku' magongo gav'o, viyombele vyav'o, makabi'la gav'o na nsi' zyav'o.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />V'enav'o hu' magongo ga v'ana v'amwa Nowa, ku' wu'v'yalwa wav'o na makabi'la gav'o. Ku' v'enav'o v'antu' v'a ki'la kabi'la v'ingi'haga mu welelo ku'fuma aho yav'i'taga kamilamasenga.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Chamba cha Babele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Ha itungo lyeni'lo v'antu' v'ose mu welelo v'ayombage ki'yombele ki'mo du' na mihayo zyene zizyo.<figure style="fig" file="C-012.jpg" size="col" ref="11:9" /> <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />V'antu' v'enav'o aho v'asamagasamaga ku'fuma lwandi' lwa mu ki'ya, v'afikaga ku' lwandi' lwa Shinali, na kwenu'ko v'awonaga nsi' ngololoku, nav'o v'ikalaga kwenu'ko. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Haho v'iwi'laga ati', “Izi ku'v'ezye matofali ku'gatime moto visoga.” Hene v'av'age na matofali haki'mo na lami ku'leka mawe na wu'longo. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Haho v'ayombaga, “Ku'zyenge kaya na chamba cha ku'fika ku' ilunde, ki'gele ku'pandi'ke wu'kumalu'ku na ku'manyi'i'ka, ku'leke ku'sambala mu welelo yose.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wasookaga ki'gele awone i'yo kaya haki'mo na chamba i'cho v'ali'zyenga v'antu' v'enav'o. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Wayombaga “Nhana v'antu' v'enav'a v'ali' v'amo du' na ki'yombele ki'mo, nav'o v'alamulaga ku'v'ezya lyeni'li', gi'si' ki'la ndaka i'yo v'aku'loma yi'ku'gelani'la. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Haya niswe ku'sooke, ku'kav'asali'nkanie ki'yombele chav'o ki'gele v'aleke kwidegeleka v'av'o ku' v'av'o.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Hu' vyene Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'asambazyaga v'antu' v'enav'o mu welelo yose, na henanho v'alekaga ku'zyenga kaya yeni'yo. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo henanho v'ahitanaga “Babele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Babele” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “ku'sali'nkania.”</char></note>,” nguno henanho Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'asali'nkaniaga ki'yombele cha v'antu' mu welelo, na ku'fuma henanho wav'asambazyaga v'aye mu welelo yose.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu'v'yalwa wamwa Shemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />I'yi' hu' mmola yamwa Shemu na wu'v'yalwa wakwe. Ku'fuma aho yav'i'taga kamilamasenga, zyav'i'taga myaka iv'i'li', Shemu wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka igana li'mo, na wapandi'kaga mwana lina Alifakisadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Alifakisadi, Shemu wikalaga myaka magana atano. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Nawe Alifakisadi aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi adatu' na itano, wapandi'kaga mwana lina Sela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Sela, Alifakisadi wikalaga myaka magana ane na idatu'. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Nawe Sela aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi adatu' wapandi'kaga mwana lina Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Ebeli, Sela wikalaga myaka magana ane na idatu'. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Nawe Ebeli aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi adatu' na ine, wapandi'kaga mwana lina Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Pelegi, Ebeli wikalaga myaka magana ane na maku'mi adatu'. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Nawe Pelegi aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi adatu', wapandi'kaga mwana lina Leu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Leu, Pelegi wikalaga myaka magana av'i'li' na kenda. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Nawe Leu aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi adatu' na iv'i'li', wapandi'kaga mwana lina Selugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Selugi, Leu wikalaga myaka magana av'i'li' na mupungati'. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Nawe Selugi aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi adatu', wapandi'kaga mwana lina Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Naholi, Selugi wikalaga myaka magana av'i'li'. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Nawe Naholi aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi av'i'li' na kenda, wapandi'kaga mwana lina Tela. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Ku'fuma aho wav'yalagwa Tela, Naholi wikalaga myaka igana li'mo na iku'mi na kenda. Mugati' na myaka zyeni'zyo wapandi'kaga hangi' v'ana v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Nawe Tela aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi mupungati', wapandi'kaga mwana wa mbele lina Abulamu, hangi' wapandi'kaga Naholi na Halani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu'v'yalwa wamwa Tela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />I'yi' hu' mmola yamwa Tela na wu'v'yalwa wakwe, ise wamwa Abulamu, Naholi na Halani. Halani hu' ise wamwa Loto. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Halani wamutongelelaga ise Tela ku'gulala kwenu'ko ku' kaya ya Ulu ku' lwandi' lwa V'akalidayo, u'ko wav'yali'lwa. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Yav'aga mugati' na kwikala kwav'o kwenu'ko Abulamu na Naholi v'atoolaga v'aki'ma. Muki' wamwa Abulamu witanagwe Salai, na muki' wamwa Naholi witanagwe Milika, u'yo wav'age na muku'lu'ye lina lyakwe Iska. V'ose v'av'i'li' v'av'age v'aniki' v'amwa Halani. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Ali'vi Salai wav'age mugu'mba, na ali' wu'du'hu' mwana.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Lyafikaga itungo Tela wamusolaga Abulamu, haki'mo na muki' wamwa Abulamu, Salai, na mwizu'ku'lu' wakwe Loto u'yo wav'age mwana wa mwana wakwe Halani, v'awu'kaga v'ose ku'fuma ku' kaya ya Ulu ku' lwandi' lwa V'akalidayo. V'alomaga ku'ya ku' nsi' ya Kanaani, ali'vi aho v'afikaga ku' kaya ya Halani v'ikalaga kwenu'ko. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tela wagulalaga kwenu'ko ku' Halani, na wasangwa ali' na musimo gwa myaka magana av'i'li' na itano.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Lwito lwamwa Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Abulamu, “Wu'ka u'fume mu nsi' i'yi' wikalile, u'v'aleke v'adu'gu'yo na mugana gwamwa so, u'ye ku' lwandi' u'lo ndaku'lagi'le.<verse eid="GEN 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Nanne ndaku'v'ezye ev'e ku'v'a nsi' nhanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:2">ndaku'dosye na ku'li'kumalu'sya lina lyako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:2">ki'gele u'v'e lu'v'ango ku' v'angi'.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Ndav'adosye av'o v'alaku'dosye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">ndav'afwizi'i'le av'o v'alaku'tyomokele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">na ku' wako magongo gose ga mu welelo galadosiwe.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Hu' vyene Abulamu wawu'kaga ku' kaya yeni'yo ya Halani ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga. Itungo lyeni'lo wasangwa wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi mupungati' na itano. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Abulamu wamusolaga Salai muki' wakwe haki'mo na Loto mwana wa muyagi mudu'gu'ye, na v'akumba av'o v'av'apandi'kile kwenu'ko, haki'mo na nsawo zyav'o zyose i'zyo v'av'age nazyo ku' Halani, nav'o v'ayu'mbaga ku'ya ku' nsi' ya Kanaani na v'afikaga kwenu'ko. <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abulamu haki'mo na mugana gwakwe v'av'i'taga hagati' na Kanaani, nav'o v'afikaga ha lwandi' u'lo hav'age na muti' muhanya gwa mwaloni u'go gwav'age ku' Mole, bi'hi' na kaya ya Shekemu. Ha itungo lyeni'lo V'akanaani hu' v'av'age v'ikazi v'a nsi' yeni'yo.<verse eid="GEN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwifumi'i'laga Abulamu na wamuwi'laga ati', “V'av'yalwa v'ako ndav'ape nsi' yeni'yi'.” Nawe Abulamu aho wigagwa vyeni'vyo wamuzyengelaga Gu'ku' Mulungu ihozezyo, ku'nguno yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo wamwifumi'i'laga.<verse eid="GEN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Ku'fuma kwenu'ko Abulamu walondaga ku' ngu'lu' zya lwandi' lwa mu ki'ya ya kaya ya Beteli, na wazyengaga nkambi' yakwe. Beteli yav'age lwandi' lwa mu mweli na Ai yav'age lwandi' lwa mu ki'ya. Kwenu'ko nako wamuzyengelaga Gu'ku' Mulungu ihozezyo na ku'mwisenga ku' lina lyakwe. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Haho Abulamu wendeleyaga na musi'nzo ku'ya ku' lwandi' lwa dakama mu ibalangu' lya Negebu.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abulamu mu nsi' ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Ha itungo lyeni'lo yasangwa yagwa nzala ndaki ku' lwandi' lwenu'lo, nawe Abulamu yamudimaga ku'ya ku' lwandi' lwa dakama ku' nsi' ya Misili, ku'kikala ha itungo lyeni'lo lya nzala. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Aho wegelaga kwingi'la mu nsi' ya Misili wamuwi'laga muki' wakwe Salai, “Degeleka, manyile ku'v'a u'li' muki'ma musoga na wa kwiv'elelwa. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />U'lu' v'aku'wone V'amisili v'aku'yomba, ‘U'yu' ali' muki' wakwe,’ haho v'aku'mbu'laga, sumbwa ev'e v'aku'ku'leka u'li' mupanga. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo u'v'awi'le ati', ene ni' ilu'mbu'yo, ki'gele mpandi'ke wu'soga haki'mo na wu'zuwu'ku wanne viv'e ku'nguno yako.”<verse eid="GEN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Aho Abulamu wafikaga ku' Misili, V'amisili v'amuwonaga Salai ku'v'a ali' muki'ma musoga muno. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />V'ahanya v'a hamwa Falao<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina Falao li'li' isumbi' lya wu'temi ku' Misili.</char></note>, mutemi wa Misili, aho v'amuwonaga Salai, v'amukumi'li'zyaga ku' mutemi wav'o. Haho Salai wafilagwa ku' iku'lu'. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Ku'nguno yamwa Salai, Falao wamuv'ezezyaga Abulamu wu'soga. Wamupaga ng'ombe, nkolo, mbu'li, mpunda, ntwangawu'lende na v'akumba v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wamutusyaga Falao na v'antu' v'a mu lu'go lwakwe v'ose ku' malwile mahanya ku'nguno ya ku'musola Salai, muki' wamwa Abulamu. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Haho Falao wamwitanaga Abulamu na ku'muwu'zya, “Wambezezyaga ki'? Ku' ki' u'kambwi'lile ati' Salai ali' muki' wako? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Ku' ki' wayombile ati', ali' ilu'mbu'yo, ninga waleka namusola av'e muki' wanne? Haya musole muki' wako u'hafume henanha!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Hangi' mutemi Falao wav'alagi'li'zyaga v'antu' v'akwe ku'mufili'li'zya Abulamu na muki' wakwe, na vintu' vyose i'vyo wav'age navyo.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Ku'lekana kwamwa Abulamu na Loto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Haho Abulamu waku'fumaga ku' nsi' ya Misili na wasu'v'aga ku' ibalangu' lya Negebu haki'mo na muki' wakwe na vintu' vyav'o vyose i'vyo v'av'age navyo, hangi' Loto wayaga nav'o. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Ha itungo lyeni'lo Abulamu wasangwa musav'i muno wa mitugo, na mawe ga mupango ga feza na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Ku'fuma kwenu'ko ku' Negebu Abulamu wawu'kaga musi'nzo ku'ya ku' mbele mpaka wafikaga ku' kaya ya Beteli, u'ko wav'age atu'u'lile nkambi' yakwe ha mbu'ki', hagati' na kaya ya Beteli na Ai. <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />Henanho hu' hene wav'age azyengile ihozezyo ku'fuma ha mbu'ki', na henanho Abulamu wamwisengaga Gu'ku' Mulungu ku' lina lyakwe.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Nawe Loto u'yo wawu'kaga musi'nzo haki'mo na Abulamu, wav'age na madale ga ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li, haki'mo na mahema. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Ku'nguno ya wingi wa mitugo zyav'o, lwandi' lwenu'lo lwalekaga ku'v'agelani'la kwikala haki'mo v'ose v'av'i'li'. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo lyawu'kaga isola mugati' na v'adi'mi v'a mitugo zyamwa Abulamu na zyamwa Loto. Hangi' mu itungo lyeni'lo V'akanaani na V'apelizi v'av'age v'ikazi v'a mwenu'mo.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Ali'vi Abulamu wamuwi'laga Loto, “Ku'du' ku'v'e na isola mugati' yanne nanho, ninga ku' v'adi'mi v'iswe, ku'nguno iswe ku'li' v'a wu'du'gu'. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Lolaga lwandi' lose lwenu'lu'. Ku'lekane. U'lu' ev'e u'ku'londa ku' mumoso ene nku'londa ku' mulyi'la, na u'lu' u'ku'londa ku' mulyi'la ene nku'londa ku' mumoso.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Loto wawu'syaga minso gakwe, na ku'wona iwonde lya mongo gwa Yolodani i'vi li'li' na minzi' mingi. Ku'ya mpaka kaya ya Soali wawonaga ati' li'li' na wu'soga wa minzi' mingi ki'ti' mugu'nda gwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, na ki'ti' nsi' ya Misili. Yeni'yi' yav'age aho Gu'ku' wav'age akaali' ku'zizimangu'zya kaya zya Sodoma na Gomola.<verse eid="GEN 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo Loto wisogolelaga iwonde lya mongo gwa Yolodani, na walondaga kwenu'ko ku' lwandi' lwa mu ki'ya. Hu' vyene yav'aga ku'lekana kwav'o.<verse eid="GEN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abulamu wasigalaga mu lwandi' lwa Kanaani, sumbwa Loto wayaga ku'kikala ku' kaya zya iwonde lyeni'lo, na wazyengaga nkambi' yakwe bi'hi' na Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Ali'vi v'antu' v'a kaya ya Sodoma v'av'age v'akenagu'zi muno ha mbele na minso gamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu ali'mulagana Abulamu ku'mupa nsi'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Yav'aga aho Loto wawu'kaga, Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Abulamu ati', “Ku'fumi'i'la henanho u'li' wu'syaga minso gako u'lole ki'la lwandi', ki'ya na mweli, sukuma na dakama. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Nsi' yose yeni'yi' u'yi'wine nku'ku'pa ev'e na wu'v'yalwa wako yi'v'e yinywe nhananhana. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Wu'v'yalwa wako nku'wu'v'ezya wu'v'e wingi ki'ti' lu'wuwu lwa nsi', ki'ti' i'vi muntu' akakowola ku'lu'solozya hu' vyene wu'v'yalwa wako ku'du'hu' u'yo alakowole ku'wu'solozya. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Gi'si' wu'ka u'yi'yu'mbi'le nsi' yeni'yi' ku' wu'gali'nhu wayo na wu'lihu wayo, nguno nku'ku'pa ev'e.”<verse eid="GEN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Haho Abulamu wasamyaga mahema gakwe, na wayaga ku'kikala ku' kaya ya Hebuloni bi'hi' na miti' mihanya zyamwa Mamule, na kwenu'ko wamuzyengelaga Gu'ku' Mulungu ihozezyo.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Loto ali'sampwa na ku'komolwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Ha itungo lyeni'lo kwav'age na idale li'mo lya v'atemi v'ane: Amulafeli mutemi wa ku' Shinali, Alioko mutemi wa ku' Elasali, Kedolaoma mutemi wa ku' Elamu na Tidali mutemi wa ku' Goimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />v'ose ku' haki'mo v'ayaga ku'kalasana wu'lu'gu' na idale lya wu'v'i'li' lya v'atemi v'atano: Bela mutemi wa ku' Sodoma, Bilisha mutemi wa ku' Gomola, Shinabu mutemi wa ku' Adima, Shemebeli mutemi wa ku' Seboimu na mutemi wa ku' Bela. Lina li'ngi' lya Bela hu' Soali. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />V'ose v'agasangyaga madale gav'o ga v'asilikale ku' haki'mo ku' Iwonde lya Sidimu, ku' lina li'ngi' Iwonde lya Nyanza ya Munyu. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />I'li' idale lya v'enav'a v'atemi v'atano v'av'ezyaga vyeni'vyo ku'nguno ku' itungo lya myaka iku'mi na iv'i'li' v'av'age v'atemilwe na mutemi Kedolaoma, ali'vi ha mwaka gwa iku'mi na idatu' v'amutalaga. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Mwaka gwa iku'mi na ine Kedolaoma na v'atemi v'iye, av'o v'a idale lya v'atemi v'ane, v'ayaga ku'kigu'ma wu'lu'gu' na idale lyeni'li' lya v'atemi v'atano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 14:5">Aho wav'age akaali' ku'lasana wu'lu'gu' nav'o, mutemi Kedolaoma haki'mo na v'atemi v'iye v'ayaga mbela ku'kigu'ma wu'lu'gu' na ku'v'akinda V'alefai ku' Ashitaloti-kalinaimu, V'azuzi ku' Hamu, V'aemi ku' Shawe-kiliataimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />na V'aholi v'a ku' ngu'lu' zyav'o zya Seili. V'av'apeezyaga mpaka ku' El-palani, ku' ndugo ya ibalangu'. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Haho v'asu'v'aga ku' nnuma, na v'afikaga ku' En-mishipati, lina li'ngi' hu' Kadeshi, v'avikindaga vyalo vyose vya V'aamaleki, na V'aamoli av'o v'av'age v'ikazi v'a Hasason-tamali.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Haho v'atemi av'o v'ane v'a Sodoma, Gomola, Adima, Seboimu, na Bela, lina li'ngi' Soali, v'awonaga v'iv'ange wu'lu'gu' kwenu'ko ku' iwonde lya Sidimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />ki'gele v'alasane wu'lu'gu' na Kedolaoma mutemi wa Elamu, Tidali wa Goimu, Amulafeli wa Shinali, na Alioko wa Elasali. Wav'age wu'lu'gu' wa v'atemi v'ane ku' v'atemi v'atano. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Nsi' ya Iwonde lya Sidimu yav'age na miina mingi ago gokalile lami, nav'o v'atemi v'a Sodoma na Gomola aho v'apeelaga wu'lu'gu', v'amo v'adumbu'ki'laga mu miina genago na v'angi' v'apeelelaga mu ngu'lu'. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />V'enav'o v'atemi v'ane aho v'akindaga v'asampaga nsawo zyose zya kaya zya Sodoma na Gomola haki'mo na viliwa vyav'o vyose, haho v'awu'kaga ku'ya ku' wav'o. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />V'amusampaga na Loto, mwana wa mudu'gu'ye na Abulamu, u'yo wav'age mwikazi wa Sodoma, v'ayaga nawe haki'mo na nsawo zyakwe.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Muntu' yu'mo watyegaga na wamufili'laga mmola Abulamu, Muebulania, itungo lyeni'lo wav'age mwikazi wa bi'hi' na miti' mihanya zyamwa Mamule, Muamoli, u'yo wav'age mudu'gu'ye na Eshikoli na Aneli. V'ose v'av'age na lu'sangi' na Abulamu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Abulamu aho wigagwa mmola ku'v'a mwana wa mudu'gu'ye wasampagwa, wav'av'ilingaga v'antu' magana adatu' na iku'mi na munane av'o v'av'yali'lilwe ha wakwe na v'ahembekilwe kwigu'ma wu'lu'gu', haho v'av'alondaga v'anisi mpaka ku' kaya ya Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Ha wu'ziku', Abulamu wagagawu'laga madale ga v'asilikale ki'gele v'av'agwi'li'le v'anisi v'av'o. Nav'o v'av'agu'maga, v'av'akindaga, na ku'v'apeezya mpaka ku' kaya ya Hoba, ku' sukuma ya kaya ya Damasiko. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Haho Abulamu wasu'v'yaga nsawo zyose zya Sodoma na Gomola i'zyo ndi' zyasampwa na v'anisi, na wamusu'v'yaga Loto, mwana wa mudu'gu'ye, na nsawo zyakwe haki'mo na v'aki'ma na v'antu' v'angi'.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Melikizedeki ali'mudosya Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Abulamu aho wasu'v'aga ku'fuma ku' wu'lu'gu' na ku'mukinda mutemi Kedolaoma haki'mo na v'atemi v'iye, mutemi wa Sodoma wafumaga ku'kamusu'mbi'la ku' Iwonde lya Shawe, lina li'ngi' Iwonde lya Mutemi. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Haho Melikizedeki mutemi wa kaya ya Salemu, u'yo wav'age muhozya wa Mulungu wa ha igu'lya muno, waletaga mugate na ki'neneko. <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />Haho wamudosyaga ku' ku'yomba,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 14:19" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:19">“Abulamu adosiwe na Mulungu wa ha igu'lya muno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:19">Matunda wa ilunde na welelo.<verse eid="GEN 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Na akumu'kiwe Mulungu wa ha igu'lya muno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 14:20">u'yo wav'atu'u'laga v'anisi v'ako mu makono gako.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 14:20" />
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 14:20">Nawe Abulamu wamupaga Melikizedeki ifungu lya iku'mi lya vintu' i'vyo wasampaga ku' wu'lu'gu'.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Haho Mutemi wa Sodoma wamuwi'laga Abulamu, “Mpage v'antu' v'anne, ali'vi nsawo zyeni'zyo zyose u'sole ev'e mweni'ki'li'.” <verse eid="GEN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Sumbwa Abulamu wasu'v'yaga, “Nu'wu'sya mukono gwanne na ku'lahi'la ku' lina lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu wa ha igu'lya muno, matunda wa ilunde na welelo, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />nkav'ile ku'sola wu'zi, ninga mukov'a gwa ki'latu' ninga ki'ntu' ki'mo cha ku' wako, ku'du' wize wifune ati' wakansav'ya. <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Nkav'ile ku'sola ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo sumbwa du' i'vyo v'antu' v'anne v'alile. Hangi' Aneli, Eshikoli na Mamule, v'antu' av'o v'isangizye nanne ku' wu'lu'gu', v'apiwe ifungu ki'ti' i'vi yi'li'koov'iwa.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Ilagano lyamwa Mulungu ku'mwa Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Aho lyav'i'taga itungo, muhayo gwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu gwamwizi'i'laga Abulamu ki'ti' ndoti ati', “Abulamu! Ku'du' wogohe, ene ni' lu'hi'gi' lwako. Na wu'syokeziwa wako wu'lav'e wu'hanya muno.” <verse eid="GEN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Ali'vi Abulamu wayombaga, “Gu'ku' Mulungu ev'e Katema, u'ku'mpa ki' u'lu' ene nikalile ni' wu'du'hu' mwana, sumbwa mwenu'yu' Eliezeli, Mudamasiko, hu' mwene wa ku'nsaala? <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Lingaga! U'kandosizye ku'mpa mwana, sumbwa mukumba u'yo wav'yali'lilwe mu lu'go lwanne hu' mwene aku'v'a musaali'ki wanne!”<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Haho muhayo gwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu gwamwizi'i'laga ati', “Muntu' mwenu'yu' akasye aku'saale sumbwa mwana wa kwiv'yali'la ev'e mweni'ki'li' hu' mwene alaku'saale” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamufumyaga Abulamu ha ibala na wamuwi'laga, “Langami'la ku' ilunde na u'zisolozye nsonda u'lu' u'ku'kowola ku'zisolozya.” Wamuwi'laga, “I'vi Hu' vyene wu'lav'e wingi wa wu'v'yalwa wako.”<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Hohene Abulamu wamusani'zyaga Gu'ku' Mulungu, nawe Mulungu wamuv'azi'zyaga Abulamu ku'v'a ali' wa lole.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Haho wamuwi'laga, “Ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo naku'fumizye ku' kaya ya Ulu ya V'akalidayo, ki'gele nku'pe nsi' yeni'yi' yi'v'e isaalo lyako.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Ali'vi Abulamu wawu'zyaga, “Gu'ku' Mulungu ev'e Katema, nku'manya vihe ati' nku'yi'saala nsi' yeni'yi'?” <verse eid="GEN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga, “Ndetele ndogosa ya ng'ombe, ng'ondi na mbu'li nki'ma, ki'la ki'mo ki'v'e cha myaka idatu', haki'mo na ipu'u'la na ikune lya nkunda.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Abulamu wamuletelaga vyose, wayi'tandu'laga ki'la ndimu mav'ale av'i'li', wagatu'u'laga ki'la li'mo li'lole ku' liye, sumbwa tu'noni twene akatu'tandu'lile. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Yav'aga manoni malyanyama aho gademaga ha igu'lya na malimbo ki'gele galye, Abulamu wagapeezyaga.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Ha itungo lya ku'loka lyu'v'a, tu'lo tu'timbu twamuv'i'ti'laga Abulamu, kasinaga giti nhanya ya kogohya yamukumbaga. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Yi'li'ku'dima u'manye ku'v'a wu'v'yalwa wako v'alikale ku' nsi' ya wu'geni ki'ti' v'ageni v'izi'li'zi, nav'o v'alav'e v'asese na v'alatukiwe kwenu'ko ku' itungo lya myaka magana ane. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Ali'vi nsi' yeni'yo i'yo v'alayi'tu'mami'le ki'ti' v'asese, ndayi'pe lu'duko, nav'o v'alafume na nsawo nyingi. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Sumbwa ev'e u'ku'v'a na wikalo wu'lihu, u'lafwe na ku'hola, na u'lazyi'kwe visoga. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Mu v'av'yalwa v'ako, wu'v'yalwa wa wu'ne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wu'v'yalwa wa wu'ne ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo ki'ti' myaka magana ane.</char></note> hu' wene wu'lasu'v'e henanha, ku'nguno wu'kenagu'zi wa V'aamoli, v'ikazi v'a henanha, wu'kaali' ku'gelani'la.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Aho lyu'v'a lyalokaga na giti kwingi'la, kasinaga lyafumi'i'laga ki'ti' lyavya lya lyonsi na ilambi' lya moto na ku'v'i'ta hagati' na viv'alango vya nyama zyeni'zyo. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Lu'siku' lwenu'lo, Gu'ku' Mulungu waki'ndi'kaga ilagano na Abulamu ku' ku'muwi'la, “Wu'v'yalwa wako nav'apaga nsi' yeni'yi', ku'fumi'i'la ha mongo gwa Misili mpaka ku' mongo muhanya gwa Efulate. <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />Nav'apaga nsi' ya V'akeni, V'akenizi, V'akadimoni, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />V'ahiti, V'apelizi, V'alefai, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />V'aamoli, V'akanaani, V'agiligashi na V'ayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Ku'v'yalwa kwamwa Isumaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Ha itungo lyeni'lo Salai, muki' wamwa Abulamu, wav'age akaali' ku'muv'yali'la mwana, ali'vi wav'age ikalile na muzya Mumisili, lina lyakwe witanagwe Hajili. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Hohene, Salai wamuwi'laga Abulamu, “Degeleka, Gu'ku' Mulungu wanimile wu'v'yazi, gi'si' nu'ku'lomba yaga u'kalale na muzya wanne. Hamo nu'pandi'ka wu'v'yalwa ku'fuma ku' wakwe.” Abulamu wazumani'zyaga wu'yombe wamwa Salai.<verse eid="GEN 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Yav'aga aho Abulamu wikalaga myaka iku'mi mu nsi' ya Kanaani, Salai muki' wakwe wamusolaga muzya wakwe Hajili, Mumisili, na wamupaga Abulamu mugosi av'e isuli'la wakwe.<verse eid="GEN 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Abulamu walalaga na Hajili, nawe Hajili wapandi'kaga mwitungo. Aho wamanyaga ku'v'a ali' na mwitungo walamulaga ku'muv'engelezya Salai mammaye. <verse eid="GEN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Haho Salai wamuwi'laga Abulamu, “Wu'v'i u'wu' nu'pandi'ka, wu'v'e ku' wako. Ene naku'pile muzya wanne, ali'vi aho wamanyaga ku'v'a ali' na mwitungo walamulaga ku'mbengelezya. Gu'ku' Mulungu ayangu'le hagati' yako nanne!” <verse eid="GEN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Nawe Abulamu wamuwi'laga Salai, “Lingaga, u'yu' ali' muzya wako, muv'ezezye i'vyo u'koov'ile ev'e.” Haho Salai wamutusyaga Hajili mpaka wamupeelaga.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Haho Malaika wamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwizi'i'laga Hajili ku' kasela ka minzi' ha ibalangu'. Kasela kenako kav'age kali' bi'hi' na nzi'la ya ku'ya ku' Shuli. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Malaika wamuwu'zyaga, “Hajili ev'e muzya wamwa Salai, u'fumi'i'lile ku'he na u'yile ku'he?” Nawe wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nu'mupeela mamma wanne Salai.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Haho Malaika wamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Hajili, “Su'v'aga ku'mwa Salai mammayo u'kitunie ku' wakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Hangi' wayombaga ati', “Ndav'ingi'hye v'av'yalwa v'ako muno, av'o v'alaleke ku'kowoleka ku'v'azyi'ka.” <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Hangi' wamuwi'laga,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 16:11" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:11">“Lingaga, u'li' na mwitungo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:11">na u'ku'v'yala mwana wa ki'gosya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:11">U'lamupe lina Isumaili,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Isumaili” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “Mulungu ali'wigwa.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:11">ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu wigagwa ki'li'lo cha lu'duko lwako.<verse eid="GEN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Isumaili alikale ki'ti' ndu'lu'<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Ki'ti' ndu'lu'” nguno yayo yi'li' muntu' u'yo alikome na v'antu' na kwikala ku' ibalangu'. </char></note>.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:12">Alav'e na wanisi na ki'la muntu', na ki'la muntu' alav'e na wanisi nawe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 16:12">Alav'e na wu'kofu ku' v'adu'gu' v'akwe.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Haho Hajili wamupaga lina Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo wayombaga nawe ati', “Ev'e u'li' Mulungu wa Ku'wona,” ku'nguno wiganikaga ati', “Nhana henanha namuwonaga u'yo ali'mbona.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Hu' i'cho chav'ezya lwinzi' lwenu'lo lwitanwe “Beeli-lahai-loi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Beeli-lahai-loi” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “Lwinzi' lwa Muzuwu'ku U'yo Ali'mbona.”</char></note>.” Lingaga, lwinzi' lwenu'lo lu'li' hagati' ya Kadeshi na Beledi.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Haho Hajili wamuv'yali'laga Abulamu mwana wa ki'gosya, wamupaga lina Isumaili. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Ha itungo lyamwa Hajili ku'muv'yala Isumaili, Abulamu wasangwa ali' na musimo gwa myaka maku'mi munane na mukaga.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">Lu'manyi'lo lwa ilagano ku'mwa Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Yav'aga aho Abulamu wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi kenda na kenda, Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwifumi'i'laga na ku'yomba, “Ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu wa Nguzu, u'londe nzi'la yanne u'v'e mugololoku wa moyo, <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />ki'gele nanne nki'ndi'ke ilagano lyanne nanho, na nku'wingi'hya wu'v'yalwa wako muno.”<verse eid="GEN 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Haho Abulamu wamusukambi'laga Mulungu na ku'muku'v'i'i'la, nawe Mulungu wamuwi'laga, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“I'li' hu' ilagano lyanne nanho, ev'e u'lav'e v'av'a wa makabi'la mingi. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Ku'fuma walelo u'kasye witanwe hangi' Abulamu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Abulamu” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “v'av'a wa lu'kumo.” </char></note> sumbwa lina lyako u'ku'v'a Abalahamu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Abalahamu” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “v'av'a wa v'ingi.”</char></note> ku'nguno naku'v'ezyaga u'v'e v'av'a wa makabi'la mingi. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Ndaku'v'ezye u'v'e na wu'v'yalwa wingi muno, na ku'fumi'i'la ku' wako galafumi'i'le makabi'la mingi na v'atemi. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Ilagano lyanne nku'li'v'ezya li'v'e lya nhananhana, mugati' yanne nanho na wu'v'yalwa wako haki'mo na wu'v'yalwa u'wo wu'lalonde ku' wav'o, na nku'v'a Mulungu wako na Mulungu wav'o. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Hangi' ndaku'pe ev'e na wu'v'yalwa wako nsi' ya Kanaani yose i'yi' wikalile ki'ti' mugeni mwizi'li'zi, ki'gele muyi'teme nhananhana, nanne ndav'e Mulungu wav'o.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Haho Mulungu wamuwi'laga Abalahamu, “Ev'e na wu'v'yalwa wako haki'mo na wu'v'yalwa u'wo wu'lalonde ku' wav'o, muli'dime ilagano lyanne. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />I'li' hu' ilagano lyanne i'lo muku'li'dima mugati' yanne na inywe, ev'e haki'mo na wu'v'yalwa wako: Ki'la mugosya wa ku' winywe yi'ku'mudima ku'tahiliwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Muv'e muli'tahiliwa, na lyeni'li' igambo hu' li'ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa ilagano mugati' yanne na inywe. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Ki'la mwana wa ki'gosya mu wu'v'yalwa wako u'yo alav'yalwe na ku'fikya nsiku' munane, yi'lamudime ku'tahiliwa, av'e mukumba wako u'yo av'yali'lilwe ha wako ninga wa ku'gu'la ku' hela ku'fuma ku' mugeni u'yo akav'ile wa wu'v'yalwa wako. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Wa ku'v'yali'lwa mu lu'go lwako, na wa ku'gu'la ku' hela, nhana yi'lamudime ku'tahiliwa. I'vi hu' vyene ilagano lyanne lya nhananhana li'lav'e ku' miv'i'li' zinywe na lwenu'lo hu' lu'lav'e lu'manyi'lo. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Ki'la mugosya u'yo alav'e akatahiv'ilwe, muntu' mwenu'yo alakomwe ku'le na v'antu' v'akwe ku'nguno alav'e wali'v'i'nza ilagano lyanne”.<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu ali'mulagana Abalahamu ku'pandi'ka mwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Haho Mulungu wamuwi'laga hangi' Abalahamu, “Ku' lwandi' lwa muki' wako Salai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Sala” na “Salai” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno ya mina genaga av'i'li' yi'li' “mwaniki' wa mutemi.” </char></note> u'leke ku'mwitana lina lyakwe Salai, ku'nguno lina lyakwe aku'v'a Sala. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Nanne nku'mudosya, nawe alaku'v'yali'le mwana wa ki'gosya. Hangi' ndamudosye nawe alav'e mayu' wa makabi'la mingi, na v'atemi v'a makabi'la mingi v'alafumi'i'le ku' wakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Haho Abalahamu wasukambaga na ku'muku'v'i'i'la, sumbwa wasekaga na wiganikaga mu moyo gwakwe ati' “Yi'ku'kowoleka vihe muntu' wa myaka igana li'mo ku'v'yala mwana? Hangi' Sala ali' na myaka maku'mi kenda alakowole ku'v'yala mwana?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Hohene Abalahamu wamulombaga Mulungu ati', “Yali' yi'li' visoga u'zumye Isumaili asole lu'v'ango lwako lwenu'lu'.”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Haho Mulungu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Yi'kav'ile vyeni'vyo, ku'nguno muki' wako Sala alaku'v'yali'le mwana wa ki'gosya, nanho u'lamwitane lina lyakwe Isaka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Isaka” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “ali'seka”.</char></note> Nanne ndaki'ndi'ke ilagano lyanne ku' wakwe haki'mo na wu'v'yalwa wakwe u'wo wu'lalonde ku' wakwe nhananhana.<verse eid="GEN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />“Ku' lwandi' lwamwa Isumaili, nakwigagwa ku'lomba kwako, nawe nku'mudosya, av'e na wu'v'yalwa wingi na nku'mwingi'hya muno. Alav'e sav'o lya v'atemi iku'mi na v'av'i'li'. Nanne ndamuv'ezye ku'v'a nsi' nhanya. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Ali'vi ilagano lyanne i'lo ndaki'ndi'ke ku'mwa Isaka, u'yo alaku'v'yali'le Sala muki' wako mu itungo lya ki'ti' lyeni'li' mwakizo.”<verse eid="GEN 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Yav'aga aho Mulungu wamali'laga ku'yomba nawe, wamulekaga Abalahamu.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Nawe Abalahamu mu lu'siku' lwenu'lo, wamuputaga nyu'nzu' mwana wakwe Isumaili na wav'aputaga v'akumba v'akwe v'ose v'a ku'v'yali'lwa mu lu'go lwakwe, na v'ose av'o wav'agu'lile ku' hela, ki'ti' i'vyo Mulungu wamulagi'li'zyaga.<verse eid="GEN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Nawe Abalahamu aho ali'putwa nyu'nzu' yakwe, wasangwa ali' na musimo gwa myaka maku'mi kenda na kenda. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Sumbwa mwana wakwe Isumaili aho ali'putwa nyu'nzu' yakwe wasangwa ali' na musimo gwa myaka iku'mi na idatu'. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Lu'siku' lwene lu'lo Abalahamu na mwane Isumaili v'aputagwa nyu'nzu' zyav'o, <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />haki'mo na v'agosya v'ose v'a mu lu'go lwakwe, v'ose av'o v'av'yali'lilwe mu lu'go lwakwe na v'a ku'gu'la ku' hela ku'fuma ku' mugeni.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">Abalahamu ali'genihwa na v'amalaika v'adatu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Lu'siku' lu'mo mu lyu'v'a, ha itungo lya idu'ta, Abalahamu wav'age ikalile ha muzigo gwa ikutu lyakwe. Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwifumi'i'laga Abalahamu, bi'hi' na miti' mihanya zya Mamule. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Aho wawu'syaga minso gakwe, kasinaga wav'awonaga v'antu' v'adatu' v'i'mile katanalo hado ha mbele yakwe. Haho wav'apeelelaga ku'v'asu'mbi'la, na aho wav'afiki'i'laga wasungamaga ku' isima na ku'yomba, <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />“V'agu'ku' v'anne, ene mukumba winywe nu'mulomba, u'lu' napandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yinywe muleke ku'mbi'ti'i'la, sumbwa mudi'le mu lu'go lwanne. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Leka galetwe minzi' madoo, ki'gele mukuse magu'lu' ginywe v'ose na musuuhe ha mutaka gwa muti' gwenu'gu'. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Ku'nguno mwafikaga mu lu'go lwanne, itungo muku'v'a musuuhile nku'v'ezya ki'liwa ki'doo. Mulye, ki'gele mwidibe ku'ya na musi'nzo gwinywe.” Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga “Haya, v'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vi wayombaga.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Haho Abalahamu wangu'haga ku'su'v'a mu ikutu na ku'muwi'la muki' wakwe Sala ati', “V'ezya wangu' ngelo nhanya idatu' zya wu'fuma wu'nelezu, u'wu'kanye, na u'v'ezye migate.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Hangi' wangu'haga wangu' ku'ya ku' idale lya ng'ombe, wasogolaga ndogosa yi'mo nsoga na nnonu, wamupaga mukumba wakwe nawe wangu'haga ku'yi'si'nza na ku'yi'teka. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Aho ki'liwa chagelani'laga, Abalahamu wasolaga mbowoto, masyu'syu' na nyama yeni'yo, wav'atengelaga v'ageni v'enav'o. Aho v'av'aga v'ali'lya mweni'ki'li' wi'maga bi'hi' nav'o ha nsi'li'li' na muti'.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />V'ageni v'enav'o v'amuwu'zyaga Abalahamu, “Muki' wako Sala ali' ku'he?” Abalahamu wasu'v'yaga, “Ali' mu ikutu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Yu'mo mugati' nav'o wayombaga, “Nhana ndaku'su'v'i'le mu itungo ki'ti' lyeni'li' mwakizo, nawe Sala alav'e na mwana wa ki'gosya.” Itungo lyeni'lo Sala wav'age i'mile ha muzigo gwa ikutu i'lo lyav'age ku' mpi'ndo gwav'o, apu'li'ki'zizye. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Abalahamu na Sala v'asangwa v'akakiku'la, na mu ki'ti'le cha v'aki'ma Sala wav'age wapelile ku'v'yala. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Ali'vi Sala wisekelaga mu moyo gwakwe na ku'yomba, “Ene ni' mukiku'lu', na mugosi wanne mukiku'lu', nku'togeziwa vihe ku'lala nawe?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Henanho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwu'zyaga Abalahamu, “Ku' ki' Sala waseka na kwiwu'zya ati', ‘Yi'ku'kowoleka vihe ku'v'yala mwana ku' wu'kiku'lu' wanne?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Vihe, li'li'ho igambo ki' ilambu lya ku'mupota Gu'ku' Mulungu? Ndasu'v'e mu itungo ki'ti' lyeni'li' mwakizo, na Sala alav'e na mwana wa ki'gosya.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Ali'vi Sala ku'nguno ya kogoha wayombaga wu'fi ati', “Nkasekile!” Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga, “Ku'du' u'kaane wasekaga.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abalahamu ali'v'alombela v'ikazi v'a Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />V'ageni v'enav'o aho v'amali'laga ku'lya v'awu'kaga, nawe Abalahamu wav'afili'li'zyaga mpaka ha lwandi' lwa igu'lya u'lo v'akowolile ku'yi'wona kaya ya Sodoma.<verse eid="GEN 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wiganikaga, “Vihe, muv'ise Abalahamu igambo lya ndaka yanne i'yo nu'koov'a ku'v'ezya? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Ku'nguno mwenu'yu' alav'e sav'o lya nsi' nhanya na ya nguzu na ku' wakwe makabi'la gose ga mu welelo galadosiwe. <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Namusogolile mweni'ki'li' ki'gele av'ahembeke v'ana v'akwe na wu'v'yalwa wakwe ku'yi'londa nzi'la yanne, v'av'e v'atekanu na ku'v'ezya magambo ga lole ki'gele nanne mugelani'zi'zye ilagano lyanne ki'ti' i'vyo nayombile.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Abalahamu, “Ku'li' na ki'li'lo ki'hanya ku'nguno ya v'antu' v'a kaya zya Sodoma na Gomola, na wu'kenagu'zi wav'o wingi muno. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo nku'sooka ki'gele mbone u'lu' wu'kenagu'zi u'wo v'ali'v'ezya wu'gelani'lile na ki'li'lo i'cho chakansanga. U'lu' yi'kav'ile vyene nku'manya.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Mugati' na v'antu' v'enav'o, v'av'i'li' v'adimaga nzi'la ku'ya ku' Sodoma, ali'vi Abalahamu wasigalaga henanho i'mile haki'mo na Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="GEN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Nawe Abalahamu wamwegelaga Mulungu, na wamuwu'zyaga, “Nhana u'ku'v'azimangu'zya v'antu' v'a lole haki'mo na v'akenagu'zi? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Hamo v'akowolile ku'v'a v'ali'mo v'antu' maku'mi atano v'a lole mu kaya. Vihe, u'ku'yi'zimangu'zya ninga u'ku'leka wenge wa v'enav'o v'ali' mwenu'mo? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Nkav'ile kwiganika ku'v'a u'kowolile ku'v'ezya vyeni'vyo, ku'v'awu'laga v'antu' v'a lole haki'mo na v'akenagu'zi, v'a lole ku'v'a haki'mo na v'akenagu'zi! Ayi' ng'o! Muyangu'zi wa welelo akalekaga ku'v'ezya ga lole!” <verse eid="GEN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga ati', “U'lu' nasanga v'antu' maku'mi atano v'a lole mu kaya ya Sodoma, nku'leka ku'zimangu'zya kaya yose ku'nguno yav'o.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Abalahamu wayombaga hangi' ati', “Nagimaga ku'yomba nanho ev'e Gu'ku' wanne ninga i'vi ene ni' lu'wuwu na matunde du'. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Hamo v'akowolile kwigela v'antu' v'a lole maku'mi ane na v'atano, vihe, u'ku'yi'zimangu'zya ku'nguno v'angi'laga v'atano ku' av'o maku'mi atano?” Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga, “U'lu' nasanga v'enav'o v'a lole nku'leka ku'zimangu'zya.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Abalahamu walambaga ku'yomba hangi', “Hamo v'akowolile kwigela maku'mi ane mwenu'mo?” Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga, “Ku'nguno yav'o, nku'leka ku'zimangu'zya kaya.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Abalahamu walambaga ku'mwikonga, “Ev'e Gu'ku', ku'du' u'gaye, nu'yomba hangi', hamo v'akowolile kwigela v'antu' v'a lole maku'mi adatu'?” Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga, “Ku'nguno ya v'enav'o v'a lole nku'leka ku'v'ezya vyeni'vyo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Abalahamu wayombaga ati', “Nagimaga ku'yomba na Gu'ku' wanne, hamo v'akowolile kwigela v'antu' v'a lole maku'mi av'i'li'?” Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga, “Ku'nguno ya v'enav'o maku'mi av'i'li' nku'leka ku'zimangu'zya kaya.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Ndahi'lo Abalahamu wayombaga ati', “Ev'e Gu'ku', nakwikonga ku'du' u'gaye, sumbwa nu'yomba hangi' kamo du'. Vihe, u'lu' v'akowolile kwigela v'antu' v'a lole iku'mi yi'ku'v'a vihe?” Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga, “Ku'nguno ya v'enav'o iku'mi nku'leka ku'zimangu'zya kaya yeni'yo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamali'laga ku'yomba na Abalahamu, wahafumaga. Abalahamu nawe wasu'v'aga ku' lu'go lwakwe.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Wu'kenagu'zi wa v'antu' v'a Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Haho v'amalaika v'enav'o v'av'i'li' av'o v'afumaga ku'mwa Abalahamu, v'afikaga ku' kaya ya Sodoma mu lyu'v'a lya mpi'ndi'. Ha itungo lyeni'lo Loto wav'age ikalile bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa kaya, aho wav'awonaga wayaga ku'v'asu'mbi'la na ku'v'asukambi'la ku' isima. <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />Nawe wayombaga, “V'agu'ku' v'anne, nu'mulomba mwingi'le mu lu'go lwanne ene mukumba winywe, mukuse magu'lu' ginywe, mulale henanha. Haho ndiyu' muwu'ke muyile na musi'nzo gwinywe.” Ali'vi v'eni'ki'li' v'asu'v'yaga, “Ayi', iswe ku'ku'lala henanha ha isesa.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Ali'vi Loto wav'ikongaga muno ku'v'a v'ingi'le mu lu'go lwakwe, nav'o v'azumyaga. Haho Loto wav'atekelaga viliwa vingi na migate i'zyo zikatumba nav'o v'alyaga.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Yav'aga aho v'akaali' ku'lala, v'agosya v'ose v'a kaya ya Sodoma, v'asu'mbana na v'anamala, ku'fumi'i'la ki'la lwandi' v'izaga henanho na v'ayi'zyemaga nnumba yamwa Loto. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Nav'o v'amwitanaga Loto na ku'muwu'zya, “V'ali'he v'agosya av'o v'izaga henanha ha wako mpi'ndi' yeni'yi'? V'afumye ha ibala, ku'li'koov'a ku'lala nav'o.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Loto wafumaga ha ibala, na wagu'lugalaga muzigo ha nnuma yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />Haho wav'awi'laga, “V'adu'gu' v'anne nu'mulomba, muleke ku'v'ezya wu'kenagu'zi wenu'wo! <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Lingagi, mu lu'go lwanne ni'nav'o v'ana v'anne v'a ki'ki'ma v'av'i'li' av'o v'akaali' ku'manya mugosya. Lekagi mupe v'enav'o v'aniki' muv'av'ezye ki'ti' i'vi mutogilwe. Ali'vi v'antu' v'enav'a muleke ku'v'av'ezezya mav'i, ku'nguno yi'li'ndima ku'v'alanhana.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga, “Hafume hano! Ev'e wizile kwikala henanha ki'ti' mugeni, ku' ki' u'li'koov'a ku'v'a muyangu'zi wiswe? Ku'ku'ku'v'ezezya mav'i mahanya ku'ki'la v'ageni v'ako.” Hene haho v'alamulaga ku'mutenkela ku' nnuma na v'egelaga ku'gu'v'ela muzigo gwa nnumba yakwe.<verse eid="GEN 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Ali'vi v'ageni v'amwa Loto av'o v'av'age mu nnumba v'agololaga makono gav'o na ku'mudima Loto, v'amukweselaga mu nnumba, na ku'gu'lugala muzigo. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Hangi' v'av'ahofuzyaga v'antu' v'ose av'o v'av'age ha ibala, v'asu'mbana na v'anamala, nav'o v'atukaga ku'gu'koov'a muzigo, ali'vi v'akagu'wine hangi'.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Loto ali'peela mu Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />V'amalaika v'enav'o v'amuwu'zyaga Loto, “Vihe, u'li' na muntu' u'yo ali' wa bi'hi' nanho, ki'ti' v'ana v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma ninga v'akwi'li'ma? V'ose av'o u'li'nav'o mu kaya yeni'yi' v'afumye wangu'. <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />Ku'li' na ndaka ya ku'hazimangu'zya ku'nguno ki'li'lo i'cho chamufiki'i'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'li' ki'hanya muno ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wa v'ikazi v'a kaya yeni'yi'. Nawe waku'tu'maga ku'hazimangu'zye henanha.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Haho Loto wayaga ku'kav'awi'la v'alahwa v'a v'ana v'akwe ati', “Wu'kagi wangu' henanha, ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'yi'zimangu'zya kaya yeni'yi'!” Ali'vi v'eni'ki'li' v'amuwonaga ki'ti' muntu' u'yo ali'sekya mu minso gav'o.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Aho lyafikaga ikingilima, v'amalaika v'enav'o v'amwangu'hyaga Loto na ku'muwi'la ati', “V'ezya wangu', u'musole muki' wako na v'ana v'ako av'a v'aniki' v'av'i'li', ki'gele muleke ku'zimangu'ziwa aho kaya yeni'yi' yi'li'piwa lu'duko.”<verse eid="GEN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Loto wav'aga ali'wikendelezya ku'wu'ka. Ali'vi ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwonelaga ki'sa, v'amalaika v'enav'o v'amudimaga Loto makono gakwe na makono ga muki' wakwe na v'aniki' v'av'i'li' v'ana v'amwa Loto, v'av'afumyaga ha ibala na kaya ya Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Yav'aga aho v'afikaga ha ibala na kaya, malaika yu'mo wav'awi'laga, “Muyi'pi'zye myoyo yinywe, muleke kwikev'ela, ninga ku'du' mwi'me ninga hadoo mugati' na iwonde lyeni'lo! Peeleli ku' ngu'lu' ki'gele muleke ku'zimangu'ziwa.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Ali'vi Loto wasu'v'yaga, “Gu'ku' wanne, yi'kav'ile vyene! <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Yi'li' nhana ene mukumba winywe nawonelagwa ki'sa ha mbele ya minso ginywe, na inywe mwalagi'laga chelu' ki'hanya ku' wanne ku'nguno mwampi'zyaga na lu'fu, ali'vi nkakowola ku'peelela ku' ngu'lu' ku'nguno hakaali' katanalo. Mav'i genaga gaku'mpadi'ka nkaali' ku'fika kwenu'ko nanne nku'fwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Lingagi, aha bi'hi' yi'li'ho kaya ndo i'yo nkowolile ku'peelela. Yi'li' kaya ndo du'. Nu'mulomba mundeke mpeelele mwenu'mo, nanne nku'v'a na wu'panga mwenu'mo.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Nawe malaika wamuwi'laga, “Endita! Nazumyaga ku'lomba kwako, na kaya yeni'yo i'yo wayi'temulaga nku'leka ku'yi'zimangu'zya. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Ali'vi yi'li'ku'dima u'peelele mwenu'mo wangu', ku'nguno nkakowola ku'v'ezya ki'ntu' u'lu' u'ku'v'a u'kaali' ku'fika mwenu'mo.” Hu' nguno ya kaya yeni'yo kwitanwa Soali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhayo “Soali” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yago “hado”</char></note>.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu ali'zizimangu'zya kaya zya Sodoma na Gomola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Ha itungo lyamwa Loto ku'fika mu kaya yeni'yo ya Soali lyasangwa lyu'v'a lyadodomokaga. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wasosyaga moto mudaki gwa ki'biliti ku'fuma ku' ilunde ha igu'lya na kaya ya Sodoma na Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />Wazizimangu'zyaga kaya zyeni'zyo iv'i'li', iwonde lyose, v'ikazi v'ose v'a mwenu'mo na mimelo zyose.<verse eid="GEN 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Ha itungo lyeni'lo aho kaya zyeni'zyo zili'v'aka moto, muki' wamwa Loto wav'age amulondile mugosi ku' nnuma, haho wikev'elaga na hene haho wav'aga iwe lya munyu.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Yav'aga ha lu'siku' lwa wu'v'i'li' mu ikingilima, Abalahamu wasu'v'aga aho aki'i'mile haki'mo na Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Nawe walolaga ku' lwandi' lwa Sodoma na Gomola haki'mo na iwonde lyose lya kaya zyeni'zyo, haho wawonaga, kasinaga lyonsi itimbu li'liinile ku' ilunde ki'ti' lyonsi lya itanuli ihanya. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Yav'aga aho Mulungu ali'zizimangu'zya kaya zya mu iwonde, wamulawaga Abalahamu, ku' ku'mufumya Loto mu li'silanda lyeni'lo.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Loto na v'ana v'akwe av'o v'aniki'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Ali'vi Loto haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'ki'ma v'av'i'li' v'afumaga ku' Soali, v'aliinaga ku' ngu'lu' na v'ikalaga kwenu'ko ku'nguno v'ogohaga kwikala ku' Soali. V'ikalaga ku' ipilinga, mweni'ki'li' haki'mo na v'aniki' v'akwe v'av'i'li'.<verse eid="GEN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, u'yo mwaniki' muhanya wamuwi'laga muzunaye ati', “V'av'a wiswe wanamalu'kaga na u'ku' ku'li' ku'du'hu' mugosya wa ku'lala niswe, ki'ti' i'vi yi'li' ki'ti'le cha v'antu' v'ose mu welelo. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Yi'li'ku'dima iswe ku'mukozye malwa ga muzabibu, ki'gele ku'lale nawe haho ku'pandi'ke v'ana ku'v'i'ti'la ku' wakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Haho wu'ziku' wenu'wo v'amukozyaga sav'o malwa, na aho wakolwaga mwaniki' muhanya wayaga ku'kalala nawe. Ali'vi ise akamanyile ku'v'a alalile na mwana wakwe ninga aho wahafumaga henanho.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Yav'aga mu lu'siku' lwa wu'v'i'li', mwaniki' muhanya wamuwi'laga muzunaye ati', “Lingaga, wu'ziku' u'wu' wav'i'taga ene nalalaga na v'av'a. Ku'mukozye hangi' malwa, nanho u'kalale nawe ki'gele ku'pandi'ke v'ana na wu'v'yalwa ku'fuma ku' wakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Haho v'amukozyaga hangi' malwa sav'o, na wu'ziku' wenu'wo, mwaniki' mudo wayaga ku'kalala nawe. Ali'vi ise akamanyile ku'v'a alalile na mwane ninga aho wahafumaga henanho.<verse eid="GEN 19:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />I'vi hu' vyene v'aniki' v'enav'o v'ana v'amwa Loto v'apandi'kaga mwitungo v'ose v'av'i'li' ku'fuma ku'mwa sav'o. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Yav'aga u'yo mwaniki' muhanya wav'yalaga mwana wa ki'gosya nawe wamupaga lina Mowabu, na hu' mwene sav'o lya V'amowabu ninga walelo. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Mwaniki' mudo na mwene wav'yalaga mwana wa ki'gosya, na wamupaga lina Benami, na hu' mwene sav'o lya V'aamoni v'ose ninga walelo.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Abalahamu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Hohene Abalahamu wawu'kaga ku'fuma ku' Mamule, walondaga lwandi' lwa dakama ku' ibalangu' lya Negebu. Yav'aga aho wafikaga kwenu'ko, wav'ezyaga wikalo wakwe hagati' ya Kadeshi na Shuli, hangi' wayaga ku'kikala ku' kaya ya Gelali ki'ti' mugeni mwizi'li'zi. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Aho wav'aga kwenu'ko Abalahamu, wav'awi'laga v'antu' ati', “Sala ali' ilu'mbu' lyanne.” Ku'nguno yeni'yo Abimeleki, mutemi wa Gelali, wamusolaga Sala av'e muki' wakwe.<verse eid="GEN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Ali'vi Mulungu wamwizi'i'laga Abimeleki mu ndoti wu'ziku' na ku'muwi'la ati', “Lingaga, ev'e u'ku'fwa ku'nguno ya muki'ma u'yo wamusolile ali' muki' wa muntu'!” <verse eid="GEN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Itungo lyeni'lo Abimeleki wasangwa akaali' ku'lala na Sala. Ku'nguno yeni'yo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Gu'ku', u'ku'wu'laga v'antu' ninga v'akav'ile na musango? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Abalahamu mweni'ki'li' wambwi'lile ati', mwenu'yu' ali' ilu'mbu'ye, hangi' ninga Sala mweni'ki'li' wambwi'lile ati' mwenu'yu' ali' mudu'gu'ye. Ene nav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo ku' moyo mugololoku na makono gape.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Haho Mulungu wamuwi'laga hangi' mu ndoti yeni'yo, “Nanne manyile ku'v'a ku' moyo mugololoku wav'ezizye vyeni'vyo. Hu' hene naku'hangi'li'zizye ku'du' u'nkenagu'li'le ku' ku'mukuumya muki'ma mwenu'yo. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Gi'si' u'musu'v'ye muki'ma mwenu'yo ku' mugosi wakwe. Abalahamu ali' mufumbu'zi, aku'ku'lombela u'v'e na wu'panga. U'lu' u'leke ku'musu'v'ya u'manye nhana u'ku'fwa, ev'e na v'antu' v'ako v'ose.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Abimeleki wipunaga, wav'itanaga v'akumba v'akwe v'ose, na ku'v'alotoolela gose ago wawonaga mu ndoti, nav'o v'ogohaga muno. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Hangi' Abimeleki wamwitanaga Abalahamu na ku'muwu'zya, “Waku'v'ezezizye ki'? Ninga naku'kenizye ki' mpaka waku'lengelaga wu'kenagu'zi, ene na wu'temi wanne? Wambezezizye igambo i'lo li'kakowola ku'v'eziwa.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Abimeleki walambaga ku'muwu'zya, “Wali' u'li' na ndaka ki' ku'v'ezya vyeni'vi?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Abalahamu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nav'ezizye vyeni'vyo ku'nguno ndi' nawona henanha hadu'hu' u'yo amogohile Mulungu, hene ndi' nogoha ku'v'a mulambu'lage ki'gele mumusole muki' wanne. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Nawe nhana ali' ilu'mbu' lyanne, ali' mwana wamwa v'av'a, ku'kav'ile v'a nda yi'mo nanne, hu' nguno wav'a muki' wanne. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Yav'aga ku'fuma aho Mulungu wambezizye ku'hafuma ha lu'go lwamwa v'av'a, haho ndi' namuwi'la muki' wanne, ‘Nu'ku'lomba ki'la aho ku'lakaye u'yomba du' ati' ene ni' ilu'mbu'yo. I'vi hu' vyene u'lav'e walagi'la chelu' chako ku' wanne.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Haho Abimeleki wamusu'v'yaga Sala ku' mugosi wakwe Abalahamu. Hangi' wamupaga madale ga ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li haki'mo na v'akumba v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Hangi' Abimeleki wamuwi'laga Abalahamu, “Lingaga, nsi' yanne yose yi'li' ha mbele yako, sogolaga aho u'togilwe wikale.”<verse eid="GEN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Hangi' wamuwi'laga Sala, “Lingaga, namupaga mudu'gu'yo vipande ki'hu'mbi' ki'mo vya feza. Nav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo ha mbele ya v'antu' v'ose, ki'gele v'amanye ati' u'kav'ezizye kav'i, nanho u'ku'v'a na lole ha v'antu' v'ose.”<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Haho Abalahamu wamulombaga Mulungu, nawe wav'api'zyaga Abimeleki, muki' wakwe, na v'azya v'akwe, nav'o v'apandi'kaga hangi' v'ana. <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />Ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu wasangwa wav'atungile ku'v'yala v'aki'ma v'ose v'a mu lu'go lwamwa Abimeleki, ku'nguno yamwa Sala muki' wamwa Abalahamu.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Ku'v'yalwa kwamwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Aho lyafikaga itungo i'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wamuwi'la Sala, wamwizi'i'laga na ku'mugelani'zi'zya ilagano ki'ti' i'vyo ndi' wayomba. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Haho Sala wav'aga na mwitungo. Aho lyafikaga itungo lya ku'v'yala wamuv'yali'laga Abalahamu mwana wa ki'gosya mu wu'kiku'lu' wakwe, mu itungo lyeni'lo ki'ti' i'vyo ndi' wawi'lwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Abalahamu wamupaga lina Isaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Isaka” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “ali'seka.”</char></note>, mwana u'yo wamuv'yali'laga Sala. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Isaka aho wafikyaga musimo gwa nsiku' munane, Abalahamu wamuputaga nyu'nzu' yakwe ki'ti' i'vyo Mulungu wamupile ilagi'li'zyo. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Itungo lya ku'v'yalwa ku'mwa Isaka, Abalahamu ise wasangwa ali' na musimo gwa myaka igana li'mo.<verse eid="GEN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Nawe Sala wayombaga, “Mulungu wambezyaga ntogwe na ku'seka, na ki'la muntu' u'yo akwigwa muhayo gwenu'gu' aku'seka haki'mo nanne.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Hangi' walambaga ku'yomba, “Nde wali' alamuwi'le Abalahamu ati' Sala muki' wakwe alonsye mwana? Ali'vi gi'si' namuv'yali'laga mwana wa ki'gosya mu wu'kiku'lu' wakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'sagwa kwamwa Hajili na Isumaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Isaka waku'laga, na Sala wamupeezyaga iv'ele. Mu lu'siku' lwenu'lo Abalahamu wav'ezyaga mwanya muhanya. <verse eid="GEN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Ali'vi Sala wamuwonaga Isumaili mwana wamwa Abalahamu u'yo wamuv'yali'lile Hajili, Mumisili, ali'muv'ezezya mansyente Isaka mwana wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo, Sala wamuwi'laga Abalahamu, “U'musage muzya mwenu'yu' haki'mo na mwane, ku'nguno yi'kakowoleka mwana wa muzya ku'saala haki'mo na mwana wanne Isaka.”<verse eid="GEN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Muhayo gwenu'go gwav'aga muv'i muno ku'mwa Abalahamu ku'nguno ya mwane Isumaili. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Ali'vi Mulungu wamuwi'laga Abalahamu, “Muhayo gwenu'go waku'wi'laga Sala gu'leke ku'v'a muv'i ku' wako, ku'nguno ya muzya wako na mwana wakwe Isumaili. Degelekaga i'cho aku'ku'wi'la, ku'nguno wu'v'yalwa wako wu'ligele ku'fumi'i'la ku' mwana wako Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Sumbwa mwana wa muzya wako, mwene ndamuv'ezye av'e v'av'a wa kabi'la ku'nguno mwenu'yu' nawe ali' mwana wako du'.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Wangalu'ke ndiyu' Abalahamu wasolaga viliwa na ki'kondo cha minzi', na wamuv'agali'ki'zyaga Hajili na ku'musinia haki'mo na mwane. Nav'o v'awu'kaga na v'alondaga ku' ibalangu' lya Beeli-sheba na kwenu'ko wayegayegaga.<verse eid="GEN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Yav'aga aho gamalaga minzi' ga mu ki'kondo, Hajili wamulekaga mwane Isumaili ha nsi'li'li' na isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Nawe wayaga ha mpelo, wu'lihu wa ki'ti' ntambo igana li'mo, na wayombaga mu moyo gwakwe, “Yi'kav'ile visoga mmuwone mwana wanne aho ali'fwa.” Yav'aga aho wikalaga kwenu'ko, wali'laga ku' muzwi muhanya.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Mwana nawe wali'laga, na Mulungu wigagwa ku'li'la kwakwe. Haho malaika wamwa Mulungu ku'fuma ku' ilunde wamwitanaga Hajili na wamuwu'zyaga, “Hajili ku'li' na ki'? Ku'du' wogohe, ku'nguno Mulungu wigagwa ki'li'lo cha mwana wako kwenu'ko ali'. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Wu'kaga u'ye ku' mwana wako u'kamuwu'sye, na u'mudime mukono, ku'nguno ndamuv'ezye av'e v'av'a wa kabi'la nhanya.”<verse eid="GEN 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamufumbu'laga minso gakwe Hajili, nawe walu'wonaga lwinzi', wayaga ku'kadaha mu ki'kondo, wokazyaga minzi' na wamunywisyaga mwana wakwe.<verse eid="GEN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Mulungu wav'aga haki'mo na mwana mwenu'yo, nawe wendeleyaga ku'ku'la, wav'aga mwikazi wa mu ibalangu', na wav'aga mulasi wa masonga. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Itungo lyeni'lo lya wikalo wakwe mu ibalangu' lya Palani, nnina wamukoov'elaga muki'ma wa Ki'misili na wamutozyaga.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abalahamu na Abimeleki v'ali'lagana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Nawe mutemi Abimeleki na Fikoli, muhanya wa v'asilikale, v'ayaga ku'mwa Abalahamu na v'amuwi'laga ati', “Mulungu ali' haki'mo nanho ku' ki'la igambo i'lo u'li'v'ezya. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo u'lahi'le ku' lina lyamwa Mulungu, ku'v'a u'kasye u'mbezezye wu'yengani, ene, v'ana v'anne, na wu'v'yalwa wanne. Ki'ti' i'vi ene naku'v'ezezizye chelu', nanho u'mbezezye chelu' cheni'cho, ene na nsi' yeni'yi' i'yo wikalile ki'ti' mugeni mwizi'li'zi.” <verse eid="GEN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Nawe Abalahamu wasu'v'yaga, “Nu'lahi'la.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Ali'vi Abalahamu wasayaga ku'mwa Abimeleki ku'nguno ya lwinzi' lwa minzi' u'lo v'akumba v'amwa Abimeleki ndi' v'amupuzya Abalahamu. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Nawe Abimeleki wayombaga, “Ene nkamanya nde wav'ezizye vyeni'vyo, ninga nanho u'kambwi'lile, na muhayo gwenu'gu' hu' nu'gwigwa walelo.”<verse eid="GEN 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Haho Abalahamu wasolaga madale ga ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li, na wamupaga Abimeleki, nav'o v'enav'a v'av'i'li' v'av'ezyaga ilagano lyav'o. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Hangi' Abalahamu wakomaga tu'di'lana tu'ki'ma mupungati' twa nkolo, na watu'tu'u'laga twinene. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Nawe Abimeleki wamuwu'zyaga Abalahamu ati', “ku' ki' watu'koma twenu'tu' tu'di'lana mupungati'?” <verse eid="GEN 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Abalahamu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nu'ku'pa twenu'tu' tu'di'lana mupungati', u'tu'sole ku'fuma mu makono ganne ki'gele wu'v'e wu'sangi'lwa wa ene nanho ku'v'a lwinzi' lwenu'lu' ene hu' ndu'si'mbile.”<verse eid="GEN 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Haho lwinzi' lwenu'lo v'alu'paga lina “Beeli-sheba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhayo “Beeli-sheba” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo yi'li' “lwinzi' lwa mulahi'” ninga “lwinzi' lwa av'o mupungati'.” </char></note>,” ku'nguno v'ilahi'li'zyaga henanho v'ose v'av'i'li'.<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Aho v'amali'laga ku'v'ezya ilagano lyav'o kwenu'ko ku' lwandi' lwa Beeli-sheba, Abimeleki na Fikoli, muhanya wa v'asilikale, v'awu'kaga kwenu'ko, na v'asu'v'aga ku' nsi' ya V'afilisiti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Abalahamu muti' gwa mutaka kwenu'ko ku' Beeli-sheba, na wamwisengaga Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa nhananhana. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Nawe wikalaga kwenu'ko ku' lwandi' lwa V'afilisiti ki'ti' mugeni mwizi'li'zi ku' itungo ilihu.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Igemelo lyamwa Mulungu ku'mwa Abalahamu ku'mufumya mwane ki'taambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Aho lyav'i'taga itungo Mulungu wamugemaga Abalahamu. Wamwitanaga ati', “Abalahamu!” Abalahamu witawu'kaga, “Kalame! Ene aha.” <verse eid="GEN 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Haho Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “U'musole Isaka, mwana wako somwe mutoneke, u'ye nawe ku' lwandi' lwa Molia. U'kamufumye ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ku' lu'gu'lu' u'lo ndaku'lagi'le.”<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Mu wangalu'ke ikingilima, Abalahamu watunu'laga, wati'v'aga nkwi zya ku'pemba ha ki'taambo, hangi' wayi'gelani'zyaga mpunda yakwe. Haho wawu'kaga haki'mo na v'akumba v'akwe v'av'i'li' na mwana wakwe Isaka, ku'ya ku' lwandi' u'lo wakawi'lagwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Yav'aga mu lu'siku' lwa wu'datu' lwa musi'nzo gwav'o, Abalahamu walingaga, wahawonelaga ka ku'le ha lwandi' lwenu'lo. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Haho wav'awi'laga v'akumba v'akwe ati', “Inywe musigale henanha na mpunda. Ene na mwana wanne leka ku'ye kwenu'ko, ki'gele ku'kamwisenge Mulungu. U'lu' kwamali'la ku'ku'musu'v'i'la.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Hohene Abalahamu wasolaga zyeni'zyo nkwi wamutwi'kaga mwana wakwe Isaka, mweni'ki'li' wasolaga moto na ki'syu', nav'o v'awu'kaga haki'mo v'ose v'av'i'li'. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Aho v'av'age v'akaali' v'ali' mu nzi'la Isaka wamwitanaga ise, “V'av'a wanne!” Nawe witawu'kaga ati', “Kalame! Ene aha, mwana wanne.” Isaka wamuwu'zyaga ise, “Lingaga, moto na nkwi ku'li'nazyo, ali'vi kadi'lana ka ki'taambo kali' ku'he?” <verse eid="GEN 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Abalahamu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Mwana wanne, Mulungu mweni'ki'li' akwifumi'zya kadi'lana ka ki'taambo.” Nav'o v'endeleyaga na musi'nzo gwav'o.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Aho v'afikaga ha lwandi' u'lo walagi'lagwa na Mulungu, Abalahamu wazyengaga ihozezyo na ku'hela nkwi ha igu'lya. Haho wamutungaga Isaka mwana wakwe, na ku'mulali'ki'zya ha igu'lya na nkwi zyeni'zyo. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Abalahamu wasolaga ki'syu', na wagololaga mukono gwakwe, ki'gele amusi'nze mwane.<figure style="fig" file="C-018.jpg" size="col" ref="22:10" /><verse eid="GEN 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Ali'vi malaika wamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwitanaga ku'fuma ku' ilunde, “Abalahamu, Abalahamu!” Nawe witawu'kaga, “Kalame! Ene aha.” <verse eid="GEN 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Malaika wamuwi'laga, “U'leke ku'muvulazya mwana ninga ku'mukuumya! Gi'si' namanya ku'v'a u'mogohile Mulungu, ku'nguno u'kamwigugi'zizye mwana wako somwe.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Haho Abalahamu wawu'syaga minso gakwe wikev'elaga, kasinaga mu isaka ku'li' na ng'ondi yagov'yagwa mapembe gayo. Haho wayi'yi'laga na ku'yi'sola ng'ondi yeni'yo, na ku'yi'fumya ki'taambo ha lwandi' lwa mwane. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Hohene Abalahamu wahitanaga henanho ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'wifumi'zya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhayo “Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'wifumi'zya” ku' Ki'ebulania yi'li' “Yahweh Yireh” ninga “Yehova Yireh.”</char></note>.” Ki'ti' i'vi v'antu' v'ali'yomba mpaka walelo, “Ku' lu'gu'lu' lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu akwifumi'zya.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Malaika wamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'fuma ku' ilunde wamwitanaga hangi' Abalahamu, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />wamuwi'laga ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'yomba i'vi: Nu'lahi'la ku' lina lyanne ati', ku'nguno wav'ezyaga vyeni'vi, u'kamwigugi'zizye mwana wako somwe, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />nhana ndaku'dosye, na wu'v'yalwa wako ndawingi'hye ki'ti' nsonda zya mu ilunde, na musengasenga gwa ha mpelo na nyanza. Wu'v'yalwa wako ati' wu'lakinde v'anisi na ku'tema kaya zyav'o. <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Ku'v'i'ti'la ku' v'av'yalwa wako v'antu' v'a makabi'la gose ga mu welelo v'aladosiwe, ku'nguno ev'e wanku'zyaga ene.”<verse eid="GEN 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Hohene Abalahamu wav'asu'v'i'laga v'akumba v'akwe, v'ose ku' haki'mo v'asu'v'aga mpaka ku' Beeli-sheba. Nawe Abalahamu wendeleyaga kwikalaga kwenu'ko.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">V'ana v'amwa Naholi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Aho gav'i'taga magambo genago, Abalahamu wawi'lagwa ati', “Lingaga, Milika nawe wakamuv'yali'la mudu'gu'yo Naholi v'ana.” <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Muv'yalwa wa mbele ali'witanwa Usi, na v'aku'mulonda v'ali'witanwa Busi na Kemueli, u'yo hu' ise wamwa Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />Hu' v'alonda: Kesedi, Hazo, Pilidashi, Yidilafu na Betueli. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Betueli hu' ise wamwa Lebeka. Naholi mudu'gu'ye na Abalahamu wapandi'kaga v'ana munane av'o wamuv'yali'laga muki' wakwe Milika. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Isuli'la wamwa Naholi u'yo witanagwe Leuma, nawe wamuv'yali'laga v'ana v'angi'. Mina gav'o v'itanagwe Teba, Gahamu, Tahashi na Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Ku'fwa kwamwa Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Wikalo wamwa Sala mu welelo, wikalaga myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi av'i'li' na mupungati'. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Sala wagulali'laga ku' kaya ya Kiliati-aliba, lina li'ngi' Hebuloni, ku' lwandi' lwa Kanaani. Nawe Abalahamu wamuli'laga na ku'mugongolezya muki' wakwe.<verse eid="GEN 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Haho Abalahamu wawu'kaga ku'fuma aho gu'li' muv'i'li' gwa muki' wakwe, wayaga ku'kasu'nsu'mu'la na V'ahiti, v'ikazi v'a nsi' yeni'yo, na ku'v'awi'la ati', <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />“Ene nikalile henanha mugati' na inywe ki'ti' mugeni mwizi'li'zi. Nu'lomba mungu'zi'zye lwandi' lwa nsi' yinywe, ki'gele mpandi'ke ha ku'muzyi'ki'la muyagi muki' wanne.” <verse eid="GEN 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />V'ahiti nav'o v'asu'v'yaga ati', <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Ev'e gu'ku' wiswe, u'ku'degeleke! Ev'e u'li' ki'ti' mutemi muhanya muno mugati' niswe. Sogola ki'v'i'mbi' ki'soga i'cho u'ku'togwa, u'zyi'ki'le muv'i'li' gwa muki' wako. Ku'du'hu' muntu' u'yo aku'ku'gizya ki'v'i'mbi' chakwe, u'leke ku'zyi'ka muv'i'li' gwa muki' wako.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Haho Abalahamu wawu'kaga na wasukambaga ha mbele ya V'ahiti v'enav'o. <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />Wav'awi'laga ati', “U'lu' mwanzumi'zyaga ku'zyi'ka muv'i'li' gwa muki' wanne, nu'mulomba, kandombeli ku'mwa Efuloni mwana wamwa Sohali, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />ki'gele angu'zi'zye ipilinga i'lo li'li' ha Makipela, ku'nguno li'li' nsawo yakwe, nalyo li'li' ha lu'v'i'mbi' lwa ilale lyakwe. Muwi'lagi angu'zi'zye ku' wu'gu'zi wa lole ha mbele ya minso ginywe, ki'gele yi'v'e lwandi' lwanne lwa ku'zyi'ki'la.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Itungo lyeni'lo Efuloni, Muhiti, wav'age ikalile henanho ha wingi'li'lo wa kaya haki'mo na idale lya V'ahiti av'o ndi' v'ikumingaga henanho. Efuloni wasu'v'yaga ku'mwa Abalahamu ha mbele ya V'ahiti v'ichakwe ati', <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />“Gu'ku' wanne, yi'kav'ile vyeni'vyo, nu'ku'lomba u'ndegeleke. Nu'ku'pa ilale lyeni'lo haki'mo na ipilinga i'lo li'li' mugati' yalyo gele. Nu'ku'pa ha mbele ya v'ikazi v'ichane, ki'gele u'zyi'ki'le muv'i'li' gwa muki' wako.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Haho Abalahamu wasukambaga hangi' ha mbele ya v'ikazi v'a henanho. <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />Wamuwi'laga Efuloni katwipandu' ku'no v'antu' v'ose v'adegelekile ati', “Nu'ku'lomba u'ndegeleke. Nku'ku'li'pa ku' wu'gu'zi wa ku'gelani'la ilale lyeni'lo. Zumyaga ku'zipokela feza zyeni'zi ki'gele mmuzyi'ke muki' wanne.” <verse eid="GEN 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Nawe Efuloni wamusu'v'i'zyaga Abalahamu, ati', <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Gu'ku' wanne, ndegeleke! Mupango gwa ilale lyeni'lo li'li' na lu'v'alo lwa vipande magana ane du' vya feza, ali'vi zyeni'zyo hu' ki'ntu' ki' ku' wu'sav'i wanne nanho? Ev'e yagaga u'kamuzyi'ke muki' wako.”<verse eid="GEN 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Haho Abalahamu na Efuloni v'izumi'li'zyaga. Abalahamu wamupimi'laga Efuloni ki'pimo cha feza i'cho ndi' v'izumi'li'zyaga ha mbele ya V'ahiti v'ose. Wav'ezyaga ku'londana na ki'ti'le cha v'asu'lu'zya v'a itungo lyeni'lo.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Hu' vyene ilale lyose lyamwa Efuloni i'lo lyav'age ku' Makipela bi'hi' na Mamule, haki'mo na ipilinga i'lo lyav'age mu ilale, na miti' zyose zya mu ilale, zyose zyav'aga nsawo yamwa Abalahamu. <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />Igambo lyeni'lo lyav'ezyekaga ha mbele ya V'ahiti v'ose, av'o v'av'age v'ikumingaga henanho ha wingi'li'lo wa kaya yeni'yo. <verse eid="GEN 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Aho lyamalaga igambo lyeni'lo, Abalahamu wamuzyi'kaga muki' wakwe mu ipilinga lya mu ilale lyeni'lo lya Makipela bi'hi' na Mamule, lina li'ngi' Hebuloni, ku' lwandi' lwa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />I'vi hu' vyene V'ahiti v'amuv'azi'zyaga Abalahamu ilale lyeni'lo haki'mo na ipilinga i'lo lyav'age mugati' yakwe, ku'v'a nsawo yakwe, ki'gele av'e na lwandi' lwa ku'zyi'ki'la v'antu' v'akwe.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Ku'toola kwamwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Itungo lyeni'lo Abalahamu wav'age mukiku'lu' wa myaka mingi, nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wasangwa wamudosizye ku' vyose. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, Abalahamu wamuwi'laga mukumba wakwe u'yo wav'age mukiku'lu' ku'ki'la v'ose na mwi'mi'li'zi muhanya wa nsawo yakwe yose ati', “Tu'u'la mukono gwako mu matango ganne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku'tu'u'la makono mu matango nguno yayo yav'age kwitu'u'li'la mulahi' gwa igambo ihanya. </char></note>, <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />ki'gele u'lahi'le ku' lina lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa ilunde na li'welelo ati', u'kasye u'mutozye mwana wanne Isaka mwaniki' mugati' na v'aki'ma v'a Ki'kanaani av'o kwikalile nav'o henanha. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Ali'vi u'laye ku' kaya yiswe na ku' v'adu'gu' v'anne, u'kamukoov'ele kwenu'ko muki'ma.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Mukumba wakwe wasu'v'yaga ati', “Hamo muki'ma mwenu'yo akaane kwiza nanne ku'no, vihe, nize musu'v'ye mwana wako u'ko wafumi'i'la ev'e?” <verse eid="GEN 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Abalahamu wayombaga ati', “Ng'o! Witeege muno, ku'du' wize u'musu'v'ye mwana wanne kwenu'ko. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa mu ilunde, u'yo wanfumizye ku' lu'go lwamwa v'av'a, na ku'fuma ku' nsi' i'yo nav'yali'lwa, ndi' walahi'la ku' ku'yomba ati', ‘Wu'v'yalwa wako ndav'ape nsi' yeni'yi'.’ Ku'nguno yeni'yo Mulungu alamutu'me malaika wakwe aku'tongelele ki'gele u'kamuletele mwana wanne muki'ma ku'fuma kwenu'ko. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />U'lu' muki'ma mwenu'yo wakaana kwilonda nanho, hu' hene mulahi' gwanne gu'kakowola ku'ku'tunga. Sumbwa du', ku'du' wize u'musu'v'ye mwana wanne kwenu'ko.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Haho mukumba mwenu'yo watu'u'laga mukono gwakwe mu matango gamwa gu'ku' wakwe Abalahamu. Hene haho walyaga mulahi' gwa igambo lyeni'lo.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Hangi' mukumba mwenu'yo wasolaga ntwangawu'lende iku'mi zyamwa gu'ku' wakwe, haki'mo na lu'holo lwingi lwa hekeheke. Wav'ezyaga musi'nzo ku'ya ku' kaya i'yo ikalile Naholi, ku' nsi' ya Mesopotamia. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Aho wafikaga kwenu'ko, bi'hi' na kaya hav'age na lwinzi', itungo lyeni'lo yav'age lyu'v'a lya mpi'ndi' aho v'aki'ma v'av'age v'ali'ya ku'kadaha minzi'. Wazisukambyaga ntwangawu'lende zyakwe bi'hi' na lwinzi' lwenu'lo.<verse eid="GEN 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Haho walombaga, “Ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wamwa gu'ku' wanne Abalahamu, nu'ku'lomba u'ngwasye nkinde walelo, na gu'ku' wanne Abalahamu u'muv'ezezye chelu'. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Lingaga! Ni'maga henanha bi'hi' na lwinzi' aho v'aniki' v'ikazi v'a kaya yeni'yi' v'ali'wizaga ku'daha minzi'. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Gi'si' yi'v'e i'vi: mwaniki' u'yo nku'muwi'la ati', ‘Nu'lomba u'tu'u'le muzoga gwako gwa minzi' u'mpe nywe,’ nawe mbe wasu'v'ya ati', ‘Nywaga ninga ntwangawu'lende zyako nku'zinywisya,’ haho nku'manya ati' hu' mwene wamusogolelaga mukumba wako Isaka, na ku' lyeni'lo nku'manya wamu'v'ezezyaga chelu' gu'ku' wanne.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Yav'aga aho akaali' ali'mulomba Mulungu, kasinaga henanho wafumi'i'laga mwaniki' yu'mo lina lyakwe Lebeka, itwi'kile muzoga gwakwe! Lebeka mwenu'yo wav'age mwana wamwa Betueli, na Betueli wav'age mwana wamwa Milika, muki' wamwa Naholi, mudu'gu'ye na Abalahamu. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Mwaniki' mwenu'yo wav'age ali' na wu'syu' wu'soga na wa kwiv'elela muno, na wav'age akaali' ku'manya mugosya. Wingi'laga mu lwinzi', wokazyaga minzi' muzoga gwakwe, na wafumaga.<verse eid="GEN 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Haho mukumba mwenu'yo wangu'haga ku'kapoma nawe, na wamuwi'laga ati', “Nu'ku'lomba u'mpe minzi' madoo ga mu muzoga gwako nywe.” <verse eid="GEN 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Mwaniki' mwenu'yo wasu'v'yaga, “Endita gu'ku', nywaga.” Hene haho wagu'sosyaga muzoga gwakwe na wagu'dimi'li'laga ki'gele amunywisye. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Aho wamali'laga ku'mupa minzi' wamuwi'laga ati', “Na ntwangawu'lende zyako nku'zidahi'la minzi', ki'gele nazyo zinywe na zifulane.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Hohene wav'ezyaga wangu', na wapu'ngu'li'laga minzi' ga mu muzoga gwakwe mu ipango lya ku'nywela mitugo, hangi' wasu'v'aga lu'v'i'lo ku' lwinzi', wadahaga minzi' na ku'zinywisya ntwangawu'lende zyakwe zyose. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Itungo lyeni'lo, mukumba mwenu'yo wamulingi'li'laga na wahu'li'kaga akayombile muhayo, ki'gele amanye u'lu' Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'ezyaga musi'nzo gwakwe ku'v'a musoga ninga ng'o.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Aho ntwangawu'lende zyafulanaga ku'nywa minzi', mwenu'yo mukumba wamupaga mwaniki' ki'pini cha zahabu ya wu'timbu wa gilamu mukaga, na mabangili av'i'li' zya wu'timbu wa gilamu igana li'mo na maku'mi av'i'li'. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Hangi' wamuwu'zyaga, “Ev'e u'li' mwaniki' wa hamwa nde? Nu'ku'lomba u'mbwi'le, vihe, ha lu'go lwinywe yi'li'ho nafasi ya ku'lala?” <verse eid="GEN 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Mwaniki' mwenu'yo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ene ni' mwana wamwa Betueli, u'yo mwana wamwa Milika, muki' wamwa Naholi.” <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Hangi' wayombaga, “Ku' wiswe ku'li' na maswa mingi ga ku'di'mi'zya na mawulule ga ku'lali'la ntwangawu'lende, haki'mo na ha ku'lala v'ageni.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Haho mukumba mwenu'yo wasukambaga na ku'mukumi'li'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Wayombaga, “Akumu'kiwe Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wamwa gu'ku' wanne Abalahamu, ku'nguno walagi'laga chelu' chakwe na nhana yakwe ku'mwa gu'ku' wanne. Gu'ku' Mulungu wantongelelaga ene mpaka ku'fiki'i'la ku' v'adu'gu' v'amwa gu'ku' wanne!”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Haho mwaniki' mwenu'yo wapeelaga ku'ya ku'kav'awi'la nnina na v'adu'gu' v'amwa nnina igambo lyeni'lo. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Lebeka wav'age na ilu'mbu'ye u'yo witanagwe Labani. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Labani aho waki'wonaga ki'pini na mabangili ku'mwa ilu'mbu'ye, na kwigwa yose i'yo wawi'lagwa na muntu' mwenu'yo, haho wafumaga lu'v'i'lo ku'ya ku'kapoma na muntu' mwenu'yo ku' lwinzi'. Nawe wamusangaga i'mile bi'hi' na ntwangawu'lende zyakwe ha mpelo na lwinzi'. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Labani wamuwi'laga, “Kaliwu' ha lu'go ev'e mudosiwa na Gu'ku' Mulungu. Ku'nguno wi'maga ha ibala? Ene nayiv'angaga nnumba na aho ziku'v'a ntwangawu'lende zyako.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Hohene mukumba mwenu'yo wamwa Abalahamu wingi'laga mu lu'go. Labani wazitungu'li'laga ntwangawu'lende na wazipaga maswa, na mawulule ga ku'lali'la, haki'mo na minzi' ga ku'kusi'la magu'lu' musav'a na v'antu' v'akwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Haho v'amwiv'angaga ki'liwa, ali'vi mukumba mwenu'yo wayombaga ati', “Nkav'ile ku'lya mpaka njombe i'cho nu'koov'a ku'yomba”. Labani wayombaga, “Haya ku'wi'le.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Muntu' mwenu'yo wayombaga, “Ene ni' mukumba wamwa Abalahamu. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamudosizye gu'ku' wanne, nawe wav'ile mundev'a. Wamupile madale ga ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li, mawe ga mupango ga feza na zahabu, v'akumba v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma, ntwangawu'lende na mpunda. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Nawe Sala, muki' wamwa gu'ku' wanne, wamuv'yali'lile gu'ku' wanne mwana wa ki'gosya mu itungo lya wu'kiku'lu' wakwe, na gu'ku' wanne Abalahamu wamupaga mwana mwenu'yo nsawo yakwe yose. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Gu'ku' wanne wandahi'li'zizye ati', ‘Ku'du' wize u'mutozye mwana wanne mwaniki' mugati' na v'aki'ma v'a Ki'kanaani av'o nikalile mu nsi' yav'o. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Sumbwa u'laye ku' lu'go lwiswe ku'mwa v'av'a na ku' igongo lyanne, ki'gele u'kamukoov'ele mwana wanne muki'ma.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Nanne namuwu'zizye ati', ‘Hamo muki'ma mwenu'yo alakaane kwilonda nanne yi'lav'e vihe?’<verse eid="GEN 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />“Hohene wayombaga, ‘Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo ndondile nzi'la yakwe, alamutu'me malaika wakwe aye nanho na ku'v'ezya musi'nzo gwako gu'v'e musoga, ki'gele u'muletele mwana wanne muki'ma ku'fuma ku' igongo lyanne na nnumba yamwa v'av'a. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />U'lu' wiza wafika ku' igongo lyanne nav'o v'aleke ku'ku'pa mwaniki' mwenu'yo, haho mulahi' gwanne gu'kasye gu'ku'tunge.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />“Walelo aho nafika ha lwinzi' nalombaga, ‘Ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wamwa gu'ku' wanne Abalahamu, nu'ku'lomba u'ngwasye musi'nzo gwanne gu'v'e musoga. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Lingaga! Gi'si' ni'maga henanha bi'hi' na lwinzi'. Nu'lomba yi'v'e i'vi: Mwaniki' u'yo akwiza ku'daha minzi', nanne mulombe ampe minzi' madoo ga mu muzoga gwakwe nywe, <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />nawe mbe wasu'v'ya ati', “Nywaga ev'e, na ntwangawu'lende zyako nku'zidahi'la,” hohene mwenu'yo av'e hu' mwene u'yo wamusogolelaga av'e muki' wa mwana wamwa gu'ku' wanne.’<verse eid="GEN 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />“Yav'aga aho nali' nkaali' ku'mali'la ku'lomba mu moyo gwanne, kasinaga Lebeka wafikaga itwi'kile muzoga gwakwe gwa minzi'! Wingi'laga mu lwinzi' ku'daha minzi', nanne namuwi'laga, ‘Nu'lomba u'mpe minzi' ga ku'nywa.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Nawe wav'ezyaga wangu' ku'gu'sosya muzoga gwakwe, na wayombaga, ‘Haya nywaga, na ntwangawu'lende zyako nku'zidahi'la.’ Haho nanywaga na ntwangawu'lende zyanne wazidahi'laga minzi', nazyo zyanywaga.<verse eid="GEN 24:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />“Haho namuwu'zyaga, ‘Ev'e u'li' mwaniki' wa hamwa nde?’ Nawe wasu'v'yaga, ‘Ene ni' mwana wamwa Betueli, u'yo mwana wamwa Milika, muki' wamwa Naholi.’ Haho namuzwi'kaga ki'pini ku' nnindo na mabangili ku' makono gakwe.<verse eid="GEN 24:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />“Nanne nasukambaga na ku'mudehelezya Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wamwa gu'ku' wanne Abalahamu, u'yo wantongelelile ku' nzi'la ya nhana ku'fiki'i'la ku' mwaniki' wa wu'du'gu' wamwa gu'ku' wanne ku'nguno ya mwane. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Gi'si' mumbwi'le u'lu' muzumizye ku'muv'ezezya gu'ku' wanne chelu' na nhana. U'lu' ng'o, muyombe, ki'gele nanne manye nzi'la ya ku'londa.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Aho v'igagwa genago, Labani na Betueli v'asu'v'yaga ati', “Igambo lyeni'li' li'fumile ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, iswe ku'kakowola ku'yomba muhayo. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Lingaga, Lebeka u'yu' aha. Musolage u'ye, na av'e muki' wa mwana wamwa gu'ku' wako, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombile.”<verse eid="GEN 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Yav'aga mukumba mwenu'yo wamwa Abalahamu aho wigagwa mihayo zyeni'zyo, wamuku'v'i'i'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Haho wafumyaga vintu' i'vyo viv'eziv'ilwe ku' mupango muhanya gwa feza na zahabu, haki'mo na vizwalo, wamupaga Lebeka. Hangi' wamupaga ilu'mbu'ye na Lebeka haki'mo na nnina vintu' vya mupango muhanya. <verse eid="GEN 24:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Haho mweni'ki'li' haki'mo na v'antu' av'o v'av'age nawe v'alyaga, v'anywaga na ku'lala henanho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:54">Aho v'atunu'laga ndiyu', mukumba mwenu'yo wayombaga, “Nu'lomba ku'su'v'a ku'mwa gu'ku' wanne.” <verse eid="GEN 24:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Ali'vi ilu'mbu'ye na Lebeka haki'mo na nnina, v'ayombaga ati', “Muleke mwaniki' ikale niswe ki'ti' nsiku' iku'mi hene u'kowolile ku'wu'ka nawe.” <verse eid="GEN 24:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Nawe wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ku'du' munkendelezye, kwi'si Gu'ku' Mulungu wambezezyaga musi'nzo gwanne ku'v'a musoga. Ndekagi nsu'v'e ku'mwa gu'ku' wanne.” <verse eid="GEN 24:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Nav'o v'ayombaga, “Leka ku'mwitane mwaniki' mweni'ki'li' kwigwe aku'yomba vihe.”<verse eid="GEN 24:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Haho v'amwitanaga Lebeka na v'amuwu'zyaga ati', “Vihe, u'li'zumya ku'ya na muntu' mwenu'yu'?” Nawe wasu'v'yaga, “Nku'ya.” <verse eid="GEN 24:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Hohene v'amulekaga mudu'gu' wav'o Lebeka awu'ke na muzya u'yo wav'age musu'ngi wakwe, v'aye na mukumba wamwa Abalahamu na v'antu' v'akwe.<verse eid="GEN 24:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Nav'o v'amudosyaga Lebeka ku' ku'yomba ati',</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 24:60" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">“Ev'e mwana wiswe, u'v'e muv'yazi wa v'antu' mahu'ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">na wu'v'yalwa wako wu'kinde v'anisi na ku'tema kaya zyav'o.”<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Haho Lebeka wawu'kaga haki'mo na v'azya v'akwe, nav'o v'aliinaga ntwangawu'lende na ku'mulonda mwenu'yo mukumba wamwa Abalahamu. Vyeni'vyo hu' i'vyo wamusolaga Lebeka na ku'ya nawe.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Matungo genago Isaka wasangwa waku'fumile ku' lwandi' lwa Beeli-lahai-loi, na kwikala ku' lwandi' lwa ibalangu' lya Negebu. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, mu lyu'v'a lya mpi'ndi', Isaka wayaga mu mugu'nda ku'kiganika, hu' hene wawu'syaga minso gakwe, na ku'wona ntwangawu'lende zizile. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Nawe Lebeka, wawu'syaga minso gakwe na ku'muwona Isaka. Haho wasookaga ku' ntwangawu'lende, <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />na ku'muwu'zya mukumba wamwa Abalahamu, “Nde u'yo u'mo mu mugu'nda, izile ku'ku'su'mbi'la iswe?” Mukumba wasu'v'yaga ati', “Mwenu'yo hu' gu'ku' wanne.” Haho Lebeka wasolaga shela yakwe na kwikumbi'la ku' wu'syu'.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Nawe mukumba mwenu'yo wamutentemuli'laga Isaka gose ago wagav'ezizye.<verse eid="GEN 24:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Yav'aga Isaka aho wigagwa vyeni'vyo wamwingi'zyaga Lebeka mu ikutu i'lo lyav'age lyamwa nnina Sala, nawe wamutoolaga. Isaka wamutogagwa Lebeka na ku'pandi'ka ihu'li'kyo lya ku'gulali'lwa nnina.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">V'av'yalwa v'angi' v'amwa Abalahamu ku'mwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Nawe Abalahamu watoolaga muki'ma yu'ngi', na lina lyakwe witanagwe Ketula. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Mwenu'yu' wamuv'yali'laga Abalahamu v'ana, na mina gav'o v'itanagwe: Zimulani, Yokishani, Medani, Midiani, Ishibaki na Shua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yokishani nawe wapandi'kaga v'ana, na mina gav'o v'itanagwe: Sheba na Dedani. Dedani hu' mwene wav'age sav'o lya V'aashuli, V'aletushi na V'aleumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Midiani nawe wapandi'kaga v'ana, na mina gav'o v'itanagwe: Efa, Efeli, Hanoki, Abida na Elidaa. V'ose v'enav'a v'av'age hu' wu'v'yalwa wamwa Ketula.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Abalahamu wamusali'kyaga mwane Isaka nsawo yakwe yose i'yo wav'age nayo. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Ali'vi Abalahamu aho wav'age akaali' ali'zuwu'ka, wav'apaga lu'holo v'aane av'o wapandi'kile ku' masuli'la v'akwe, na wav'asagaga ha lwandi' lwamwa Isaka mwane ku' ku'v'awi'la v'aye ku'le ku' lwandi' lwa mu ki'ya ki'gele v'akikale kwenu'ko.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'fwa kwamwa Abalahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Wikalo wakwe wose mu welelo Abalahamu wikalaga myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi mupungati' na itano. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Haho Abalahamu wagulalaga mugati' na wu'kiku'lu' wu'soga wa lu'v'ango, na wav'age mukiku'lu' wa nsiku' nyingi, nawe walondaga nzi'la ya v'antu' v'akwe av'o v'amalile ku'tongela. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />V'aane Isaka na Isumaili, v'amuzyi'kaga sav'o Abalahamu ku' ipilinga lya ku' Makipela, bi'hi' na Mamule ku' ilale i'lo ndi' lyamwa Efuloni, mwana wamwa Sohali, Muhiti. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Ilale lyeni'lo Abalahamu wasangwa wali'gu'lile ku' V'ahiti. Henanho hu' aho wazyi'ki'lilwe muki' wakwe Sala, nawe Abalahamu wazyi'ki'lagwa haho. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Yav'aga ku'fuma aho wagulalaga Abalahamu, Mulungu wamudosyaga Isaka mwana wakwe. Nawe Isaka wav'ezyaga wikalo wakwe bi'hi' na lwinzi' lwa ku' Beeli-lahai-loi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu'v'yalwa wamwa Isumaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />I'yi' hu' mmola ya wu'v'yalwa wamwa Isumaili mwana wamwa Abalahamu, u'yo wamuv'yali'laga Hajili, Mumisili, muzya wamwa Sala.<verse eid="GEN 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Genaga hu' mina ga v'ana v'amwa Isumaili, ku'londa na wu'v'yalwa wav'o: Muv'yalwa wa mbele wamwa Isumaili witanagwe Nebayoti, na v'alondelezi v'akwe v'av'age, Kedali, Adibeeli, Mibusamu, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Mishima, Duma, Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadadi, Tema, Yetuli, Nafishi na Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />V'enav'a hu' v'ana v'amwa Isumaili, na ku' v'enav'a kwav'aga na magongo iku'mi na tu'v'i'li', na ki'la yu'mo wav'aga mutemi ku' lwandi' lwakwe. Wikalo wav'o na magu'ngu'li gav'o gamanyi'kaga ku'londa na mina gav'o.<verse eid="GEN 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Wikalo wakwe wose mu welelo Isumaili, wikalaga myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi adatu' na mupungati', haho wagulalaga. Walondaga nzi'la ya v'antu' v'akwe av'o v'amalile ku'tongela. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Wikalo wa v'av'yalwa v'amwa Isumaili wav'age ku'lamuli'la ku' lwandi' lwa Havila mpaka Shuli, ku' ki'ya ya nsi' ya Misili ku'londa ku' Ashulu. Kwenu'ko v'ikalaga ki'bagu' na v'av'yalwa v'ichav'o v'ana v'amwa Abalahamu.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'v'yalwa kwamwa Esau na Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />I'yi' hu' mmola ya wu'v'yalwa wamwa Isaka mwana wamwa Abalahamu. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Isaka aho wamutoolaga Lebeka, wasangwa ali' na musimo gwa myaka maku'mi ane. Lebeka wav'age mwaniki' wamwa Betueli, Mualamu, ku'fuma ku' kaya ya Padani-alamu. Lebeka wav'age ilu'mbu'ye na Labani.<verse eid="GEN 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Ali'vi Lebeka wav'age mugu'mba, ku'nguno yeni'yo Isaka wamulombaga Gu'ku' Mulungu. Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wazumyaga ku'lomba kwakwe, haho Lebeka wapandi'kaga mwitungo. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Sumbwa mwitungo gwenu'go gwav'age gwa mav'asa. V'ana v'av'age v'ali'wikindya mu nda yakwe, nawe wayombaga, “ku' ki' genaga gali'wigelisya ku' wanne?” Haho wayaga ku'kawu'zya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga ati',</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 25:23" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">“Wu'li'ho wu'temi wu'v'i'li' mu nda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">na makabi'la av'i'li' ga v'antu' av'o u'lav'yale galalekane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Wu'temi wu'mo wu'lav'e na nguzu ku'ki'la wiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">na muhanya alav'e mukumba wa mudo.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Yav'aga aho zyagelani'laga nsiku' zyakwe zya kwipeku'la, lingaga! Lebeka wipeku'laga mav'asa. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Mwana wa kwandya kwipeku'la, muv'i'li' gwakwe gose wav'age wazaa, na wu'yenze muv'i'li' gose. Yeni'yo hu' nguno v'amupaga lina Esau<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Esau” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “wa wu'yenze.”</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Mu itungo lyeni'lo, mwana wa wu'v'i'li' wav'yalagwa u'ku' amudimile kasinsila mudu'gu'ye Esau. Yeni'yo hu' nguno v'amupaga lina Yakobo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Yakobo” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na mihayo “kasinsila” ninga “wu'yengani.”</char></note>. Itungo lya ku'v'yalwa Esau na Yakobo sav'o Isaka wasangwa wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi mukaga.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau ali'gu'zya lwandi' lwa lole yakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Aho v'ana v'enav'a v'aku'laga, Esau wav'age muhi'gi musoga, amani'lile ku'ya mu masenga. Sumbwa Yakobo wav'age mutekanu wa kwikala ha lu'go. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Hohene Isaka wamutogagwa Esau, ku'nguno wav'age atogilwe ku'lya nyama zya mu isenga, sumbwa Lebeka wav'age amutogilwe Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, Yakobo watekaga ki'liwa cha dengu, nawe Esau wasu'v'aga ku'fuma ku' ihi'ga, ku'no azov'ile muno. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Esau wamuwi'laga Yakobo, “Nu'ku'lomba, u'mpe ki'liwa cheni'cho chazaa nchoyangi'zye, ku'nguno ni'na nzala ndaki muno.” Yeni'yo hu' nguno v'amupaga lina Edomu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Edomu” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “wazaa”.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakobo nawe wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ngu'zi'zye mbela lwandi' lwa lole yako ya wu'v'yalwa wa mbele.” <verse eid="GEN 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Haho Esau wayombaga, “Lingaga, ene ni' bi'hi' ku'fwa! Yi'ku'ngwasya ki' ku'v'a na lole ya wu'v'yalwa wa mbele?” <verse eid="GEN 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Yakobo wamuwi'laga, “Lahi'la mbela.” Haho Esau walahi'laga, na ku'mugu'zi'zya lwandi' lwa lole yakwe ya wu'v'yalwa wa mbele. <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Haho Yakobo wamupaga Esau mugate na ki'liwa cha dengu. Nawe Esau walyaga, wanywaga, na wawu'kaga henanho. I'vi hu' vyene Esau wanyataga lwandi' lwa lole ya wu'v'yalwa wa mbele.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu ali'mulagana Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Hangi' yagwaga nzala ndaki mu nsi', ku'leka i'yo ndi' yagwa ha itungo lyamwa Abalahamu. Ku'nguno yeni'yo Isaka wayaga ku' kaya ya Gelali ku'mwa Abimeleki mutemi wa V'afilisiti.<verse eid="GEN 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwifumi'i'laga Isaka na ku'muwi'la, “Ku'du' u'ye ku' Misili, sumbwa u'ye ku'kikala ku' nsi' i'yo ndaku'wi'le. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Wikale mu nsi' yeni'yi' ya wu'geni, nanne nku'v'a haki'mo nanho na nku'ku'dosya. Nanne nku'gelani'zya mulahi' u'go nalahi'lile ku'mwa so Abalahamu, na nku'ku'pa ev'e na wu'v'yalwa wako nsi' zyose zyeni'zi. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Ndav'ingi'hye v'av'yalwa v'ako v'av'e v'ingi ki'ti' nsonda zya mu ilunde, na ndav'ape nsi' zyeni'zi zyose. Ku'v'i'ti'la ku' v'av'yalwa v'ako v'antu' v'a makabi'la gose ga mu welelo v'aladosiwe. <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Nku'ku'dosya ku'nguno Abalahamu wav'age anku'zizye na ku'doonoka milagi' zyanne, nhama zyanne, wu'yangu' wanne, na nzi'la zya nhana yanne.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka na Abimeleki ku' Gelali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Hohene Isaka wikalaga kwenu'ko ku' Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />V'antu' v'a kwenu'ko aho v'amuwu'zi'li'zyaga ku' mmola ya muki' wakwe, nawe wasu'v'yaga ati', “Mwenu'yu' ali' ilu'mbu' lyanne.” Wogoha ku'yomba ati' muki' wakwe ki'gele v'azengano v'a kaya yeni'yo ku'du' v'amuwu'lage wenge wamwa Lebeka, ku'nguno wav'age musoga wa kwiv'elela.<verse eid="GEN 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Yav'aga aho Isaka wikalaga kwenu'ko nsiku' nyingi, lu'siku' lu'mo Abimeleki mutemi wa V'afilisiti wasunu'ki'laga ha ibala, haho wawonaga, kasinaga Isaka ali'munega Lebeka muki' wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Abimeleki wamwitanaga Isaka, na wamuwu'zyaga ati', “Nhana mwenu'yu' ali' muki' wako! Ku' ki' wayombile ati' ilu'mbu'yo?” Isaka wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ndi' nayomba vyeni'vyo, ku'nguno ya kogoha ku'wu'lagwa wenge wakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Haho Abimeleki wayombaga, “Waku'v'ezezyaga igambo ki' lyeni'li'? Vihe, muntu' yu'mo mugati' niswe wali' alale nawe ku' ku'leka ku'manya ku'v'a ali' muki' wako, ev'e u'kav'ile ku'wona wali' u'ku'ku'lengela wu'kenagu'zi?” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Haho Abimeleki wav'akaani'zyaga v'antu' v'ose ati', “U'yo alamukuumye muntu' mwenu'yu' ninga muki' wakwe, nhana alawu'lagwe!”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Mwaka gwenu'go, Isaka wali'maga mu nsi' yeni'yo, na kwi'mbu'la viliwa vingi muno, ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu wamudosyaga. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Nawe Isaka wadamalu'kaga, nsawo yakwe yakwi'laga mpaka wav'aga musav'i muhanya. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Wav'aga na madale ga ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li na v'akumba v'ingi, mpaka V'afilisiti v'amuwonelaga iwu'v'a. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Hohene V'afilisiti v'agafuli'i'laga malwinzi' gose ago ndi' v'asi'mba v'akumba v'amwa Abalahamu ise, itungo i'lo wav'age akaali' ali'zuwu'ka. <verse eid="GEN 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Hangi' Abimeleki wamuwi'laga Isaka ati', “U'hafume ha wiswe ku'nguno ev'e u'ku'kindizye nguzu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Haho Isaka wawu'kaga henanho, walondaga ku' iwonde lya Gelali, na kwenu'ko watu'u'laga nkambi' yakwe na wikalaga ku'ko. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Isaka wagafulu'laga malwinzi' ga lwandi' lwenu'lo ago ndi' gasi'mbwa ha itungo lyamwa Abalahamu ise, ku'nguno V'afilisiti ndi' v'agafuli'i'la aho Abalahamu wagulala. Aho wamali'laga ku'gafulu'la wagapaga mina gene gago ki'ti' i'vyo ise ndi' wagapa.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, v'akumba v'amwa Isaka v'asi'mbaga ha iwonde lyeni'lo, na v'apandi'kaga lwinzi' lwa minzi' ga kasela. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Ali'vi v'adi'mi v'a henanho ha Gelali, v'ikeniaga na v'adi'mi v'amwa Isaka nav'o v'ayombaga ati', “Minzi' genaga ga ku' wiswe.” Haho Isaka walwitanaga lwinzi' lwenu'lo “Eseki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Eseki” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “isola.”</char></note>,” ku'nguno v'ikeniaga nawe. <verse eid="GEN 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />V'adi'mi v'amwa Isaka v'asi'mbaga hangi' lwinzi' lu'ngi', ali'vi nalo v'alwikenezyaga. Isaka walwitanaga lwinzi' lwenu'lo “Sitina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Sitina” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “ku'pi'nga.”</char></note>.” <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Haho Isaka wayaga lwandi' lu'ngi' na ku'si'mba lwinzi' lu'ngi', sumbwa lwene v'akalwikenezizye. Walwitanaga “Lehoboti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Lehoboti” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “hagali'nhu.”</char></note>” na ku'yomba ati', “Gi'si' Gu'ku' Mulungu waku'paga hagali'nhu, niswe ku'ku'damalu'ka mu nsi' yeni'yi'.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Ku'fuma kwenu'ko wayaga lwandi' lwa ku' Beeli-sheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Wu'ziku' wene wu'wo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwifumi'i'laga na ku'muwi'la, “Ene ni' Mulungu wamwa so Abalahamu. Ku'du' wogohe, ku'nguno ene ni' haki'mo nanho, nku'ku'dosya na ku'v'ingi'hya v'av'yalwa v'ako ku'nguno yamwa Abalahamu mukumba wanne.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Haho Isaka wazyengaga ihozezyo kwenu'ko, walisengaga lina lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Hene haho watu'u'laga nkambi' yakwe kwenu'ko, na v'akumba v'akwe v'asi'mbaga lwinzi' lu'ngi'.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, Abimeleki haki'mo na Ahuzati, muyangu' wakwe, na Fikoli, muhanya wa v'asilikale, v'aku'fumaga ku' Gelali na ku'ya ku'mwa Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Nawe Isaka wav'awu'zyaga ati', “Mwiza ku' wanne ku'v'ezya ki'? Si mwangayile na ku'nsaga ku' winywe?” <verse eid="GEN 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga ati', “Nhana kwawine ku'v'a Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' haki'mo nanho. Ku'nguno yeni'yo kwawonaga yi'li' visoga ku'v'ezye ilagano lya ku'hola, ev'e niswe kwilahi'li'zye <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />ati', u'kasye u'ku'v'ezezye mav'i ki'ti' i'vyo iswe ku'kaku'v'ezezizye mav'i. Kwaku'v'ezezizye masoga na ku'ku'leka u'ye na ku'hola. Nhana ev'e u'li' mudosiwa wamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Hohene Isaka wav'av'ezezyaga mwanya, nav'o v'alyaga na ku'nywa. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Wangalu'ke ndiyu' v'ipunaga na kwilahi'li'zya mulahi'. Haho wav'afili'li'zyaga na kwidahya nav'o na ku'hola.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Lu'siku' lwene lu'lo v'akumba v'akwe v'amuletelaga mmola ya lwinzi' u'lo v'av'age v'ali'si'mba, na v'amuwi'laga ati', “Kwapandi'kaga minzi'!” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Lwinzi' lwenu'lo Isaka walwitanaga “Sheba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Sheba” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “mulahi'.”</char></note>.” Ku'nguno yeni'yo, kaya yeni'yo yi'li'witanwa Beeli-sheba ninga walelo.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Esau aho wafikyaga musimo gwa myaka maku'mi ane, watoolaga v'aki'ma v'av'i'li' V'ahiti: Yudisi, mwaniki' wamwa Beeli, na Basemati, mwaniki' wamwa Eloni. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />V'aki'ma v'enav'a hu' yav'aga nnandyo ya misayo ku'mwa Isaka na Lebeka.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Isaka ali'mudosya Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Yav'aga aho Isaka wakiku'laga na minso gakwe gahofulaga, lu'siku' lu'mo wamwitanaga mwane muhanya Esau na ku'muwi'la ati', “Mwana wanne!” Nawe witawu'kaga, “Kalame! Ene aha.” <verse eid="GEN 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Isaka wamuwi'laga ati', “Lingaga, ene gi'si' nakiku'laga. Lu'siku' lwa ku'fwa kwanne nkalu'manya. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Hohene nu'ku'lomba u'sole vilwani'lo vyako, ndunguli ya masonga na wu'ta wako, u'ye mu masenga u'kahi'ge ndimu. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Haho u'mbezezye ki'liwa ki'semu ki'ti' i'vi ntogilwe, u'ndetele ndye, ki'gele nku'dosye aho nkaali' ku'fwa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Kasinaga, itungo i'lo Isaka wav'age ali'su'nsu'mu'la na mwane Esau, Lebeka wav'age apu'li'ki'zizye. Yav'aga Esau aho wayaga mu masenga ku'kahi'ga ki'gele akalete masapi'i'lo ku'mwa ise, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Lebeka wamuwi'laga mwane Yakobo ati', “Lingaga, namwigagwa so ali'muwi'la muku'lu'yo Esau ati', <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />‘Yaga u'kahi'ge ndimu, u'mbezezye ki'liwa ki'semu ki'ti' i'vi ntogilwe, u'ndetele ndye. Haho nku'ku'dosya ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu aho nkaali' ku'fwa.’ <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Mwana wanne, gi'si' degeleka i'cho nu'ku'wi'la na u'ki'v'ezye. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Yaga mu idale lya mbu'li, u'kandetele tu'di'lana tu'v'i'li' tu'soga, ki'gele muv'ezezye so ki'liwa ki'semu i'cho aki'togilwe. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Haho u'mufili'le alye, ki'gele aku'dosye aho akaali' ku'fwa.” <verse eid="GEN 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ali'vi muku'lu' wanne ali' na wu'yenze muv'i'li' gose, nanne ni'na ndi'li' nnelezu! <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Yi'ku'v'a vihe u'lu' v'av'a ampalapasye? Nanne nkwigela nu'muyenga. Ku'nguno yeni'yo nkwiletela nfwizi' ku'leka lu'v'ango.” <verse eid="GEN 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Nnina wamuwi'laga ati', “Mwana wanne, nfwizi' yako yi'ndime ene, ev'e v'ezya du' i'vyo naku'wi'laga. Yaga u'kandetele twenu'to tu'di'lana.”<verse eid="GEN 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />I'vi hu' i'vyo Yakobo wayaga ku'katu'leta twenu'to tu'di'lana, na wamupaga nnina. Haho nnina watekaga ki'liwa ki'soga ki'ti' i'vyo ise wamwa Yakobo atogilwe. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Hangi' Lebeka wingi'laga mu nnumba, wasolaga vizwalo visoga vyamwa Esau mwana wakwe muhanya, i'vyo wav'age navyo, nawe wamuzwi'kaga Yakobo mwana wakwe mudo. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Hangi' wamuzwi'kaga mu makono ndi'li' ya tu'di'lana, na mu lwandi' lwa ndi'li' nnelezu ya nhingo yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Haho wamupaga cheni'cho ki'liwa ki'soga na mugate u'go wagwiv'angaga.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Hohene Yakobo wayaga ku'mwa ise na ku'muwi'la ati', “V'av'a!” Nawe witawu'kaga ati', “Kalame, ene aha, mwana wanne! Ev'e u'li' nde?” <verse eid="GEN 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ene ni' Esau, muv'yalwa wako wa mbele. Nav'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo wali' wambwi'laga. Nu'ku'lomba v'av'a, u'wu'ke wikale, u'lye masapi'i'lo ganne ki'gele u'ndosye.” <verse eid="GEN 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Ali'vi Isaka wamuwu'zyaga ati', “Yakwi'laga vihe ku'gwamuzya wangu' vyeni'vyo, mwana wanne?” Nawe Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako, hu' mwene wangwasyaga.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Haho Isaka wamuwi'laga ati', “Mwana wanne, egela aha nku'palapasye, ki'gele manye u'lu' nhana ev'e hu' u'li' mwana wanne Esau ninga ng'o.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Hohene Yakobo wamwegelaga ise Isaka, nawe wamupalapasyaga na ku'yomba, “Muzwi gwamwa Yakobo, sumbwa makono gamwa Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Ali'vi akamumanyile ku'nguno makono gakwe gav'aga na wu'yenze ki'ti' wa muku'lu'ye Esau. Haho Isaka witu'u'laga visoga ki'gele amudosye mwane.<verse eid="GEN 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Hangi' wamuwu'zyaga ati', “Nhana ev'e hu' u'li' mwana wanne Esau?” Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ene hu' mwene!” <verse eid="GEN 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Haho ise wamuwi'laga ati', “Egezya bi'hi' ki'liwa cha masapi'i'lo gako mwana wanne ndye, ki'gele nku'dosye.” Hohene Yakobo wamwegezezyaga ki'liwa cheni'cho, nawe walyaga. Hangi' wamuletelaga na ki'neneko cha muzabibu nacho wanywaga. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Haho ise wamuwi'laga ati', “Egela bi'hi', mwana wanne, u'nsu'ne.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Hohene Yakobo wamwegelaga ise na ku'musu'na. Isaka aho wigagwa isu' lya vizwalo vya mwana wakwe, wamudosyaga ku' ku'yomba ati',</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 27:27" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">“Lingaga, isu' isoga lya mwana wanne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">li'li' ki'ti' mugu'nda u'go Gu'ku' Mulungu wagu'dosizye!<verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Mulungu akwiti'le lu'me ku'fuma ku' ilunde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">Aku'pe wu'sav'i wa nsi' ya lu'tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">haki'mo na wu'poni wa viliwa na ki'neneko ku' wingi.<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />V'antu' v'a nsi' v'aku'tu'mami'le,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">na makabi'la gaku'ku'v'i'i'le.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">U'v'e gu'ku' wa v'adu'gu'yo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">na v'ana v'amwa nnoko v'aku'ku'v'i'i'le.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Afwizi'i'lwe u'yo alaku'fwizi'i'le,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">na adosiwe u'yo alaku'dosye!”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau nawe ali'lomba lu'v'ango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Yav'aga aho Isaka wamali'laga ku'mudosya, Yakobo wahafumaga henanho. Aho wahafumaga du' hamwa ise, Esau muku'lu'ye nawe wizaga ku'fuma ku' ihi'ga. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Esau nawe wasangwa wav'ezyaga ki'liwa ki'soga na ku'ki'fila ku'mwa ise, haho wamuwi'laga ati', “V'av'a wanne, wu'ka u'lye masapi'i'lo ganne, ene mwana wako, ki'gele u'ndosye!” <verse eid="GEN 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Ise Isaka wawu'zyaga ati', “Ev'e u'li' nde?” Nawe wasu'v'yaga, “Ene ni' Esau, muv'yalwa wako wa mbele.” <verse eid="GEN 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Henanho Isaka watetemaga ku' wov'a muno na ku'yomba, “Ali' nde u'yo wahi'gaga na ku'ndetela masapi'i'lo ga nyama aho ev'e wali' u'kaali' kwiza? Nanne nalyaga na namalaga ku'mudosya, nawe nhana aku'dosiwa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Yav'aga aho Esau wigagwa mihayo zyamwa ise, wali'laga ki'li'lo ki'hanya muno ku' wu'satu. Hangi' wamuwi'laga ise ati', “V'av'a wanne nu'ku'lomba nanne u'ndosye!” <verse eid="GEN 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Ali'vi Isaka wamuwi'laga ati', “Muzunayo wizaga ku' wu'yengani nawe wasolaga lu'v'ango lwako.” <verse eid="GEN 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esau wayombaga, “Hene ali'witanwa Yakobo! Ku'nguno ya wu'yengani wakwe, wasolaga lwandi' lwa lole yanne ka wu'v'i'li'. Wasolile lwandi' lwa lole yanne ya wu'v'yalwa wa mbele, hangi' wasolaga lu'v'ango lwanne!” Haho wamuwu'zyaga ise ati', “Vihe, v'av'a u'kandekelile lu'v'ango ninga lu'mo?” <verse eid="GEN 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Isaka wasu'v'yaga ati', “Lingaga, namalaga ku'muv'ezya av'e gu'ku' wako. V'adu'gu'ye v'ose nav'av'ezyaga v'av'e v'akumba v'akwe. Namuv'ezyaga av'e na wu'poni wa viliwa na ki'neneko. Mwana wanne, alev'e gi'si' nku'ku'v'ezezya ki'?” <verse eid="GEN 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Esau wamuwu'zyaga ise ati', “V'av'a hu' ku'yomba ati', u'li' na lu'v'ango lu'mo du'? V'av'a wanne ndosye nanne!” Hangi' Esau wali'laga ku' muzwi muhanya.<verse eid="GEN 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Ali'vi Isaka ise wasu'v'yaga ati',</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 27:39" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">“Lolaga, wikalo wako wu'ku'v'a ku'le na nsi' ya lu'tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">na lu'me lwa ku' ilunde lu'ku'v'a ku'le nanho.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Wikalo wako wu'ku'v'a wa lu'panga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">na u'lamutu'mami'le muzunayo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">Ali'vi aho u'linyugumpu'zye, u'layi'v'i'nze segeya ya wu'temi wakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo ali'mupeela Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Hohene Esau wamutu'u'li'laga nsika muzunaye, ku'nguno ya lu'v'ango u'lo wapiv'agwa na ise. Wiyombelaga ati', “Nsiku' zya ku'muli'la v'av'a zyegelaga, haho ndamuwu'lage muzuna wanne Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Yav'aga aho Lebeka wigagwa mmola ya mihayo zyamwa Esau mwane muhanya, watu'maga ku'kamwitana mwane mudo Yakobo. Aho wizaga wamuwi'laga ati', “Mwana wanne, Lingaga! Muku'lu'yo ali'wihu'li'kya moyo gwakwe ku' ndaka ya ku'koov'a ku'ku'wu'laga. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Mwana wanne gi'si' u'ndegeleke. Wu'ka u'peelele ku' Halani ku'mwa ilu'mbu' lyanne Labani. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />U'kikale nawe mpaka ki'sila cha muku'lu'yo aho ki'lav'e chamala. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Aho ki'sila cha muku'lu'yo ki'lav'e chamala, alalav'i'le ago wamuv'ezezizye. Haho ndatu'me muntu' aku'londe ki'gele u'su'v'e. Ku' ki' nfwi'lwe na inywe v'ose v'av'i'li' ku' lu'siku' lu'mo?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Haho Lebeka wamuwi'laga Isaka ati', “Ene ni'na wikalo wu'v'i mu moyo gwanne ku'nguno ya av'a v'aki'ma v'a Ki'hiti v'aki' v'amwa Esau. U'lu' na Yakobo atoole ku' v'enav'a V'ahiti, wikalo wanne wu'lav'e na wu'soga ki'?”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />I'vi hu' vyene Isaka wamwitanaga Yakobo, wamudosyaga, na wamupaga ilagi'li'zyo ati', “Ku'du' wize u'toole muki'ma Mukanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Yaga ku' lwandi' lwa Padani-alamu ku'mwa gu'ku'yo Betueli, ise wamwa nnoko. U'katoole muki'ma mugati' na v'aniki' v'ana v'amwa mamiyo Labani, mudu'gu' wamwa nnoko. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wa Nguzu aku'dosye, aku'v'ezye u'v'e na wu'v'yalwa wingi na akwingi'hye muno, ki'gele u'v'e mbuto ya makabi'la. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Mulungu aku'dosye ev'e haki'mo na v'av'yalwa v'ako, aku'pe lu'v'ango lwamwa Abalahamu. U'yi'sole na ku'yi'tema nsi' yeni'yi' i'yi' wikalile ki'ti' mugeni mwizi'li'zi, nsi' i'yi' Mulungu wamupile Abalahamu.”<verse eid="GEN 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Hohene Isaka wamudahyaga Yakobo, nawe walondaga ku' Padani-alamu ku'mwa mamiye Labani, mwana wamwa Betueli, Mualamu, ilu'mbu'ye na Lebeka, nnina wamwa Yakobo na Esau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau ali'toola muki'ma wa wu'datu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Ali'vi Esau wamanyaga ku'v'a Isaka wamudosyaga Yakobo na wamutu'maga ku'ya ku' Padani-alamu, ki'gele akatoole kwenu'ko, hangi' aho wali' ali'mudosya wamupaga ilagi'li'zyo ku'du' ize atoole mwaniki' Mukanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Hangi' wamanyaga ku'v'a Yakobo wav'aku'zyaga ise na nnina, nawe wayaga ku' Padani-alamu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Hohene, Esau wamanyaga ku'v'a ise Isaka akatogeziwa na v'aniki' v'a Ki'kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo Esau wayaga ku'mwa Isumaili, mwana wamwa Abalahamu, watoolaga muki'ma yu'ngi' mwana wamwa Isumaili, lina lyakwe Mahalati, ilu'mbu'ye na Nebayoti.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndoti yamwa Yakobo ku' Beteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Nawe Yakobo aho wawu'kaga ku' Beeli-sheba ku' lu'go lwav'o, walondaga ku' kaya ya Halani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Aho wafikaga lwandi' lu'mo, wawonaga alale henanho ku'nguno lyu'v'a lyasangwa lyalokaga. Wasolaga iwe li'mo lya henanho wali'sagami'laga na ku'lala tu'lo henanho. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Itungo lya ku'lala kwakwe walotaga ndoti. Lingaga! Wawonaga itandi'zyo li'ki'ndi'kilwe ku'fuma ha nsi', na nsoto yakwe yi'fikile ku' ilunde. Lingaga! Hangi' v'amalaika v'a Mulungu v'ali'liina na ku'sooka ku' itandi'zyo lyeni'lo.<verse eid="GEN 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Kasinaga! Gu'ku' Mulungu wi'maga ha igu'lya na itandi'zyo, wayombaga, “Ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wamwa gu'ku'yo Abalahamu, na Mulungu wamwa Isaka. Nsi' i'yi' u'lali'lile nku'ku'pa ev'e na wu'v'yalwa wako. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />V'av'yalwa v'ako ndav'ingi'hye ki'ti' lu'wuwu lwa nsi', nav'o v'alasambale ku' ki'la lwandi': ku' mweli, ku' ki'ya, ku' sukuma na ku' dakama. Ku'v'i'ti'la ku' wako magongo gose ga mu welelo galadosiwe. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Lingaga, ene ni' haki'mo nanho, ndaku'su'nge ki'la u'ko u'lakaye, nanne ndaku'su'v'ye hangi' mu nsi' yeni'yi'. Nkasye nku'leke, sumbwa ndaku'gelani'zi'zye gose ago nayombile.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Aho Yakobo watunu'laga, wayombaga ati', “Nhana Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' henanha, nanne nali' nkamanya!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Nawe wogohaga, na wayombaga, “Henanha hatuntumu ki'ti' ki'! I'vi nu'wona henanha yi'li' nnumba ya Mulungu, na wingi'li'lo wa ku' ilunde.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Wangalu'ke ndiyu' Yakobo watunu'laga, wali'solaga iwe i'lo wav'age asagami'lile, wali'ki'ndi'kaga wi'i'ma ki'ti' nhi'ngi' na ku'li'v'ezya isondo ku' ku'liti'li'la maguta. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Lwandi' lwenu'lo wahitanaga “Beteli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Beteli” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “nnumba yamwa Mulungu.”</char></note>,” ali'vi kaya yeni'yo ha kale hitanagwe Luzu.<verse eid="GEN 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Yakobo watu'u'laga hangi' ki'lu'mbo ati', “Ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu, u'lu' u'ku'v'a haki'mo nanne, na ku'nsu'nga ku' musi'nzo gwanne, na ku'mpa viliwa na vizwalo, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />na ku'su'v'a na ku'hola ku' lu'go lwamwa v'av'a, hohene Gu'ku' Mulungu, u'ku'v'a Mulungu wanne. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Nalyo iwe i'li' naki'ndi'kaga henanha ki'ti' nhi'ngi', yi'ku'v'a nnumba yako, ev'e Mulungu, na ku' ki'la i'cho u'lampe, nhana ndaku'fumi'zye ifungu lya iku'mi.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo ali'fika ku' Padani-alamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Hohene Yakobo wendeleyaga na musi'nzo gwakwe, na wafikaga ku' nsi' zya v'antu' v'a mu ki'ya. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Aho wafikaga kwenu'ko, wawonaga madale adatu' ga nkolo na mbu'li galalile mu mbu'ga. Kasinaga, henanho ku'li' na lwinzi', na nkolo na mbu'li zyeni'zyo zyav'age zilindi'lile ku'nywisiwa minzi' ku'fuma mu lwinzi' lwenu'lo, u'lo lwav'age lu'kundi'ki'lilwe na iwe ihanya. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Ki'ti'le cha ki'la lu'siku' chav'age i'vi: Itungo madale ga nkolo na mbu'li aho gav'age u'lu' gikuminga henanho, hu' hene v'adi'mi v'apiliminsyage iwe lyeni'lo ku'fuma ha lwinzi', ki'gele v'azinywisye. U'lu' v'amali'la ku'nywisya v'ali'su'v'yage iwe lyeni'lo ha igu'lya na lwinzi'.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yakobo wav'awu'zyaga v'adi'mi ati', “V'adu'gu' v'anne mufumi'i'lile ku'he?” Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga, “Ku'fumi'i'lile ku' Halani.” <verse eid="GEN 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Wav'awu'zyaga hangi', “Vihe, mumumanyile Labani, mwizu'ku'lu' wamwa Naholi?” Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga ati', “Ku'mumanyile”. <verse eid="GEN 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Hangi' wav'awu'zyaga, “Vihe, mupanga?” Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga ati', “Ali' mupanga. Lingaga, Lahele u'yo izile na nkolo na mbu'li hu' mwaniki' wakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Haho Yakobo wav'awi'laga ati', “Lingaga, lyu'v'a li'kaali' isewu na itungo lya ku'kuminga mitugo li'kaali' ku'fika. Gi'si' munywisye mitugo, na muzisu'v'ye ku' idi'ma.” <verse eid="GEN 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Ali'vi v'adi'mi v'enav'o v'asu'v'yaga ati', “Ku'kakowolile ku'nywisya, mpaka madale gose gikuminge haki'mo. Haho ku'ku'li'piliminsya iwe ku'fuma ha lwinzi' na ku'zinywisya mitugo.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Aho Yakobo wav'age akaali' ali'su'nsu'mu'la na v'adi'mi v'enav'o, Lahele wafikaga na nkolo na mbu'li zyamwa ise, ku'nguno hu' u'yo wav'age mudi'mi wa mitugo. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Yav'aga aho Yakobo wamuwonaga Lahele, mwaniki' wamwa mamiye Labani, haki'mo na nkolo na mbu'li zyamwa Labani, wangu'haga ku'ya ku' lwinzi', wapiliminsyaga iwe lyeni'lo ku'fuma ha igu'lya na lwinzi', na ku'zinywisya mitugo zyamwa mamiye. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Hangi' Yakobo wamusu'naga Lahele na ku'li'la ku' wu'togwe, <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />na wamuwi'laga ati', “Ene ni' mudu'gu' wamwa so, ni' mwana wamwa Lebeka!” Haho Lahele wapeelaga ku'ya ku' lu'go na ku'muwi'la ise mmola yamwa Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Yav'aga aho Labani wigagwa mmola yamwa Yakobo, mwana wamwa ilu'mbu'ye, wayaga lu'v'i'lo ku'kamusu'mbi'la. Aho wafikaga wamuwungati'laga na ku'musu'na, wamuletaga mu lu'go lwakwe. Haho Yakobo wamuwi'laga Labani magambo gose. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Nawe Labani wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nhana ev'e u'li' mudu'gu' wanne na u'li' magazi ganne!” Hohene Yakobo wikalaga hamwa Labani mwezi gu'mo.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo ali'v'atoola Leya na Lahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, Labani wamuwi'laga Yakobo ati', “Ev'e u'li' mudu'gu' wanne. Ali'vi yi'kav'ile visoga ku'v'a u'ntu'mami'le mili'mo gele. U'mbwi'le u'li'koov'a nku'li'pe lu'v'alo ki'?” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Itungo lyeni'lo Labani wasangwa ali' na v'aniki' v'av'i'li'. Muhanya witanagwe Leya, na mudo witanagwe Lahele.<verse eid="GEN 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Leya wav'age na minso makondu, ali'vi Lahele wav'age mwaniki' mugololoku, ali' na wisuki'lo. <verse eid="GEN 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Yakobo wav'age amutogilwe Lahele, haho wamuwi'laga Labani ati', “Nku'ku'tu'mami'la mili'mo mu itungo lya myaka mupungati', nanho u'ku'mpa Lahele u'yo mwaniki' wako mudo ki'gele mmutoole.” <verse eid="GEN 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Labani wayombaga ati', “Yi'li' visoga nku'tozye ev'e, ku'ki'la ku'mupa muntu' yu'ngi'. Ev'e ikalaga ha wanne.”<verse eid="GEN 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Hohene Yakobo wamutu'mami'laga mili'mo Labani mu itungo lya myaka mupungati', ki'gele amutoole Lahele. Ali'vi myaka mupungati' zyeni'zyo, Yakobo waziwonaga ki'ti' nsiku' ndoo du'hu', ku'nguno wav'age amutogilwe muno Lahele.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Aho Yakobo wamalaga itungo lyeni'lo, wamuwi'laga Labani ati', “Nagelani'zyaga myaka yanne ya ku'ku'tu'mami'la mili'mo. Ku'nguno yeni'yo, mpage muki' wanne, ki'gele mmutoole.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Hohene Labani wav'ilingaga v'antu' v'ose v'a henanho, na wav'ezyaga mwanya gwa viliwa na vinywiwa vingi.<verse eid="GEN 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Ali'vi aho lyafikaga itungo lya mpi'ndi', Labani wamusolaga Leya mwana wakwe muhanya, wamufili'laga Yakobo, nawe Yakobo walalaga nawe. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Labani ndi' wasangwa wamupa Leya muzya wakwe Zilipa, ki'gele av'e muzya wamwa Leya. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Wangalu'ke ndiyu' Yakobo wamanyaga ku'v'a kasinaga wapiv'agwa Leya! Akav'ile Lahele, hohene Yakobo wayaga ku'kamuwu'zya Labani ati', “Wambezezyaga igambo ki'? Naku'tu'mami'lile mili'mo ki'gele mmutoole Lahele, gi'si' ku'nguno wankonga?” <verse eid="GEN 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Labani wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ku'no ku' wiswe yi'kav'ile ki'ti'lwe ku'mutozya mwaniki' mudo, u'lu' muku'lu'ye akaali' ku'toolwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Gi'si' u'v'ezye i'vi: U'male nsiku' mupungati' zya wi'nga wamwa Leya, haho nku'ku'pa na Lahele. Ali'vi u'ku'ntu'mami'la hangi' ku' itungo lya myaka mupungati' zingi'.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Hohene Yakobo wazumyaga. Wamalaga nsiku' mupungati' zya wi'nga wamwa Leya, nawe Labani wamupaga Lahele nawe av'e muki' wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Labani wamufumyaga Biliha muzya wakwe, wamupaga Lahele ki'gele av'e muzya wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Hohene Yakobo walalaga na Lahele hangi'. Ali'vi wav'age amutogilwe Lahele ku'ki'la Leya. Yakobo wamutu'mami'laga Labani ku' itungo lya myaka mupungati' zingi'.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">V'ana wamwa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Aho Gu'ku' Mulungu wawonaga ku'v'a Leya akav'ile mutoneke, haho wamupaga wu'v'yazi, sumbwa Lahele wav'aga mugu'mba. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Leya wapandi'kaga mwitungo, nawe wav'yalaga mwana wa ki'gosya, wayombaga ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu wawonaga lu'duko lwanne, gi'si' mugosi wanne aku'ntogwa.” Ku'nguno yeni'yo wamupaga lina Lubeni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Lubeni” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “Lingaga, mwana wa ki'gosya.”</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Leya wapandi'kaga hangi' mwitungo, wav'yalaga mwana wa ki'gosya, wayombaga ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu wampaga hangi' mwana wa ki'gosya, ku'nguno wigagwa ku'v'a nkav'ile mutoneke.” Ku'nguno yeni'yo wamupaga lina lyakwe Simiyoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Simiyoni” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “kwigwa.”</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Wapandi'kaga hangi' mwitungo, nawe wav'yalaga mwana wa ki'gosya, wayombaga ati', “Itungo lyeni'li', mugosi wanne aku'v'a haki'mo nanne ku'nguno namuv'yali'laga v'ana v'adatu' v'a ki'gosya.” Ku'nguno yeni'yo wamupaga lina Lawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Lawi” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “ku'lu'ngya.”</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Wapandi'kaga hangi' mwitungo, wav'yalaga mwana wa ki'gosya, wayombaga ati', “Itungo lyeni'li' nu'mukumi'li'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu.” Ku'nguno yeni'yo, wamupaga lina Yuda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Yuda” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “aku'kumi'li'ziwa.”</char></note>. Nawe walekaga ku'v'yala.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Nawe Lahele aho wawonaga ku'v'a akav'ile ku'muv'yali'la Yakobo v'ana, haho walamulaga ku'muwonela iwu'v'a muku'lu'ye Leya. Hohene wamuwi'laga Yakobo, “U'mpe v'ana, u'lu' yi'kav'e vyeni'vyo, ene nku'fwa!” <verse eid="GEN 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Ali'vi Yakobo wamudaki'laga muno Lahele na ku'muwi'la ati', “I'vi, ene wambezyaga hu' Mulungu u'yo waku'tungile wu'v'yazi ki'gele u'leke ku'v'yala v'ana?” <verse eid="GEN 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Nawe Lahele wasu'v'yaga ati', “Henanha ali'ho muzya wanne Biliha, nu'ku'lomba u'lale nawe ki'gele ambyali'le v'ana. Ku'v'i'ti'la ku' wakwe nanne mpandi'ke v'ana!”<verse eid="GEN 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Hu' i'vyo Lahele wamupaga Yakobo muzya wakwe, Biliha, av'e isuli'la wakwe. Nawe Yakobo walalaga nawe. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Haho Biliha wav'aga na mwitungo, na wamuv'yali'laga Yakobo mwana wa ki'gosya. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Hohene Lahele wayombaga ati', “Mulungu wigagwa ku'lomba kwanne, wambezezyaga lole, na ku'mpa mwana wa ki'gosya.” Ku'nguno yeni'yo wamupaga lina mwana mwenu'yo Dani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Dani” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “ku'v'ezezya lole.”</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Biliha, muzya wamwa Lahele, hangi' wav'aga na mwitungo na ku'muv'yali'la Yakobo mwana wa wu'v'i'li' wa ki'gosya. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Haho Lahele wayombaga ati', “Nali' ni'na wikinde wu'hanya na muku'lu' wanne, nanne nakindaga!” Ku'nguno yeni'yo wamupaga lina mwana mwenu'yo Nafutali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Nafutali” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “wikinde.”</char></note>.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Yav'aga aho Leya wawonaga ku'v'a walekaga ku'v'yala, haho wamusolaga muzya wakwe Zilipa na ku'mupa Yakobo av'e isuli'la wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Nawe Zilipa wamuv'yali'laga Yakobo mwana wa ki'gosya. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Hohene Leya wayombaga ati', “Kwenu'ku' kwelu'ki'lwa!” Ku'nguno yeni'yo wamupaga lina mwana mwenu'yo Gadi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Gadi” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “Kwelu'ki'lwa.”</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Zilipa, muzya wamwa Leya, wamuv'yali'laga hangi' Yakobo mwana yu'ngi' wa ki'gosya. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Haho Leya wayombaga ati', “Ni'na hambu' ene! Ninga v'aki'ma v'ichane v'aku'nitana mwelu'ki'lwa.” Ku'nguno yeni'yo wamupaga lina mwana mwenu'yo Asheli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Asheli” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “Hambu'.”</char></note>.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Yav'age ha itungo lya lyi'mbu'la lya ngano, lu'siku' lu'mo Lubeni wayaga ku' mugu'nda, na kwenu'ko wawonaga mimelo zya ntalantu', wazisolaga na ku'muletela nnina Leya. Haho Lahele wamuwi'laga Leya ati', “Nu'lomba nanne mimelo zya ntalantu' i'zyo waletaga mwano.” <verse eid="GEN 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Ali'vi Leya wasu'v'yaga ati', “U'li'wiganika ati' igambo ido ku'mpuzya mugosi wanne? Hangi' u'li'koov'a ku'sola na mimelo zya ntalantu' zya mwana wanne?” Sumbwa Lahele wayombaga ati', “Endita! U'lu' u'ku'mpa ntalantu' zya mwano, walelo Yakobo akwiza ku'lala nanho.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Yav'aga mu lyu'v'a lya mpi'ndi', aho Yakobo wav'age asu'v'ile ku'fuma ku' mugu'nda, Leya wayaga ku'kamusu'mbi'la na ku'muwi'la, “Yi'li'ku'dima walelo u'lale nanne. Naku'pandi'kaga ku' ndi'pi ya ntalantu' zya mwana wanne.” Hohene Yakobo walalaga nawe wu'ziku' wenu'wo.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Mulungu wigagwa ku'lomba kwamwa Leya. Nawe Leya wav'aga na mwitungo, na ku'muv'yali'la Yakobo mwana wa ki'gosya wa wu'tano. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Hangi' Leya wayombaga ati', “Mulungu wansu'v'i'zyaga ndi'pi yanne ku'nguno nali' namupile muzya wanne mugosi wanne!” Ku'nguno yeni'yo wamupaga lina mwana mwenu'yo Isakali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Isakali” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “ku'li'pi'lwa.”</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Hangi' Leya wav'aga na mwitungo na ku'muv'yali'la mwana wa ki'gosya wa mukaga. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Haho Leya wayombaga ati', “Mulungu wampaga lu'holo lu'soga muno. Gi'si' mugosi wanne nanne aku'mpa isima, ku'nguno namuv'yali'laga v'ana v'a ki'gosya mukaga.” Ku'nguno yeni'yo wamupaga lina mwana mwenu'yo Sebuloni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Sebuloni” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “isima,” na hangi' likolile na “lu'holo.”</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Aho lyav'i'taga itungo wav'yalaga mwana wa ki'ki'ma, wamwitanaga lina lyakwe Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Hangi' Mulungu wamulawaga Lahele, wazumyaga ku'lomba kwakwe, na wamutungu'laga wu'v'yazi wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Haho Lahele wav'aga na mwitungo na wav'yalaga mwana wa ki'gosya na ku'yomba, “Gi'si' Mulungu wansini'zyaga nsoni zyanne!” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Haho wamupaga lina mwana mwenu'yo Yosefu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Yosefu” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “anongezezye yu'ngi'.”</char></note> na ku'yomba, “Gu'ku' Mulungu anongezezye mwana yu'ngi' wa ki'gosya.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'damalu'ka kwamwa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Aho Lahele wamuv'yalaga Yosefu, Yakobo wamuwi'laga Labani ati', “Ndeku'li'le nsu'v'e ku' lu'go ku' nsi' yiswe. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />U'mpe v'aki' v'anne na v'ana v'anne av'o nav'apandi'kile ku' wu'tu'mami wanne ku' wako, ki'gele mbu'ke nav'o. Ku'nguno u'manyile i'vi naku'tu'mami'lile visoga.” <verse eid="GEN 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Ali'vi Labani wasu'v'yaga ati', “Hani leka nanne njombe. Nu'ku'lomba wikale du' henanha! Ku'nguno nalagu'lile na ku'manya ku'v'a Gu'ku' Mulungu wandosizye ku'nguno yako. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Yomba ndi'pi i'yo u'li'koov'a nanne nku'ku'li'pa.” <verse eid="GEN 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Nawe Yakobo wayombaga ati', “Ev'e mweni'ki'li' u'manyile i'vi naku'tu'mami'lile na i'vi nali' nu'zidi'ma mitugo zyako, na i'vyo zyav'age ku' wanne. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Itungo i'lo nav'age nkaali' kwiza ha wako, wav'age na mitugo midoo du'hu', sumbwa ku'fuma aho nizile ha wako, Gu'ku' Mulungu waku'dosizye ku' ki'la aho nav'i'tage. Ali'vi gi'si' ene nditu'mami'le nanali' na kwiv'ezezya magambo ga nnumba yanne?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Labani wamuwu'zyaga ati', “Yomba u'li'koov'a nku'pe ki'?” Nawe Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ku'du' u'mpe ki'ntu'. Ali'vi u'lu' u'li'koov'a nku'di'mi'lage u'zumye i'cho nku'ku'wi'la, hu' nanne nku'zumya hangi' ku'di'ma na kwangali'la mitugo zyako. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Ndeke walelo ningi'le mu ki'la idale, na ku'koma ki'la nkolo zya mabadomabado na zya mav'alamav'ala na ki'la nkolo nnilawu'zu na mbu'li zya mabado na zya mav'alamav'ala. Zyeni'zi hu' ziku'v'a wu'tenensya wanne. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Ha nsiku' zya mbele, aho u'lize ku'wu'lola wu'tenensya wanne ku'fuma ku' wako hu' aho lole yanne yi'ligele. Ki'la mbu'li na ki'la nkolo i'yo yi'lav'e yi'gele mabadomabado na mav'alamav'ala na nkolo i'yo yi'kav'ile nnilawu'zu yi'lav'aziwe ku'v'a nakwiv'i'laga.” <verse eid="GEN 30:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Nawe Labani wayombaga, “Visoga, nazumyaga na yi'v'e ki'ti' i'vyo wayombaga.”<verse eid="GEN 30:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Yav'aga lu'siku' lwene lu'lo, Labani wayaga ku'kazikoma ngulati' zyose zya machelule na mabado, na mbu'li zyose nki'ma i'zyo zyav'age na mav'alamav'ala na mabadomabado. Wazikomaga mbu'li zyose i'zyo zyav'age na wape mu muv'i'li' gwazyo, na nkolo i'zyo zyav'age na wilawu'zu mu miv'i'li' zyazyo. Zyose zyeni'zi wazitu'u'laga mu wu'su'ngi wa v'aane. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Haho Labani haki'mo na v'aane v'awu'kaga henanho na mitugo zyeni'zyo, na v'ayu'mbaga musi'nzo gwa nsiku' idatu', v'ikomaga ku'le na Yakobo. Nawe Yakobo wasigalaga ali'di'ma mitugo zyamwa Labani i'zyo zyasigali'lile.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Hohene Yakobo wasolaga ngito ntoto zya mulubuna, mulozi na mwalamoni. Waziku'v'aga magu'la, ki'gele gigele machelule gape mu ngito zyeni'zyo. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Haho Yakobo wazisolaga ngito zyeni'zyo, na ku'zikimi'ka ha mapango ga ku'nywisi'zya mitugo, aho zili'wizaga ku'nywa minzi'. Mitugo aho zizaga ku'nywa minzi' henanho ziliinaga na ku'suki'la. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Yav'aga ndimu i'zyo zyasuki'laga ha mbele ya ngito zyeni'zyo, zyawu'taga mitugo zya machelule, mabado na mav'alamav'ala. <verse eid="GEN 30:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Nawe Yakobo wagakomaga genago manyehe ga mitugo, na wagalingi'ki'zyaga ku' mitugo zya machelule na zya wilawu'zu ku' idale lyamwa Labani. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yi' Yakobo wazilekaniaga mitugo zyakwe na zyamwa Labani nawe akazisangizye. <verse eid="GEN 30:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Yav'aga ha itungo lya ku'liinwa mitugo migi'nu, hohene Yakobo wazikimi'kaga i'zyo ngito ha mapango ga ku'nywisi'zya ha mbele na mitugo, ki'gele zisuki'le ha mbele na ngito zyeni'zyo. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Ali'vi akazikimi'kile ngito zyeni'zyo ha itungo lya ku'liinwa mitugo zya wu'gande. Ku'nguno yeni'yo Labani wav'aga na mitugo zya wu'gande, na Yakobo wav'aga na mitugo zya nguzu.<verse eid="GEN 30:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Mpeleleko yakwe, Yakobo wadamalu'kaga muno. Wav'aga na madale mahanya ga nkolo na mbu'li nyingi, mpunda na ntwangawu'lende, haki'mo na v'akumba v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo ali'mutoloka Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Hohene Yakobo wigagwa mihayo ku'v'a v'asu'mbana v'ana v'amwa Labani v'ali'saya ati', “Yakobo wasolile nsawo yose yamwa siswe, hene wadamalu'kaga.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Hangi' Yakobo wamanyaga ku'v'a Labani akamutogwa ninga ku'mugola ki'ti' i'vyo wav'age ha mbu'ki'. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Yakobo, “Su'v'a ku' nsi' ya v'av'yazi v'ako na v'adu'gu'yo u'ko wav'yali'lwa, nanne nku'v'a haki'mo nanho.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Hohene Yakobo watu'mi'zyaga nkombe ku'mwa Lahele na Leya, ki'gele v'ize ku' idi'ma u'ko kwav'age na mitugo zyakwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Aho v'afikaga kwenu'ko wav'awi'laga ati', “Nawonaga sinywe akantogwa ninga ku'ngola ki'ti' i'vyo wav'age ha mbu'ki'. Ali'vi Mulungu wamwa v'av'a wanne wav'aga haki'mo nanne. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Ali'vi ninga inywe mumanyile ku'v'a namutu'mami'lile sinywe ku' nguzu zyanne zyose. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Ninga vyeni'vyo, sinywe wankongaga na ku'galu'zya wu'tenensya wanne kali' iku'mi. Ali'vi Mulungu wani'mi'i'laga aleke ku'nvulazya. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Wav'age u'lu' wayomba, ‘Ndimu zya mav'alamav'ala hu' wu'lav'e wu'tenensya wako,’ hohene idale lyose zyawu'taga zya mav'alamav'ala. Hangi' u'lu' wayomba, ‘Ndimu zya machelule hu' wu'lav'e wu'tenensya wako.’ Hohene idale lyose zyawu'taga zya machelule. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />I'vi hu' vyene Mulungu wasolile visawa vyamwa sinywe na ku'mpa ene.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />“Ha itungo lya ndimu ku'suki'la, ndi' nawona mu ndoti magulati' ago gav'age gali'zisenda gose gav'age na machelule, mav'alamav'ala na mabadomabado. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Malaika wa Mulungu wayombaga nanne mu ndoti, wanitanaga, ‘Yakobo,’ Nanne nitawu'kaga, ‘Kalame!’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Nawe wambwi'laga, ‘Lingaga magulati' ago gali'senda, gose gali' na machelule, mav'alamav'ala na mabadomabado. Igambo lyeni'li' lyav'aga vyeni'vyo ku'nguno nawonaga i'vi Labani waku'v'ezezyaga. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Ene hu' ni' Mulungu u'yo ndi' wakwifumi'i'la ku' Beteli, u'ko waki'ndi'kile nhi'ngi' ya iwe na ku'li'v'ila maguta, haki'mo na ku'ntu'u'li'la ki'lu'mbo. Gi'si' u'mufume mu nsi' yeni'yi', u'su'v'e ku' nsi' i'yo wav'yali'lwa.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Lahele na Leya v'asu'v'yaga ati', “Iswe ku'ku'ya nanho, ku'nguno ku'li' wu'du'hu' cha ku'saala mu lu'go lwamwa siswe. <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Musav'a ali'ku'v'azya iswe ki'ti' v'ageni, hene waku'gu'zizye, na ndi'pi yeni'yo wamalile ku'yi'lya yose! <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Wu'sav'i wose u'wo Mulungu wawu'solile ku'fuma ku'mwa siswe, nhana yi'li' nsawo yiswe na v'ana v'iswe. Ku'nguno yeni'yo ev'e v'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vi Mulungu waku'wi'lile.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Haho Yakobo wiv'angaga ku' musi'nzo, wav'aliiniaga v'ana v'akwe na v'aki' v'akwe ha igu'lya na ntwangawu'lende. <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Wasolaga mitugo zyakwe zyose haki'mo na nsawo yose i'yo wasangwa wakwav'ile ku' Padani-alamu, wandyaga musi'nzo ku'su'v'a ku'mwa ise Isaka, ku' nsi' ya Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Itungo lyeni'lo Labani ndi' wayaga ku'kasu'nzu'la woya wa nkolo zyakwe, haho Lahele wapandi'kaga itungo lya kwiv'a vimbulimbuli vya ha misengelo gamwa ise. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Hangi' Yakobo wamuyengaga Labani, Mualamu, ku' ku'wu'ka ninga ku'dahya ng'o. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Hohene Yakobo wasolaga nsawo na vintu' vyakwe vyose, watolokaga navyo. Wagu'ki'laniaga mongo gwa Efulate, walondaga ku' ngu'lu' zya ku' lwandi' lwa Gileadi.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Labani ali'mulondezya Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Aho zyav'i'taga nsiku' idatu', haho Labani wamanyaga ku'v'a Yakobo watolokile. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Haho Labani wav'av'ilingaga v'adu'gu'ye ku'v'a haki'mo nawe, v'amulondezyaga Yakobo ku' lu'gendo lwa nsiku' mupungati', na v'amupandi'kaga ku' ngu'lu' zya lwandi' lwa Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Ali'vi wu'ziku', Mulungu wamwizi'i'laga Labani mu ndoti, wamuwi'laga ati', “Wiangali'le! Ku'du' u'mukange Yakobo ku' muhayo ninga gu'mo.”<verse eid="GEN 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Hohene Labani wamupandi'kaga Yakobo ku' ngu'lu' zya lwandi' lwenu'lo lwa Gileadi. Itungo lyeni'lo Yakobo wasangwa watu'u'lile nkambi' yakwe kwenu'ko. Labani nawe haki'mo na v'adu'gu'ye nav'o v'atu'u'laga nkambi' yav'o kwenu'ko. <verse eid="GEN 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Haho Labani wamuwu'zyaga Yakobo ati', “Wav'ezyaga vihe? Wanjengaga na ku'v'asola v'aniki' v'anne ki'ti' v'asampwa v'a wu'lu'gu'. <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Ku' ki' watolokaga na ku'njenga? Ku' ki' u'kambwi'lile ki'gele kwidahye lwa miyeye, ngoma, tu'dono na nni'mbo? <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Ku' ki' u'kampile itungo lya ku'v'adahya av'a v'aniki' v'ana v'anne lwa ku'v'asu'na na ku'v'awungati'la v'izu'ku'lu' v'anne? Nhana wav'ezyaga igambo lya ki'lele! <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Ene ni'na wu'kowozi wa ku'ku'vulazya, ali'vi Mulungu wamwa so wali' wanizi'i'laga wu'ziku' na ku'mbwi'la ati', ‘Wiangali'le, ku'du' u'mukange Yakobo ku' muhayo ninga gu'mo.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Gi'si' manyile ku'v'a u'li' na nnamba ya ku'su'v'a ku'mwa so. Ali'vi ku' ki' waniv'i'lile vimbulimbuli vyanne vya kwisengela?”<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ndi' nogoha na kwiganika ku'v'a u'kowolile ku'mpuzya ku' nguzu av'a v'aniki', v'ana v'ako. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Ali'vi muntu' u'yo u'ku'musanga ali' na vimbulimbuli vya ku' wako afwe henanha. Ev'e koov'a mu miligo ziswe henanha ha mbele ya v'adu'gu' v'iswe, na i'cho u'ku'wona ki'li' chako u'ki'sole.” Itungo lyeni'lo Yakobo wav'age akamanyile ku'v'a Lahele wiv'aga vyeni'vyo vimbulimbuli vyamwa ise.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Haho Labani wakoov'aniaga mu ikutu lyamwa Yakobo, Leya na mu ikutu lya av'o v'azya v'av'i'li', ali'vi akaviwonile. Wafumaga mu ikutu lyamwa Leya na wingi'laga mu ikutu lyamwa Lahele. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Ali'vi Lahele hu' mwene ndi' wavisolile vimbulimbuli vyeni'vyo, na ku'viv'isa ha vyanzwa vya ha igu'lya na ntwangawu'lende, nawe wikalaga henanho. Labani wavipeselaga mu ikutu lyeni'lo ali'vi akaviwine.<verse eid="GEN 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Nawe Lahele wamuwi'laga ise ati', “U'mbonele ki'sa v'av'a wanne, ku'du' u'gaye, nkakowola kwi'ma ha mbele yako, ku'nguno ni' ku' nsiku' zyanne.” Labani wavikoov'aga vimbulimbuli vyakwe ali'vi akaviwine.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Haho Yakobo wagayaga na ku'muwu'zya Labani ku' wu'daki ati', “Nakaku'kenia ki' mpaka wandondezyaga vyeni'vi? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Gi'si' ku'nguno wafunyu'nku'laga miligo zyanne wapandi'kaga ki' cha mu lu'go lwako? Ki'tu'u'le aha ha mbele ya minso ga v'adu'gu' v'iswe, ene nanho, ki'gele nav'o v'ayangu'le mugati' yanne nanho. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Nikalaga haki'mo nanho ku' myaka maku'mi av'i'li', na ku' matungo gose genago, ku'du'hu' mbu'li ninga nkolo i'yo yahulumu'zizye. Ninga ng'ondi yi'mo ku'fuma mu madale ga nkolo zyako nkaali' ndyage. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Nkaali' nku'letelage mutugo u'go gu'lilwe na ndimu zya mu ipolu, ene mweni'ki'li' nafumyage ndi'pi. Hangi' ninga mutugo mbe gwiv'agwa wu'ziku' ninga lyu'v'a wantondage ene ndi'pe! <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Hu' vyene nav'age nu'tuka muno na lyu'v'a isewu, na wu'ziku' mbeho ndaki mpaka tu'lo twalambage. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Myaka zyose maku'mi av'i'li', nikalaga ku' wako lwa makoye genago. Naku'tu'mami'lile myaka iku'mi na ine ki'gele mbatoole v'aniki' v'ako v'av'i'li', na myaka zingi' mukaga naku'tu'mami'lile ku'nguno ya mitugo zyako, ali'vi wangalu'li'lile wu'tenensya wanne mpaka kali' iku'mi. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />U'lu' Mulungu wamwa gu'ku' wanne Abalahamu, Mulungu u'yo v'av'a wanne Isaka ndi' amogohile, wali' aleke ku'v'a haki'mo nanne, nhana wali' u'ku'nsaga nsu'v'e makono du'. Ali'vi Mulungu wawonaga lu'duko lwanne na mili'mo i'zyo natu'mamile ku' makono ganne, hu' mwene waku'hangi'li'zyaga wu'ziku' wa walelo.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Labani na Yakobo v'ali'witu'u'la ilagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Nawe Labani wasu'v'yaga ati', “Av'a v'aniki' v'ali' v'ana v'anne, na av'a v'ana v'ali' v'izu'ku'lu' v'anne, hangi' madale ga mitugo zyeni'zi gali' ganne, na vyose i'vi u'wine henanha vili' vyanne. Ali'vi lelo nku'v'av'ezezya ki' v'aniki' v'enav'a na v'ana v'av'o av'o v'av'yalile? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Gi'si' izu'u' ku'v'ezye ilagano. Ilagano lyeni'li' li'v'e ki'ti' wu'sangi'lwa mugati' yanne nanho.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Hohene Yakobo wasolaga iwe, wali'ki'ndi'kaga ki'ti' nhi'ngi' ya ku'v'izu'ki'zya. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Hangi' Yakobo wav'awi'laga v'adu'gu'ye ati', “Mukuminge mawe.” Nav'o v'akumingaga ituntu lya mawe. Aho v'amali'laga ku'kuminga, v'alyaga viliwa bi'hi' na ituntu lya mawe genago. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Haho Labani walitanaga ituntu lyeni'lo “Yegali-sahaduta” sumbwa Yakobo walitanaga “Galedi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Yegali-sahaduta” ku' Ki'alamu na lina “Galedi” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “ituntu lya wu'sangi'lwa.”</char></note>.”<verse eid="GEN 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Hangi' Labani wamuwi'laga Yakobo ati', “Ku'fuma walelo ituntu lyeni'li' hu' wu'ku'v'a wu'sangi'lwa mugati' yanne nanho.” Ku'nguno yeni'yo litanagwa lina Galedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Nhi'ngi' yeni'yo ya mawe Labani wayitanaga Mizipa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Mizipa” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “ku'lawa.”</char></note> na ku'yomba ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'lawe ku' matungo gose ago ku'lav'e ku'le ku'le ku'kakowola kwiwona ene nanho. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />U'lu' wize u'v'atusye v'ana v'anne, ninga u'lu' wize wongezye ku'toola v'aki'ma v'angi', ninga mbe ku'du'hu' musangi'lwa yu'ngi' wizu'ki'le ku'v'a Mulungu hu' mwene musangi'lwa wiswe mugati' yanne nanho.”<verse eid="GEN 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Hangi' Labani wamuwi'laga Yakobo ati', “Lingaga ituntu i'li' lya mawe na nhi'ngi' i'yi' nayi'ki'ndi'kaga hagati' yanne nanho. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Ituntu lyeni'li' lya mawe na nhi'ngi' yeni'yi' hu' wu'sangi'lwa ku'v'a ene nkasye nki'lanie ituntu ku'ku'londelela ku' lwandi' lwako ku'ku'vulazya. Ev'e nanho u'kasye u'ki'lanie ituntu na nhi'ngi' yeni'yi' kwiza ku'nvulazya. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Mulungu wamwa Abalahamu, mulungu wamwa Naholi, na mulungu wa v'asav'o, v'alayangu'le hagati' niswe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 31:53">Haho Yakobo walahi'laga ku' lina lyamwa Mulungu u'yo ise Isaka ndi' amogohile. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Hangi' Yakobo wafumyaga ki'taambo henanho ha lu'gu'lu', na wav'akaati'kaga v'adu'gu'ye v'ize ku'lya viliwa haki'mo. Aho v'amali'laga ku'lya v'alalaga henanho.<verse eid="GEN 31:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Wangalu'ke ndiyu', Labani wipunaga, wav'asu'naga v'izu'ku'lu' v'akwe na v'aniki' av'o v'ana v'akwe, na wav'adosyaga. Haho wawu'kaga ku'su'v'a ku' lu'go lwakwe.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo ali'wiv'anga ku'poma na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Yakobo nawe wendeleyaga na musi'nzo gwakwe. Yav'aga aho wav'age ali' mu nzi'la, haho wav'ipami'ki'zyaga v'amalaika v'amwa Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Yakobo aho wav'awonaga wayombaga ati', “Yeni'yi' yi'li' nkambi' ya v'asilikale yamwa Mulungu!” Hu' nguno wahitanaga henanho “Mahanaimu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhayo “Mahanaimu” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “nkambi' iv'i'li' zya v'asilikale.”</char></note>.”<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Hohene wav'atu'maga v'akombe v'amutongelele ku' muku'lu'ye Esau, u'yo wav'age ikalile ku' lwandi' lwa ngu'lu' zya Seili ku' nsi' ya Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Wav'awi'laga ati', “Yagi mukamuwi'le gu'ku' wanne Esau i'vi: Mukumba wako Yakobo ali'yomba ati', ‘Ku' itungo lyose nikalaga wu'geni ku'mwa Labani mpaka lelo. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Ni'nazyo ng'ombe, mpunda, nkolo, mbu'li na v'akumba v'a ki'ki'ma na v'a ki'gosya. Gi'si' nu'ku'tu'mi'la nkombe, ev'e gu'ku' wanne, ki'gele u'nanuku'le mpandi'ke wu'soga ha mbele ya minso gako.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />V'akombe v'enav'o v'ayaga ku'mwa Esau. Aho v'amali'laga ku'mupa mmola, v'asu'v'aga ku'mwa Yakobo na ku'yomba, “Kwafikaga ku' muku'lu'yo Esau na ku'mufiki'zya mmola i'yo wali' waku'tu'maga, nawe Esau ali' mu nzi'la. Izile ku'ku'su'mbi'la na mbuto ya v'agosya magana ane.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Haho Yakobo wogohaga na ku'nywagala muno. Hohene wav'agawu'laga v'antu' v'akwe av'o v'av'age haki'mo nawe, na madale ga nkolo, mbu'li, ng'ombe na ntwangawu'lende, gose gafumaga madale av'i'li' av'i'li'. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Wiganikaga ati', “U'lu' ize Esau, ali'gwi'li'le idale li'mo, hohene idale li'ngi' li'ku'pu'lu'gu'ka.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Hangi' Yakobo wamulombaga Mulungu ati', “Ev'e Mulungu wamwa gu'ku' wanne Abalahamu na Mulungu wamwa v'av'a wanne Isaka, ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo ndi' wambwi'la nsu'v'e ku' nsi' yanne, na ku' igongo lyanne, ndi' wayomba u'lambezezye wu'soga, <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />ene nkafiki'i'lile chelu' na nhana yose i'yo wambezezizye ene mukumba wako. Aho nav'age nu'ki'lania mongo gwenu'gu' gwa Yolodani nav'age ni'na mulanga du' mu makono ganne, ali'vi gi'si' ni'nago madale av'i'li'. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Nu'ku'lomba u'mpi'zye ku'fuma mu makono ga muku'lu' wanne Esau, ku'nguno nu'wogoha, akowolile kwiza ku'ku'gwi'li'la ene, v'aki' v'anne, haki'mo na v'ana v'anne. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Ali'vi ev'e wayombile ati', ‘Nhana ndaku'v'ezezye wu'soga, na wu'v'yalwa wako ndawingi'hye ki'ti' musengasenga gwa mu nyanza, u'go gu'kakowoleka ku'v'azyi'ka.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Hohene Yakobo walalaga henanho wu'ziku' wenu'wo. Hangi' wakomaga lwandi' lwa nsawo yakwe, ki'gele yi'v'e lu'holo ku' muku'lu'ye Esau. <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />Wasogolaga mbu'li nki'ma magana av'i'li' na ngulati' maku'mi av'i'li', nkolo nki'ma magana av'i'li' na ng'ondi maku'mi av'i'li', <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />ntwangawu'lende maku'mi adatu' i'zyo zili'wonsya haki'mo na ndama zyazyo, ng'ombe nki'ma maku'mi ane na nzagamba iku'mi, mpunda nki'ma maku'mi av'i'li' na ngosya iku'mi. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Haho wav'apaga v'akumba v'akwe, ki'la yu'mo na idale lyakwe, na wav'awi'laga ati', “Muntongelele na muv'e muli'leka lyelemo hagati' ya idale na idale.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Wamuwi'laga u'yo atongelile, “U'lu' wapoma na muku'lu' wanne Esau nawe mbe waku'wu'zya, ‘Ev'e u'li' mukumba wamwa nde? U'yile ku'he? Mitugo zyeni'zi zyamwa nde?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Hohene u'ku'su'v'ya, ‘Yeni'yi' nsawo ya mukumba wako Yakobo, na lwenu'lu' hu' lu'li' lu'holo ku' wako, ev'e gu'ku' wanne Esau. Nawe Yakobo mweni'ki'li' ali' ku' nnuma izile.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Hangi' wamuwi'laga mukumba wa idale lya wu'v'i'li', na lya wu'datu', na v'ose av'o v'av'age v'alondile madale na ku'yomba, “I'vi hu' i'vyo muku'muwi'la Esau u'lu' mwapoma nawe. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Ku'du' mulav'i'le ku'muwi'la ati', ‘Mukumba wako Yakobo ali' ku' nnuma, aku'londile.’ ” Yakobo wayombaga vyeni'vyo, ku'nguno wiganikaga ati', “U'lu' natongezyaga lu'holo, itungo i'lo ku'ku'v'a kwiwona nawe minso ku' minso hamo aku'v'a watekanaga na aku'nanuku'la.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Hohene watongezyaga lu'holo lwakwe, ali'vi mweni'ki'li' walalaga henanho ha nkambi' wu'ziku' wenu'wo.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wikinde wamwa Yakobo na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Wu'ziku' wenu'wo Yakobo watunu'laga, wav'asolaga v'aki' v'akwe v'av'i'li', masuli'la v'akwe v'av'i'li', na v'ana v'akwe iku'mi na yu'mo, nawe wav'av'i'tyaga ha muv'i'to gwa mongo gwa Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Aho wav'av'i'tyaga ha muv'i'to, wav'i'tyaga hangi' na nsawo zyakwe zyose. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Yakobo wasigalaga inene henanho. Hohene wizaga muntu' yu'mo, haho v'idimaga miv'anda mpaka ndiyu'. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Muntu' mwenu'yo aho wawonaga ku'v'a akakowola ku'mukinda Yakobo, wamukumyaga ha kafyu'fyu' ka ha itango, haho Yakobo watyegu'kaga kafyu'fyu' ka itango lyakwe. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Hohene muntu' mwenu'yo wamuwi'laga Yakobo ati', “Ndeku'li'le nje ku'nguno yi'li' ikingilima.” Ali'vi Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nkakowola ku'ku'leku'li'la u'ye mpaka u'ndosye.” <verse eid="GEN 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Haho muntu' mwenu'yo wamuwu'zyaga, “Lina lyako u'li' nde?” Nawe wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ene ni' Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Muntu' mwenu'yo wamuwi'laga ati', “U'kav'e u'li'witanwa hangi' Yakobo, ali'vi u'ku'v'a u'li'witanwa Izilaeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Izilaeli” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “Mulungu ali'wigu'maga.” </char></note>, ku'nguno wikindaga na Mulungu na v'antu' v'angi' nanho wakindaga.” <verse eid="GEN 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Haho Yakobo wayombaga, “Nu'ku'lomba chaki'sa mbwi'le lina lyako u'li' nde?” Ali'vi muntu' mwenu'yo wasu'v'yaga, “ku' ki' u'li'mbu'zya lina lyanne?” Haho wamudosyaga kwenu'ko.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Hohene Yakobo wahitanaga henanho “Penueli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Penueli” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “wu'syu' wa Mulungu.”</char></note>,” ku'nguno wayombaga, “Nawu'wonaga wu'syu' wamwa Mulungu ku' minso ganne ali'vi nkafwile!” <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Aho Yakobo wav'age ali'wu'ka henanho ha Penueli na ku'v'i'ta mongo, lyu'v'a lyasangwa lyadodomoka, nawe wav'age ali'sunta ku'nguno ya ku'tyegu'ka kafyu'fyu' ka itango lyakwe. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Yeni'yo hu' nguno ya V'aizilaeli mpaka walelo v'akalyaga musipa gwa itango ha kafyu'fyu', ku'nguno muntu' mwenu'yo wakuumya kafyu'fyu' kamwa Yakobo henanho.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo na Esau v'ali'poma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Haho Yakobo wawu'syaga minso gakwe na ku'wona, kasinaga Esau izile haki'mo na idale lya v'antu' magana ane! Hohene wav'atawu'laga v'aane ki'la yu'mo ku'mwa nnina, ku'mwa Leya, Lahele na ku'mwa Zilipa na Biliha v'azya v'av'o. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Wagawu'laga i'vi: V'azya na v'ana v'av'o wav'atu'u'laga ku' mbele, Leya na v'aane hagati', na ku' nnuma wav'atu'u'laga Lahele na mwane Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Haho mweni'ki'li' wav'i'taga ku' mbele yav'o v'ose, ki'gele apome na muku'lu'ye. Yav'aga aho wamuwonaga, walamulaga ku'muku'v'i'i'la ku' iku'zyo ku'no ali'mwegela mpaka kali' mupungati'.<verse eid="GEN 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Ali'vi Esau wamupeelelaga Yakobo ku'kamusu'mbi'la, wamuwungati'laga mu nhingo na ku'musu'na, na henanho v'ose v'av'i'li' v'ali'laga. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Esau aho walolaga, wav'awonaga av'o v'aki'ma na v'ana. Wamuwu'zyaga Yakobo ati', “Ali' v'enav'a u'li' haki'mo nav'o v'a nde?” Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “V'enav'a hu' v'ana av'o Mulungu wampile ene mukumba wako, ku' ki'sa chakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Haho v'enav'o v'azya haki'mo na v'ana v'av'o, v'amwegelaga Esau na ku'musungami'la ku' iku'zyo. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Hangi' Leya haki'mo na v'aane v'egelaga na ku'sungama ku' iku'zyo. Mpeleleko yakwe v'izaga Yosefu na nnina Lahele, nav'o v'amusungami'laga ku' iku'zyo.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Hohene Esau wawu'zyaga ati', “Ali' madale gose ago napomaga nago mu nzi'la nguno yayo ki'?” Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nguno yayo yi'li' i'vi: Nu'koov'a mpandi'ke wu'soga ha mbele yako, ev'e gu'ku' wanne.” <verse eid="GEN 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Ali'vi Esau wayombaga ati', “Muzuna wanne, ene ni'na nsawo nyingi. Nsawo yako lekaga yi'v'e yako ev'e mweni'ki'li'.” <verse eid="GEN 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ayi' ng'o! U'lu' nhana napandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yako, nu'ku'lomba wanuku'le na lu'holo mu makono ganne. Nhana ku'wu'wona wu'syu' wako yi'li' ki'ti' ku'wu'wona wu'syu' wa Mulungu, na wansu'mbi'laga ku' wu'soga muno. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Nu'ku'lomba chaki'sa u'zumye kwanuku'la lu'holo u'lo naku'letelaga, ku'nguno ninga ene Mulungu wakandosya muno, nanne ni'na nsawo nyingi.” I'vi hu' vyene Yakobo wamwikongaga Esau, ndahi'lo wazumyaga kwanuku'la lu'holo.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Hangi' Esau wayombaga, “Endita! Ku'yage musi'nzo, nanne nku'ku'tongelela.” <verse eid="GEN 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Ali'vi Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Gu'ku' wanne, u'manyile ku'v'a v'ana av'a v'akaali' v'ado v'ado, hangi' nkolo, mbu'li na ng'ombe zili'wonsya. U'lu' nzifile wangu' wangu' ku' lu'siku' lu'mo du', mitugo zyose ziku'fwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Nu'ku'lomba chaki'sa, ev'e tongelaga niswe ku'ku'ku'londa hado hado, ku' lu'gendo lwa v'ana haki'mo na madale aga ha mbele yanne, mpaka ku'fike ku'mwa gu'ku' wanne u'ko ku' Seili.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Esau nawe wayombaga ati', “U'lu' mbe vyene yi'li' visoga nku'lekele v'antu' mugati' na v'antu' v'anne.” Ali'vi Yakobo wawu'zyaga ati', “ku' ki' u'v'ezye vyeni'vyo? Lekaga du' mpandi'ke wu'soga ha mbele yako, ev'e gu'ku' wanne.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Hohene Esau wawu'kaga lu'siku' lwene lu'lo ku'ya ku' Seili. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Sumbwa Yakobo na v'antu' v'akwe v'alondaga ku' lwandi' lu'mo u'lo lu'li'witanwa Sukoti. Aho v'av'aga kwenu'ko, wizyengelaga nnumba yakwe na mav'i'gi'li' ku'nguno ya mitugo zyakwe. Yeni'yi' hu' nguno ya henanho ku'hitana “Sukoti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Sukoti” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “mav'i'gi'li'.”</char></note>.”<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Ku'fuma ku'wu'ka kwamwa Yakobo ku' Padani-alamu, wayu'mbaga na ku'hola mpaka aho wafikaga ku' kaya ya Shekemu, ku' lwandi' lwa nsi' ya Kanaani, na wazyengaga nkambi' yakwe bi'hi' na kaya yeni'yo. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Kwenu'ko u'ko wav'age azyengile nkambi', wagu'laga lwandi' lwa kwikala ku'fuma ku' v'av'yalwa v'amwa Hamoli, ise wamwa Shekemu, ku' wu'gu'zi wa vipande igana li'mo vya feza. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Kwenu'ko wamuzyengelaga Mulungu ihozezyo, na ku'hitana “El-Elohe-Izilaeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “El-Elohe-Izilaeli” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo yi'li' “Mulungu ali' Mulungu wamwa Izilaeli.”</char></note>.”<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Dina ali'v'ezeziwa zoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, Dina, mwaniki' wamwa Yakobo u'yo waku'v'yalwa na Leya, wafumaga ku'ya ku'kav'ayu'mbi'la v'aniki' v'a nsi' yeni'yo ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Yav'aga Shekemu, mwana wamwa Hamoli, Muhivi, muhanya wa nsi', aho wamuwonaga wamudimaga na ku'lala nawe lwa nguzu. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Ali'vi Shekemu watogeziv'agwa muno na Dina, mwaniki' wamwa Yakobo, wamutogagwa, haho walamulaga ku'yomba nawe lwa ku'mwinonela. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo, Shekemu wasu'nsu'mu'laga na ise na ku'muwi'la ati', “V'av'a, nu'ku'lomba u'ntozye mwaniki' mwenu'yu'.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Yakobo wapandi'kaga mmola ku'v'a mwana wakwe Dina wav'ezeziv'agwa zoma na Shekemu. Ali'vi v'aane v'a ki'gosya v'asangwa v'ali' ku' idi'ma, ku'nguno yeni'yo wahu'li'kaga mpaka aho v'asu'v'aga.<verse eid="GEN 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Haho Hamoli, ise wamwa Shekemu, wayaga ku'kasu'nsu'mu'la na Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Itungo lyeni'lo v'asu'mbana v'amwa Yakobo v'asangwa v'asu'v'aga ku'fuma ku' idi'ma. Aho v'igagwa ati' Shekemu wamuv'ezezyaga zoma ilu'mbu' lyav'o, v'asayaga na v'agayaga muno, ku'nguno Shekemu wav'av'ezezyaga igambo lya nsoni ku' ku'lala na mwaniki' wamwa Yakobo ku' nguzu. Igambo lyeni'lo gwav'age muzilo ku'v'eziwa vyeni'vyo ku' V'aizilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Ali'vi Hamoli wav'awi'laga ati', “Mwana wanne Shekemu amutogilwe muno mwaniki' mwenu'yu'. Nu'mwikonga mumuzumi'zye amutoole. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Leki kwitoolele, iswe ku'toole v'aniki' v'inywe, na inywe mutoole v'aniki' v'iswe. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Mwikale niswe mu nsi' yeni'yi', nsi' yeni'yi' yi'ku'v'a yinywe. Mwiyagalu'le mwikale henanha, muye ki'la hene, na inywe mupandi'ke nsawo.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Hangi' Shekemu mweni'ki'li' wamuwi'laga ise wamwa Dina haki'mo na v'adu'gu'ye ati', “Nu'mulomba mpandi'ke wu'soga ha mbele yinywe! Nku'fumya ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho muku'yomba. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Mumbwi'le lu'v'alo lwa nkwanwa na lu'holo u'lo muku'tonda, ninga mukoov'e ki'ntu' ki'hanya vihe, ene nku'fumya, ki'tale du' mwaniki' mwenu'yu' av'e muki' wanne.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simiyoni na Lawi v'ali'li'pi'ki'zya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Ali'vi v'asu'mbana v'amwa Yakobo, ku'nguno ilu'mbu' lyav'o Dina wav'ezeziv'agwa zoma na Shekemu, v'eni'ki'li' v'asu'v'yaga ku' wu'yengani, ku'v'awi'la Shekemu haki'mo na ise Hamoli ati', <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />“Ku'kakowola ku'mutozya ilu'mbu' liswe ku' muntu' u'yo akaputilwe nyu'nzu'! Ku'v'ezya vyeni'vyo yi'li' nsoni ku' wiswe! <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Ku'kwizumi'li'zya ku' igambo li'mo du': Ki'la mugosya mugati' na inywe, aputwe nyu'nzu' ki'gele av'e ki'ti' iswe. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Hu' hene ku'lamutozye v'aniki' v'iswe, niswe ku'lav'atoole v'aniki' v'inywe. Ku'likale haki'mo na ku'v'a ki'ntu' ki'mo. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Ali'vi u'lu' mukaane ku'putwa nyu'nzu', ku'ku'musola ilu'mbu' liswe na ku'wu'ka.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Hohene, mihayo zyeni'zyo zyav'atogezyaga Hamoli na mwane Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Musu'mbana mwenu'yo Shekemu, u'yo wav'age aku'ziv'ilwe mugati' na v'ose v'a mu lu'go lwamwa ise, akatagile itungo ku'v'ezya ago gayombagwa, ku'nguno wav'age amutogilwe muno mwaniki' wamwa Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Hohene Hamoli na Shekemu mwane, v'ayaga ha wingi'li'lo wa kaya, ha nsangi'zyo ya v'antu'. Kwenu'ko v'asu'nsu'mu'laga na v'ichav'o na ku'yomba ati', <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />“V'antu' v'enav'a v'ali' v'anwani v'iswe. Ku'v'azumi'zye kwikala mu nsi' yiswe na ku'v'ezya wu'su'lu'zya. Nsi' yi'li' na ha kwikala hagali'nhu muno ha ku'v'agelani'la. Haho ku'lav'e ku'li'witoolela. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Ali'vi v'aku'zumya kwikala niswe na ku'v'a ki'ntu' ki'mo, u'lu' ku'ku'zumya igambo lyav'o. V'ali'koov'a ki'la mugosya mugati' niswe aputwe nyu'nzu' ki'ti' i'vyo v'aputilwe v'eni'ki'li'. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Vihe, mukawona ku'v'a nsawo zyav'o na mitugo zyav'o zyose zilav'e ziswe? Haya, kwizumani'zye nav'o ki'gele v'ikale haki'mo niswe henanha.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />V'agosya v'ose av'o v'av'age v'ikunganiaga ha wingi'li'lo wa kaya yeni'yo, v'izumani'zyaga na Hamoli na Shekemu. Haho ki'la mugosya wa mu kaya yeni'yo waputagwa nyu'nzu'.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Aho zyav'i'taga nsiku' idatu', v'agosya v'enav'o v'asangwa v'akaali' v'ali' na wu'satu. Hohene v'ana v'av'i'li' v'amwa Yakobo, Simiyoni na Lawi, v'alu'mbu'ye v'amwa Dina, v'asolaga mpanga na ku'yi'titu'ki'zya kaya i'yo yi'kiiv'angile ku' wu'lu'gu', na v'av'awu'lagaga v'agosya v'ose mwenu'mo. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Hamoli na mwana wakwe Shekemu nav'o v'awu'lagagwa ku' lu'panga. Hangi' v'amusolaga Dina mu nnumba yamwa Shekemu, na ku'wu'ka nawe.<verse eid="GEN 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Aho v'av'awu'laga v'enav'o, v'ana v'angi' v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Yakobo v'ingi'laga mu kaya yeni'yo na ku'yi'sampa, ku'nguno ilu'mbu' lyav'o ndi' wav'ezeziv'agwa zoma! <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />V'asolaga nkolo, mbu'li, ng'ombe, mpunda, na vyose i'vyo vyav'age vili'mo mu kaya haki'mo na vya mu migu'nda. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />V'asampaga nsawo zyav'o zyose, v'ana na v'aki'ma v'ose, na ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho chav'age mu nnumba zyav'o.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Hohene Yakobo wav'awi'laga Simiyoni na Lawi, “Inywe mwandetelaga lu'duko na ku'v'av'ezya v'ikazi v'a nsi' yeni'yi' ya V'akanaani na V'apelizi mbafufume. Iswe ku'li' v'adoo. V'enav'a u'lu' v'ikunganie ku'v'ezya wu'lu'gu' nanne, ene na mugana gwanne v'ose ku'lazimangu'ziwe.” <verse eid="GEN 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Ali'vi v'enav'o v'asu'mbana v'asu'v'yaga ati', “Vihe, yi'li' visoga ku'muv'ezezya ilu'mbu' liswe ki'ti' mulav'a?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu ali'mupa lu'v'ango Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, Mulungu wamuwi'laga Yakobo ati', “Wu'ka u'ye ku' lwandi' lwa Beteli, u'kikale kwenu'ko, u'kanzyengele ihozezyo. Ene hu' ni' Mulungu u'yo ndi' wakwifumi'i'la aho wav'age u'mupeelile muku'lu'yo Esau.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Hohene Yakobo wav'awi'laga v'antu' v'a mu lu'go lwakwe haki'mo na v'ose av'o wav'age nav'o ati', “Muvitage vimbulimbuli vya ki'geni i'vyo vili' hagati' na inywe. Mugalu'zye vizwalo vinywe na mwiv'ezezye wu'soso. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Hangi' ku'wu'ke ku'ye ku' Beteli, nanne nkamuzyengele Mulungu ihozezyo kwenu'ko, u'yo ndi' wanyigwa lu'siku' lwa lu'duko lwanne, na ku'v'a haki'mo nanne ki'la u'ko ndi' naya.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Hohene v'amupaga Yakobo vimbulimbuli vya ki'geni vyose i'vyo vyav'age mu makono gav'o, na vipini vya mu matwi i'vyo v'av'age v'azwalile, nawe Yakobo waviv'isaga ha nsi'li'li' na muti' muhanya gwa mwaloni u'go gu'li' ku' lwandi' lwa Shekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Hangi' Yakobo na mugana gwakwe aho v'awu'kaga musi'nzo, Mulungu wav'atu'u'li'laga wov'a wu'hanya v'ikazi v'a kaya zyose i'zyo zyav'age ziv'apilimile, nav'o v'akagemile ku'v'alondezya. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Yakobo na mugana gwakwe v'afikaga ku' Luzu, lina li'ngi' Beteli, ku' nsi' ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Aho wafikaga kwenu'ko, wazyengaga ihozezyo na wahitanaga henanho “El-beteli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “El-beteli” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “Mulungu wa Beteli.”</char></note>,” ku'nguno henanho hu' Mulungu ndi' wamwifumi'i'la aho wav'age amupeelile muku'lu'ye Esau. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Itungo lyeni'lo Debola, muzya u'yo wav'age musu'ngi wamwa Lebeka, wagulalaga. Nawe wazyi'ki'lagwa ha nsi'li'li' na muti' gwa mwaloni, ku' lwandi' lwa dakama ya Beteli. Henanho Yakobo wahitanaga “Aloni-bakuti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Aloni-bakuti” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “mwaloni gwa ki'li'lo”.</char></note>.”<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Aho Yakobo wasu'v'aga ku'fuma ku' Padani-alamu, Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwifumi'i'laga hangi' na ku'mudosya. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Lina lyako u'li' Yakobo, ali'vi u'kasye witanwe hangi' Yakobo, sumbwa u'kwitanwa Izilaeli.” I'vi hu' vyene wamupaga lina Izilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu wa Nguzu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhayo “Mulungu wa Nguzu” ku' Ki'ebulania gu'li' “El Shadai.”</char></note>. U'v'e na wu'v'yalwa wingi muno. Mukingi'he, ku'nguno ku' wako ev'e nsi' na mbuto ya makabi'la, haki'mo na v'atemi v'alafumi'i'le ku' wu'v'yalwa wako. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Nsi' i'yo nav'apile Abalahamu na Isaka, nku'ku'pa ev'e na wu'v'yalwa wako.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Aho Mulungu wamali'laga ku'yomba na Yakobo, wamulekaga haho.<verse eid="GEN 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Haho Yakobo waki'ndi'kaga nhi'ngi' ya iwe ha lwandi' lwenu'lo aho wasu'nsu'mu'laga na Mulungu, hangi' wapu'ngu'li'laga kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'neneko haki'mo na maguta ha igu'lya na nhi'ngi' yeni'yo. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Yakobo wahitanaga henanho lina “Beteli,” aho Mulungu wasu'nsu'mu'laga nawe.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'v'yalwa kwamwa Benyamini na ku'fwa lwamwa nnina Lahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Hangi' Yakobo haki'mo na v'antu' v'akwe v'awu'kaga mu Beteli. Aho v'av'age v'akaali' katanalo ku'fika ku' Efulati, Lahele wadimagwa na wu'su'ngu' wu'daki muno wa ku'v'yala. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Yav'aga aho akaali' ali'tuka na wu'su'ngu' wu'daki, mwingi' wakwe wamuwi'laga ati', “Ku'du' wogohe, ku'nguno wapandi'ka mwana yu'ngi' wa ki'gosya.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Lahele aho myu'ye yakwe yi'li'mali'si'ka ku'nguno ndi' ali'fwa, haho wamupaga lina mwana mwenu'yo Benoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Benoni” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “mwana wa misayo zyanne.”</char></note>. Ali'vi ise wamupaga lina Benyamini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Benyamini” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “mwana wa mukono gwa mulyi'la,” ku'nguno lwandi' lwa mulyi'la lu'li' lwa kwelu'ki'lwa ku' ki'ti'lwe cha V'aebulania.</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Hohene Lahele wagulalaga na wazyi'ki'lagwa ha mpelo na nzi'la i'yo yi'yile ku' Efulati, i'yo gi'si' yi'li'witanwa Betelehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Yakobo waki'ndi'kaga nhi'ngi' ya iwe ha igu'lya na ki'v'i'mbi', na yeni'yo hu' yi'li'lagi'la ki'v'i'mbi' chamwa Lahele mpaka walelo.<verse eid="GEN 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Izilaeli wendeleyaga na musi'nzo gwakwe. Aho waki'v'i'taga chamba cha Edeli, watu'u'laga nkambi' yakwe henanho. <verse eid="GEN 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Mugati' na wikalo wakwe Izilaeli mu nsi' yeni'yo, lu'siku' lu'mo mwana wakwe Lubeni wamusolaga Biliha isuli'la wamwa ise walala nawe, Izilaeli nawe wigagwa igambo lyeni'lo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 35:22">Wu'v'yalwa wamwa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakobo wav'age na v'ana iku'mi na v'av'i'li':<verse eid="GEN 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Leya v'av'age:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 35:23">Lubeni, muv'yalwa wa mbele wamwa Yakobo, Simiyoni, Lawi, Yuda, Isakali na Sebuloni.<verse eid="GEN 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Lahele v'av'age:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 35:24">Yosefu na Benyamini.<verse eid="GEN 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Biliha, muzya wamwa Lahele, v'av'age:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 35:25">Dani na Nafutali.<verse eid="GEN 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Zilipa, muzya wamwa Leya, v'av'age:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 35:26">Gadi na Asheli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:26">V'enav'a hu' v'ana v'amwa Yakobo av'o v'av'yalagwa ku' Padani-alamu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'fwa kwamwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Yakobo wasu'v'aga ku' Mamule ku'mwa ise Isaka, bi'hi' na Kiliati-aliba, lina li'ngi' Hebuloni, u'ko v'av'age v'ikalile Abalahamu na Isaka ki'ti' v'ageni v'izi'li'zi. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Wikalo wakwe wose mu welelo Isaka wikalaga myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi munane. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Nawe wagulalaga, ali' na wu'kiku'lu' wu'soga wa lu'v'ango, walondaga nzi'la ya v'antu' v'akwe av'o v'amalile ku'tongela, na v'ana v'akwe Esau na Yakobo v'amuzyi'kaga.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Wu'v'yalwa wamwa Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />I'yi' hu' mmola ya v'av'yalwa v'amwa Esau, ku' lina li'ngi' Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esau watoolaga v'aki'ma v'a Ki'kanaani na mina gav'o v'itanagwe Ada na Oholibama. Ada wav'age mwana wamwa Eloni, Muhiti. Oholibama nawe wav'age mwana wamwa Ana, mwizu'ku'lu' wamwa Sibeoni, Muhivi. <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />Hangi' wamutoolaga Basemati, mwana wamwa Isumaili, ilu'mbu'ye na Nebayoti. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada wamuv'yali'laga Esau mwana, na lina lyakwe witanagwe Elifazi. Basemati nawe wamuv'yali'laga mwana na lina lyakwe witanagwe Leueli. <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Ali'vi Oholibama wamuv'yali'laga v'ana v'adatu', na mina gav'o v'itanagwe Yeushi, Yalamu na Kola. V'ana v'ose v'enav'a, v'av'yali'lagwa ku' nsi' ya Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Hohene Esau wav'asolaga v'aki' v'akwe, v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma, haki'mo na v'antu' v'ose v'a mu lu'go lwakwe. Hangi' wasolaga mitugo zyakwe zyose, na ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho wasangwa wapandi'kile ku' nsi' ya Kanaani. Haho wasami'laga ku' lwandi' lu'ngi' lwa ku'le na mudu'gu'ye Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Esau wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo ku'nguno ya wingi wa mitugo zyav'o, na nsawo zyav'o mweni'ki'li' na muzunaye zyav'age nyingi muno. Nsi' i'yo v'av'age v'ikalile ki'ti' v'ageni v'izi'li'zi, yali' yi'li' vilambu ku'v'agelani'la kwikala v'ose v'av'i'li' haki'mo na mitugo zyav'o. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo, Esau, ku' lina li'ngi' Edomu, wayaga ku'kikala ku' ngu'lu' zya Seili.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />I'yi' hu' mmola ya wu'v'yalwa wamwa Esau, sav'o lya V'aedomu ku' ngu'lu' zya nsi' ya Seili, <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />na genaga hu' mina ga v'ana v'amwa Esau: Elifazi wav'yalagwa na muki' wakwe Ada, na Leueli wav'yalagwa na muki' wakwe Basemati.<verse eid="GEN 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Aga hu' mina ga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Elifazi: V'itanagwe Temani, Omali, Sefo, Gatamu na Kenazi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Elifazi wav'age na isuli'la na lina lyakwe witanagwe Timuna. Mwenu'yu' wamuv'yali'laga mwana wa ki'gosya lina lyakwe Amaleki. V'enav'a v'ose hu' v'izu'ku'lu' v'amwa Esau ku' muki' wakwe Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Aga hu' mina ga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Leueli: V'itanagwe Nahati, Zela, Shama na Miza. V'enav'a hu' v'izu'ku'lu' v'amwa Esau ku' muki' wakwe Basemati.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Aga hu' mina ga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Esau ku' muki' wakwe Oholibama, mwana wamwa Ana, u'yo wav'age mwizu'ku'lu' wamwa Sibeoni: V'itanagwe Yeushi, Yalamu na Kola.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Av'a hu' v'ahanya v'a magongo ago gafumi'i'laga ku' v'av'yalwa v'amwa Esau:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 36:15">Elifazi hu' mwene wav'age muv'yalwa wa mbele ku'mwa Esau, nawe wamuv'yalaga Temani, Omali, Sefo, Kenazi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />Kola, Gatamu na Amaleki. V'enav'a v'av'age hu' v'ahanya, ki'la yu'mo mu igongo lyakwe kwenu'ko ku' nsi' ya Edomu. V'enav'a v'ose v'av'age v'ana v'amwa Elifazi, mwana wamwa Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Aga hu' mina ga v'ana v'amwa Leueli, mwana wamwa Esau: V'itanagwe Nahati, Zela, Shama na Miza. V'enav'a v'av'age hu' v'ahanya, ki'la yu'mo mu igongo lyakwe kwenu'ko ku' nsi' ya Edomu. V'enav'a hu' v'av'yalwa v'amwa Leueli, mwana wamwa Basemati, muki' wamwa Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Aga hu' mina ga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Oholibama muki' wamwa Esau: V'itanagwe Yeushi, Yalamu na Kola. V'enav'a v'av'age hu' v'ahanya v'a magongo av'o v'afumi'i'laga ku'mwa Oholibama, muki' wamwa Esau, mwaniki' wamwa Ana.<verse eid="GEN 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />V'enav'o v'ose hu' v'av'age v'av'yalwa v'amwa Esau, ku' lina li'ngi' Edomu. V'enav'a hu' v'av'age v'ahanya v'a magongo gav'o.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu'v'yalwa wamwa Seili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Av'a hu' v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Seili, u'yo Muholi, na hu' v'ikazi v'a nsi' yeni'yo ya Edomu: V'itanagwe Lotani, Shobali, Sibeoni, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Dishoni, Eseli, na Dishani. V'enav'a hu' v'av'age v'ahanya v'a V'aholi.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Lotani v'av'age: Holi na Hemamu, na ilu'mbu'ye na Lotani witanagwe Timuna. <verse eid="GEN 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />V'ana v'amwa Shobali v'a ki'gosya v'av'age: Aluvani, Manahati, Ebali, Shefo na Onamu. <verse eid="GEN 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />V'ana v'amwa Sibeoni v'a ki'gosya v'av'age: Aya na Ana. Ana hu' mwene ndi' waligu'la nzwi'lo zya minzi' masewu ku' ibalangu', aho wav'age ali'di'ma mpunda zyamwa ise Sibeoni. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />V'ana v'amwa Ana v'av'age: Dishoni na muku'lu'ye witanagwe Oholibama. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Dishoni v'av'age: Hemudani, Esibani, Italani na Kelani. <verse eid="GEN 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Eseli v'av'age: Bilihani, Zaawani na Akani. <verse eid="GEN 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Dishani v'av'age: Usi na Alani.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Av'a v'ene v'av'age hu' v'ahanya v'a magongo ga V'aholi: Lotani, Shobali, Sibeoni, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />Dishoni, Eseli na Dishani. V'enav'a v'av'age hu' v'ahanya v'a V'aholi ku' nsi' ya Seili.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">V'atemi v'a nsi' ya Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Yeni'yi' hu' mmola ya v'atemi av'o v'av'age v'atemile mu nsi' ya Edomu, aho V'aizilaeli v'av'age v'akaali' ku'temwa na mutemi, ninga yu'mo. <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Hohene Bela mwana wamwa Beoli, walamulaga ku'tema nsi' ya Edomu. Kaya yakwe yitanagwe Dinhaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Aho wagulalaga Bela, Yobabu, mwana wamwa Zela, ku'fuma ku' kaya ya Bosila, wasaalaga ha lwandi' lwa wu'temi wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Aho wagulalaga Yobabu, Hushamu, ku'fuma ku' nsi' ya V'atemani, wasaalaga ha lwandi' lwa wu'temi wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Aho wagulalaga Hushamu, Hadadi, mwana wamwa Bedadi, wasaalaga ha lwandi' lwa wu'temi wakwe, na kaya yakwe yitanagwe Avati. Mwenu'yu' hu' mwene walasanaga wu'lu'gu' na V'amidiani na ku'v'akinda ku' nsi' ya Mowabu. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Aho wagulalaga Hadadi, Samula, ku'fuma ku' kaya ya Masileka, wasaalaga ha lwandi' lwa wu'temi wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Aho wagulalaga Samula, Shauli, ku'fuma ku' kaya ya Lehoboti i'yo yav'age yi'li' bi'hi' na mongo gwa Efulate, wasaalaga ha lwandi' lwa wu'temi wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Aho wagulalaga Shauli, Baal-hanani, mwana wamwa Akiboli, wasaalaga ha lwandi' lwa wu'temi wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Aho wagulalaga Baal-hanani, mwana wamwa Akiboli, Hadadi, wasaalaga ha lwandi' lwa wu'temi wakwe. Kaya yakwe Hadadi yitanagwe Pau. Lina lya muki' wakwe witanagwe Mehetabeli, mwana wamwa Matiledi, mwizu'ku'lu' wamwa Mezahabu.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />V'enav'a v'av'age hu' v'ahanya av'o v'afumi'i'laga ku'mwa Esau, ku'londa na magongo gav'o na wikalo wav'o. Mina gav'o v'av'age: Timuna, Aliva, Yeteti, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Oholibama, Ela, Pinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Kenazi, Temani, Mibisali, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Magidieli na Ilamu. V'enav'o hu' v'av'age v'ahanya v'a magongo ago gafumi'i'laga ku'mwa Esau, ku' lina li'ngi' Edomu, sav'o lya V'aedomu. V'atemulilwe ku'londana na wikalo wav'o mugati' na lwandi' u'lo v'av'age v'ali'tema.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Ndoti zyamwa Yosefu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yakobo wendeleyaga kwikala mu nsi' ya Kanaani, i'yo wav'age ikalile ise ki'ti' mugeni mwizi'li'zi. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />I'yi' hu' mmola ya v'av'yalwa v'amwa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Yosefu aho wav'age na myaka iku'mi na mupungati' wadi'mage nkolo na mbu'li haki'mo na v'adu'gu'ye, v'ana v'amwa Biliha na Zilipa, masuli'la v'amwa ise. Yosefu wav'age ali'muletela sav'o mmola ya nsembo mbi ya v'adu'gu'ye.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Yakobo, u'yo hu' Izilaeli, wamutogagwa Yosefu ku'kindya v'ana v'akwe v'ose, ku'nguno wamupandi'kaga ku' wu'kiku'lu' wakwe. Nawe wamusumi'laga Yosefu nhanzo ya wu'pu'nde nsoga muno. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Ali'vi v'adu'gu'ye aho v'awonaga ku'v'a sav'o amutogilwe Yosefu ku'kindya v'eni'ki'li'. Ku'nguno yeni'yo v'amugayaga Yosefu na v'av'aga v'akav'ile ku'su'nsu'mu'la nawe visoga.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Lu'siku' lu'mo wu'ziku', Yosefu walotaga ndoti. Ali'vi aho wav'agani'laga v'adu'gu'ye ndoti yeni'yo, v'ongezyaga ku'mugaya. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Wav'awi'laga, “Degeleki ndoti i'yo nalotaga: <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Nalotaga ati', kwali' ku'li' v'ose ku' mugu'nda ku'li'tunga masapali ga viliwa, ku'titu'ki'la kasinaga isapali lyanne lyi'mi'li'laga sata, na masapali ginywe gikunganiaga ku'li'pilima na ku'li'kundami'la isapali lyanne.” <verse eid="GEN 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />V'adu'gu'ye v'amuwu'zyaga ati', “Vihe, u'li'koov'a ku'ku'wi'la ati', u'lav'e mutemi wiswe? Ninga U'li'wiganika ku'v'a u'laku'teme iswe?” V'amugayaga muno ku'nguno ya ndoti na mihayo zyakwe zyeni'zyo.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Hangi' Yosefu walotaga ndoti yi'ngi', wav'agani'laga ati', “Degeleki, nalotaga hangi' ndoti yi'ngi'. Nawonaga lyu'v'a, mwezi na nsonda iku'mi na yi'mo zinkundami'lile.” <verse eid="GEN 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Ali'vi aho wamugani'laga ise haki'mo na v'adu'gu'ye, ise wamuhamaga na ku'muwi'la ati', “Ndoti ki' yeni'yo walotaga? Vihe, u'li'koov'a ku'yomba, ene na nnoko haki'mo na v'adu'gu'yo, ku'lize ku'ku'ku'v'i'i'le mpaka hansi'?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />V'adu'gu'ye v'amuwonelaga iwu'v'a, ali'vi ise wali'tu'u'laga mu moyo igambo lyeni'lo.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosefu ali'gu'ziwa na v'adu'gu'ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, v'adu'gu'ye na Yosefu v'ayaga ku'kadi'ma mitugo zyamwa sav'o bi'hi' na Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Hohene Izilaeli wamuwi'laga Yosefu, “U'manyile ku'v'a v'adu'gu'yo v'ali'di'ma mitugo ku' Shekemu? Nu'koov'a nku'tu'me kwenu'ko.” Yosefu wasu'v'yaga, “Endita v'av'a, ntu'mage nku'ya.” <verse eid="GEN 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Haho ise wamuwi'laga ati', “Yaga u'kav'alinge v'adu'gu'yo haki'mo na mitugo u'lu' zigelani'lile, haho u'su'v'e u'mbwi'le.” Hohene Yakobo wamutu'maga Yosefu ku'fuma ku' iwonde lya Hebuloni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Yosefu aho wafikaga ku' Shekemu, <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />aho wav'age ali'pilimapilima mu isokola lyeni'lo ndi' wasangwa na muntu' yu'mo. Muntu' mwenu'yo wamuwu'zyaga ati', “U'li'koov'a ki'?” <verse eid="GEN 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Yosefu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ndi'v'akoov'a v'adu'gu' v'anne. Nu'ku'lomba chaki'sa, u'kowolile ku'mbwi'la u'ko v'ali'di'mi'la mitugo zyav'o?” <verse eid="GEN 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Muntu' mwenu'yo wasu'v'yaga ati', “V'asamile henanha, ku'nguno nav'igilwe v'ali'yomba, ‘Ku'ye ku' Dotani.’ ” Hohene Yosefu wav'alondaga v'adu'gu'ye, na wav'asangaga ku' Dotani.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />V'adu'gu'ye aho v'amuwona akaali' ali' ku'tali', v'av'ezyaga ndaka ya ku'muwu'laga. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />V'iwi'laga, “Lolagi! U'yo mlota ndoti izile. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Gi'si' ku'muwu'lage, na ku'mutagi'le mu liina. Ku'layombe ati' wakaliwa na idimu idaki lya mu ipolu. Haho ku'lawone ndoti zyakwe zyeni'zyo zilav'e vihe!”<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Ali'vi Lubeni aho wigagwa vyeni'vyo, wakoov'aga nzi'la ya ku'mupi'zya Yosefu ku'fuma mu makono gav'o. Wav'awi'laga v'adu'gu'ye ati', “Ku'du' ku'muwu'lage. <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Ku'du' kwite magazi. Mutagi'li mu liina lya henanha ha mbu'ga, ninga ku'du' ku'muvulazye.” Lubeni wayombaga vyeni'vyo ki'gele amupi'zye Yosefu mu makono gav'o, na ku'musu'v'ya ku'mwa ise.<verse eid="GEN 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Yav'aga aho Yosefu wav'afiki'laga v'adu'gu'ye, v'amudimaga lwa nguzu na ku'muzula nhanzo yakwe nsoga i'yo wav'age azwalile. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Haho v'amutagi'laga mu liina, i'lo lyav'age li'li' wu'du'hu' minzi'.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Aho v'ikalaga ku'lya ki'liwa, v'awu'syaga minso gav'o kasinaga, v'awonaga musu'lu'lu' gwa v'asu'lu'zya V'aisumaili v'afumi'i'lile ku' Gileadi v'ayile ku' Misili! Ntwangawu'lende zyav'o zisombile wisu'lyu' u'wo wu'motu wa wu'bani, zeli na manemane. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Haho Yuda wav'awi'laga v'adu'gu'ye ati', “Ku'ku'pandi'ka ki', u'lu' kwamuwu'laga muzuna wiswe na ku'v'isa magazi gakwe? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Yi'li' visoga ku'mugu'zye ku' V'aisumaili av'o v'izile. Ku'du' ku'muwu'lage, ku'nguno ali' mudu'gu' wiswe, nyama yiswe na magazi gakwe na giswe hu' gamo.” V'adu'gu'ye v'izumani'zyaga nawe.<verse eid="GEN 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Aho v'afikaga henanho v'asu'lu'zya av'o V'aisumaili, ku' lina li'ngi' V'amidiani, v'adu'gu'ye v'amwa Yosefu v'amufumyaga mu liina, v'amugu'zyaga ku' vipande maku'mi av'i'li' vya feza. V'aisumaili v'amuwu'kanaga mpaka ku' Misili.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Itungo lyeni'lo Lubeni wav'age ali'hadu'hu', aho wasu'v'aga ha liina kasinaga, wasangaga Yosefu ali'mudu'hu'! Hene haho wazemulaga myenda zyakwe ku' misayo. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Wasu'v'aga ku' v'adu'gu'ye, wav'awi'laga ati', “Yosefu ali'mudu'hu' mu liina! Lelo ene nku'v'ezya vihe?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Hohene v'asi'nzaga mbu'li, v'asolaga nhanzo yamwa Yosefu na ku'yi'dobya mu magazi. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Hangi' v'ayi'filaga nhanzo yeni'yo ku'mwa sav'o na ku'muwi'la ati', “Kwaku'gaga nhanzo i'yi', yi'linge visoga u'yi'manye u'lu' ya mwano.” <verse eid="GEN 37:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Sav'o wayi'manyaga, wali'laga ati', “I'yi' nhanzo ya mwana wanne! Waliwagwa na idimu idaki lya mu ipolu. Nhana Yosefu watambagu'ziv'agwa mav'ale mav'ale!”<verse eid="GEN 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Hangi' Yakobo wazemulaga vizwalo vyakwe ku' misayo, wazwalaga maguni'la mu muki'mbi'li' na wamuli'laga mwana wakwe ku' nsiku' nyingi. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />V'ana v'akwe v'ose, v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma, v'ayaga ku'kamuhu'li'kya, ali'vi wakaanaga ku'hu'li'kiwa. Wayombaga, “Ndeki, ene nku'muli'la mwana wanne nsiku' zyose mpaka aho ndamufiki'le ku' v'afwile u'ko ali'.” Hu' vyene ise wendeleyaga ku'muli'la.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Itungo lyeni'lo, av'o v'asu'lu'zya v'afikaga ku' Misili, v'amugu'zyaga Yosefu ku' muhanya wa v'asilikale v'alindi'li'zi v'amwa Falao<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina Falao li'li' isumbi' lya wu'temi ku' Misili.</char></note>, lina lyakwe witanagwe Potifa.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s">Yuda na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Ha itungo lyeni'lo, Yuda wav'alekaga v'adu'gu'ye, wayaga ku'kikala na muntu' yu'mo Mwadulami, lina lyakwe Hila. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Kwenu'ko Yuda wapomaga na mwaniki' wa Ki'kanaani, lina lyakwe witanagwe Shua. Wamusolaga na ku'mutoola. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Mwaniki' mwenu'yo wapandi'kaga mwitungo, na wav'yalaga mwana wa ki'gosya. Yuda wamupaga lina mwana mwenu'yo Eli. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Hangi' wapandi'kaga mwitungo, wav'yalaga mwana yu'ngi' wa ki'gosya, na wamupaga lina Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Hangi' wav'yalaga mwana yu'ngi' wa ki'gosya, wamupaga lina Shela. Itungo lya ku'v'yalwa kwamwa Shela, Yuda wav'age ku' lwandi' lwa Kezibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Yuda wamutozyaga Eli, muv'yalwa wakwe wa mbele, ku' muki'ma u'yo witanagwe lina lyakwe Tamali. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Ali'vi Eli, muv'yalwa wa mbele wamwa Yuda, wav'age mukenagu'zi ha minso gamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, na ku'nguno yeni'yo Mulungu wamuwu'lagaga.<verse eid="GEN 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Hohene Yuda wamuwi'laga Onani ati', “U'mwingi'le muki' wa muyagi mudu'gu'yo, ku'nguno yi'li'ku'dima u'v'ezye vyeni'vyo, u'muv'yali'le muku'lu'yo, ki'gele apandi'ke wu'v'yalwa.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Ali'vi Onani wav'age amanyile ku'v'a wu'v'yalwa wenu'wo wu'kasye wu'v'e wakwe. Ku'nguno yeni'yo wav'age u'lu' walala na muki' wa muku'lu'ye, mbiyu' zyakwe witi'lage ha nsi', ki'gele aleke ku'muv'yali'la muku'lu'ye. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Igambo lyeni'lo wav'ezyage Onani, lyav'age lya wu'kenagu'zi ha minso gamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno yeni'yo nawe wamuwu'lagaga.<verse eid="GEN 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Haho Yuda wamuwi'laga mukamwana wakwe Tamali ati', “U'su'v'e ku' lu'go lwinywe ku'mwa so, u'kav'e mufwi'lwa mpaka mwana wanne Shela aho alav'e waku'la.” Yuda wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo ku'nguno ya kwiganika ku'v'a Shela nawe akowolile ku'fwa ki'ti' v'aku'lu'ye. Hohene Tamali wasu'v'aga ku'mwa ise.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Aho lyav'i'ta itungo ilihu, muki' wamwa Yuda wagulalaga. Yav'aga Yuda aho wamalaga ku'muli'la muki' wakwe, wayaga ku' Timuna haki'mo na munwaniye Hila, Mwadulami, ku' v'antu' av'o v'av'age v'ali'zisu'nzu'la nkolo zyakwe woya.<verse eid="GEN 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Yav'aga aho Tamali wigagwa ati', ise wu'kwi ali' mu nzi'la ku'ya ku' Timuna ku'kazisu'nzu'la woya nkolo zyakwe, <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />hohene wazulaga myenda zya wu'fwi'lwa wakwe, na wikumbi'laga wu'shungi, ki'gele v'aleke ku'mumanya. Haho wayaga bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Enaimu, bi'hi' na nzi'la i'yo yi'yile ku' Timuna. Tamali wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo ku'nguno wawonaga ku'v'a Shela wav'aga muntu' muhanya, ali'vi v'akamusaazizye ku' wakwe ki'gele av'e mugosi.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Aho Yuda wamuwona, wiganikaga ku'v'a muki'ma mwenu'yu' mulav'a, ku'nguno wikumbi'laga wu'syu'. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Akamanyile ku'v'a ali' mukamwana wakwe. Hohene wamwegelaga henanho ha mpelo na nzi'la, wamuwi'laga ati', “Izu'u' gi'si', nu'togwa ku'lala nanho.” Tamali wamuwu'zyaga ati', “U'lu' nzumye ku'lala nanho u'ku'mpa ki'?” <verse eid="GEN 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Yuda wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nku'ku'tu'mi'la kadi'lana ka mbu'li ku'fuma mu idale lyanne.” Tamali wamuwi'laga, “Tu'u'la mulehani gwa ku'mbezya nsani'zye ku'v'a nhana u'lantu'mi'le kadi'lana.” <verse eid="GEN 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Haho Yuda wamuwu'zyaga, “U'li'koov'a nku'pe ki'ntu' ki'?” Nawe wasu'v'yaga, “Mpage gwenu'go mukufu u'go gu'li' na muhuli gwako haki'mo na mulanga u'go u'dimile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Hohene Yuda wamupaga vintu' vyeni'vyo vyose, na ku'lala nawe. Haho Tamali wapandi'kaga mwitungo. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Nawe Tamali wawu'kaga na ku'su'v'a ku' lu'go, wazulaga wu'shungi wakwe, wazwalaga hangi' myenda zyakwe zya wu'fwi'lwa.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Yav'aga itungo i'lo Yuda wamutu'maga munwaniye Hila, Mwadulami, afile kadi'lana kenako, ki'gele asu'v'ye vintu' vyakwe ku'fuma ku' mwenu'yo muki'ma, ali'vi mwenu'yo munwaniye akamusangile. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Hila wav'awu'zyaga v'ikazi v'a ha Enaimu, “Ali' ku'he muki'ma mulav'a u'yo ali'v'aga ha mpelo na nzi'la bi'hi' na henanha?” Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga, “Henanha hakav'aga na muki'ma mulav'a.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Hila wasu'v'aga ku'mwa Yuda, wamuwi'laga ati', “Nkamuwine, na v'ikazi v'a henanho v'ambwi'laga ati', ‘Hakav'aga na muki'ma mulav'a henanha.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yuda wayombaga, “Leka avisole vintu' vyeni'vyo, ku'du' kwize ku'pondwensoni. Ev'e mweni'ki'li' wawonaga ku'v'a namufili'laga kadi'lana, ali'vi u'kamusangile.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Aho lyav'i'taga itungo lya myezi idatu', Yuda wapandi'kaga mmola ku'v'a, “Kasinaga mukamwana wako Tamali wav'aga mulav'a, ku'nguno yeni'yo wapandi'kaga mwitungo!” Hohene Yuda wafumyaga ilagi'li'zyo ati', “Mumufumye ha ibala akatimwe moto mpaka afwe!” <verse eid="GEN 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Aho v'av'age v'ali'mufumya ha ibala, Tamali watu'maga nkombe ku'mwa ise wu'kwi na ku'yomba ati', “Musav'a vintu' i'vi hu' mwene wampile mwitungo. Ku'nguno yeni'yo, nu'ku'lomba u'mumanye musav'a vintu' i'vi: mukufu, muhuli haki'mo na mulanga.” <verse eid="GEN 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Hohene Yuda wavimanyaga vintu' vyeni'vyo, na wayombaga ati', “Tamali ali' wa lole ku'ki'la ene, ku'nguno nkamupile mwana wanne Shela, ki'gele amutoole.” Ku'fuma henanho akalalile nawe hangi'.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Yav'aga aho lyafikaga itungo lya ku'v'yala kwamwa Tamali, yamanyi'kaga, kasinaga ali' na mav'asa mu nda yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Aho wav'age ali'v'yala, mwana yu'mo wafumyaga mukono gwakwe ha ibala, hohene mwingi' wasolaga wu'zi wazaa na ku'mutunga mwana mwenu'yo ku' mukono gwakwe, nawe wayombaga ati', “Mwenu'yu' hu' watongelaga ku'v'yalwa.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Ali'vi aho wagu'su'v'yaga mukono gwakwe mugati', kasinaga mudu'gu'ye watongelaga ku'fuma! Mwingi' wayombaga ati', “Yav'a vihe wafuma ku' nguzu ev'e?” Ku'nguno yeni'yo v'amupaga lina Pelezi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Pelezi” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “ku'fuma ku' nguzu.”</char></note>. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Haho wav'yalagwa mudu'gu'ye atungilwe wu'zi wazaa ku' mukono gwakwe, nawe witanagwa lina Zela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Zela” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “mwanga gwazaa gwa ikingilima.”</char></note>.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Yosefu na muki' wamwa Potifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Hohene V'aisumaili v'enav'o aho v'afikaga ku' Misili, v'amugu'zyaga Yosefu ku' Mumisili yu'mo lina lyakwe Potifa. Mwenu'yu' wav'age muhanya wa v'asilikale v'alindi'li'zi v'amwa Falao.<verse eid="GEN 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'age haki'mo na Yosefu, nawe wamuv'ezezyaga tu'soga. Yosefu wikalaga mu nnumba yamwa gu'ku' wakwe Mumisili. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Yav'aga mwenu'yo gu'ku' wakwe wawonaga ku'v'a Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' haki'mo na Yosefu, na hu' mwene ali'mugelani'zi'zya ku' magambo gose ago ali'gav'ezya. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Hohene, Yosefu wapandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yamwa Potifa. Haho wamusogolaga ku'v'a mugwasya wakwe, hangi' wamuv'ezyaga ku'v'a mwi'mi'li'zi wa mu lu'go lwakwe na mwangali'zi wa nsawo yakwe yose. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Ku'fumi'i'la itungo lyamwa Potifa ku'muv'ezya Yosefu av'e mwi'mi'li'zi wa nsawo yakwe yose, Gu'ku' Mulungu wahadosyaga ha lu'go lwa Mumisili mwenu'yo ku'nguno yamwa Yosefu. Lu'v'ango lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu lwav'aga ha igu'lya na ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho wav'age nacho mu lu'go na mu migu'nda. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo Mumisili mwenu'yo wamuv'ezyaga Yosefu ku'v'a muhanya ku' ki'la ki'ntu' chakwe, na ku' itungo lyeni'lo akawine nguno ya ku'lawa magambo gakwe sumbwa ki'liwa chakwe du'.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Ali'vi Yosefu wav'age musu'mbana mugololoku na wa kwiv'elelwa. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Aho lyav'i'taga itungo, muki' wamwa gu'ku' wakwe wamwigomelagwa Yosefu, na ku'muwi'la ati', “Izu'u' u'lale nanne.” <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Ali'vi Yosefu wakaanaga na ku'muwi'la mwenu'yo muki' wamwa gu'ku' wakwe ati', “Lingaga! Gu'ku' wanne wampile wu'hanya ku' ki'la ki'ntu' mu nnumba yakwe. Hohene akav'ile ku'lawa hangi' ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo, ku'nguno vyose wamalile ku'vitu'u'la mu makono ganne. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Mu lu'go lwenu'lu' hadu'hu' muhanya ku'ki'la ene. Gu'ku' wanne akangizizye ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo sumbwa ev'e du', ku'nguno ev'e u'li' muki' wakwe. Nku'kowola vihe ku'v'ezya wu'kenagu'zi wu'v'i ki'ti' wenu'wu' na kwikoov'ela musango ku'mwa Mulungu?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Ali'vi muki'ma mwenu'yo walambaga ku'mwigongela Yosefu ki'la lu'siku', ki'gele azumye ku'lala nawe. Sumbwa Yosefu akazumizye ku'lala nawe ninga kwiegela nawe.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Yav'aga lu'siku' lu'mo, Yosefu wingi'laga mu nnumba ku'tu'mama mili'mo zyakwe ki'ti' i'vyo yi'li' ki'ti'le chakwe. Itungo lyeni'lo hasangwa hadu'hu' mukumba ninga yu'mo mu nnumba. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Haho muki'ma mwenu'yo wadimaga ki'zwalo chamwa Yosefu na ku'muwi'la ati', “Izu'u' u'lale nanne!” Ali'vi Yosefu wamulekelaga ki'zwalo cheni'cho mu makono gakwe, na wapeelelaga ha ibala.<verse eid="GEN 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Muki'ma mwenu'yo aho wawonaga ku'v'a Yosefu wamulekelaga ki'zwalo chakwe mu makono gakwe, na ku'peelela ha ibala, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />wav'itanaga v'akumba v'a mu lu'go lwakwe na ku'v'awi'la ati', “Lingagi! U'yu' Muebulania wakaletwa hano ki'gele aku'pondensoni! Wingi'laga mu nnumba ki'gele alale nanne lwa nguzu, ali'vi nabu'bu'zya muno. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Aho wawona nu'bu'bu'zya na ku'lomba wu'gwasya, wapeelelaga ha ibala na ku'leka ki'zwalo chakwe ku' wanne!”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Hohene muki'ma mwenu'yo waki'tu'u'laga ki'zwalo cheni'cho mpaka mugosi aho wasu'v'aga ha lu'go. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Haho wamutentemuli'laga mihayo zyeni'zyo ati', “U'yu' mukumba Muebulania u'yo waku'letelile ha lu'go lwiswe, wali' wingi'laga ku' wanne ki'gele ampondensoni! <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Ali'vi aho nabu'bu'zya ku'lomba wu'gwasya, wapeelelaga ha ibala na ku'leka ki'zwalo chakwe ha wanne!”<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Yav'aga gu'ku' wamwa Yosefu aho wigagwa mihayo zya muki' wakwe ku'v'a hu' vyene mukumba wakwe wamuv'ezezyaga, haho ki'sila chakwe chapanki'laga. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Wamudimaga Yosefu na ku'mulugali'la mu igelezya, i'lo v'av'agemo v'atungwa v'a mutemi. Nawe Yosefu wav'agamo.<verse eid="GEN 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Ali'vi ninga mwenu'mo mu igelezya, Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'aga haki'mo na Yosefu. Wamuv'ezezyaga chelu' cha ku'muv'ezya apandi'ke wu'soga ha mbele ya muhanya wa igelezya. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo muhanya wa igelezya wamuv'ezyaga Yosefu av'e muhanya wa v'atungwa v'ose, na av'e mwi'mi'li'zi wa magambo gose ga mwenu'mo. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Mwenu'yo muhanya wa igelezya akalawile hangi' ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo i'cho chav'age ha wi'mi'li'zi wamwa Yosefu, ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'age ali' haki'mo nawe, na ku'mugelani'zi'zya ku' ki'la igambo i'lo wali'v'ezyage.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Yosefu ali'lotoola ndoti zya v'alugali'lwa v'av'i'li'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Aho lyav'i'taga itungo, muteki muhanya wa migate na mugawu'zi muhanya wa vinywiwa ku'mwa Falao, mutemi wa Misili, v'amukeniaga gu'ku' wav'o. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Falao wav'agayi'laga v'ahanya v'enav'o v'av'i'li', <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />nawe wav'alugali'laga mu igelezya i'lo lyav'age mu ngomwa ya muhanya wa v'asilikale, u'mo wav'age alugali'lilwe Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Muhanya mwenu'yo wa v'asilikale wamusogolaga Yosefu av'e munyapala wav'o. Nav'o v'ikalaga v'alugali'lilwe ku' matungo.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Hohene lu'siku' lu'mo wu'ziku', muhanya wa vinywiwa na muteki muhanya wa migate v'a mutemi wa Misili, v'alotaga ndoti mwenu'mo mu igelezya, na ki'la ndoti yav'age na nguno yakwe heke.<verse eid="GEN 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Ndiyu' Yosefu wayaga ku'kav'awona, ali'vi wav'asangaga v'anywagalile. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Haho Yosefu wav'awu'zyaga v'enav'o v'ahanya v'a hamwa Falao, av'o v'av'age v'alugali'lilwe haki'mo nawe mu ngomwa yamwa gu'ku' wakwe, ati', “ku' ki' mwanywagalaga?” <verse eid="GEN 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />V'asu'v'yaga ati', “Iswe kwanywagalaga ku'nguno kwalotaga ndoti na hadu'hu' wa ku'ku'lotoolela!” Ali'vi Yosefu wav'awi'laga, “Vihe, ku'lotoolela ndoti gu'kav'ile muli'mo gwamwa Mulungu? Nu'mulomba mumbwi'le ndoti zinywe.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Hohene mugawu'zi muhanya wa vinywiwa wamugani'laga Yosefu ndoti yakwe ati', “Mu ndoti yanne nawonaga muzabibu ha mbele yanne, <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />nago gwali' gu'li' na matambi' adatu'. Aho gwalamulaga ku'fuluma madu'tu', hene haho malawu' gasansamulaga na ku'pamba nzabibu zipiile. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Mu makono ganne nali' ni' na ki'kombe chamwa Falao, hohene nazisolaga nzabibu na ku'zikami'la mu ki'kombe cheni'cho, na ku'mupa Falao.” <verse eid="GEN 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Haho Yosefu wamuwi'laga, “Nguno ya ndoti yako yi'li' i'vi: Matambi' adatu' genago yi'li' nsiku' idatu'. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Mugati' na nsiku' zyeni'zyo idatu' Falao alaku'fumye mu igelezya na ku'ku'su'v'ya ku' mili'mo zyako, nanho u'lamupe hangi' ki'kombe mu makono ki'ti' kale. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Ali'vi nu'ku'lomba chaki'sa, igambo lyako u'lu' lyav'eela, wize u'nizu'ki'le, u'mbezezye chelu' na ku'njomba visoga ku'mwa Falao, ki'gele nanne nfume ku'no ku' igelezya. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Ku'nguno ene nasolwa lwa nguzu ku'fuma ku' nsi' ya V'aebulania, na henanha ha Misili nkav'ezizye igambo lya ku'mbezya ntungwe mu igelezya.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Hohene muteki muhanya wa migate wamwa Falao, aho wigagwa ku'lotoolelwa kwa mwiye ku'li' visoga, wamuwi'laga Yosefu ati', “Ene nanne nalotaga ndoti, nali' nitwi'kile nyu'ngo idatu' zya migate. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Mu lu'ngo lwa ha igu'lya mwali' muli' na migate hekeheke zyamwa Falao, ali'vi nnoni zyazilyaga ha igu'lya na mutwe gwanne.” <verse eid="GEN 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yosefu wamuwi'laga, “Nguno ya ndoti yako yi'li' i'vi: Nyu'ngo idatu' zyeni'zyo hu' nsiku' idatu'. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Mugati' na nsiku' zyeni'zyo idatu', Falao alaku'fumye mu igelezya, alaku'pute mutwe gwako, alakwenenie ha muti', na muv'i'li' gwako gu'laliwe na manoni.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Yav'aga ha lu'siku' lwa wu'datu' gwav'age mwanya gwa lu'siku' lwa ku'v'yalwa kwamwa Falao. Wav'av'ezezyaga mwanya v'atu'mami v'akwe v'ose. Wav'afumyaga mu igelezya muteki wakwe wa migate na mugawu'zi wakwe wa vinywiwa, wav'atu'u'laga ha mbele ya v'atu'mami v'akwe. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Haho wamusu'v'yaga mugawu'zi muhanya wa vinywiwa mu mili'mo zyakwe ki'gele amupe hangi' Falao ki'kombe chakwe. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Ali'vi u'yo muteki muhanya wa migate wamweneniaga ha muti'. Yav'aga ki'ti' i'vyo Yosefu wav'alotoolelile ndoti zyav'o.<verse eid="GEN 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Ninga vyeni'vyo mugawu'zi muhanya wa vinywiwa wamulav'i'laga Yosefu, na akamwizu'ki'lile.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Yosefu ali'lotoola ndoti zyamwa Falao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Aho lyav'i'taga itungo lya myaka iv'i'li', Falao, mutemi wa Misili, walotaga ndoti: Kasinaga wisangaga i'mile ha ngiligili na mongo gwa Naili. <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />Wawonaga ng'ombe mupungati' nsoga na nnonu, zifumi'lile mu mongo zili'di'ma maswa. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Lingaga zyafumaga ng'ombe zingi' mbi na ngandu muno, zyi'maga ha ngiligili na mongo bi'hi' na ng'ombe i'zyo nsoga na nnonu. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Hangi' ng'ombe mbi na ngandu zyazimilaga ng'ombe zyose i'zyo nsoga na nnonu. Hene haho Falao wapampamuki'laga ku'fuma mu tu'lo.<verse eid="GEN 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Aho walalaga hangi', walotaga ndoti ka wu'v'i'li': Lingaga, wawonaga ngala mupungati' nhanya na zyokalile mbutoo, zili'fuluma ha iwulule li'mo. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Hangi' wawonaga ngala zingi' mupungati' ngandu zyu'mi'kiv'agwa na muyaga gwa mu ki'ya, zifumi'lile henanho. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Zyeni'zyo ngala mupungati' ngandu, zyazimilaga ngala mupungati' i'zyo nhanya na zyokalile viliwa. Hohene, Falao watunu'laga na ku'manya ku'v'a, kasinaga zyali' ndoti!<verse eid="GEN 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Aho wasya ndiyu', Falao wav'aga na wu'su'pu muno. Haho wav'itanaga v'afumu v'ose v'a mu Misili, haki'mo na v'antu' v'atekanu, na ku'gani'la ndoti zyakwe, ali'vi ku'du'hu' ninga yu'mo u'yo wakowolaga ku'mulotoolela ndoti zyeni'zyo.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Haho u'yo mugawu'zi muhanya wa vinywiwa wamuwi'laga Falao ati', “Walelo nalizu'ki'laga ipu'v'yo lyanne. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Ha itungo i'lo ndi' waku'gayi'la ene na muteki muhanya wa migate, aho ndi' waku'lugali'la mu igelezya lya ku' ngomwa ya muhanya wa v'alindi'li'zi v'ako. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Lu'siku' lu'mo wu'ziku' ndi' kwalota ndoti, ki'la yu'mo na ndoti yakwe na ki'la ndoti yav'age na nguno heke. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Hohene musu'mbana yu'mo wa Ki'ebulania, mukumba wa muhanya wa v'alindi'li'zi v'ako, wav'age alugali'lilwe haki'mo niswe. Aho ndi' kwamugani'la ndoti ziswe, mweni'ki'li' ndi' wakowola ku'ku'lotoolela, ki'la yu'mo ku'londana na ndoti yakwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />I'vyo walotoola hu' vyene ndi' yav'a, ene ndi' nasu'v'a ku' muli'mo gwanne, na u'yo muteki muhanya wa migate weneniwa ku' muti'.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Haho Falao walagi'li'zyaga v'amulete Yosefu, nav'o v'amuletaga wangu' ku'fuma mu igelezya. Wasenyaga nyele, wagalu'zyaga vizwalo vyakwe na wingi'laga ku'mwa Falao.<verse eid="GEN 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Hohene Falao wamuwi'laga Yosefu, “Nalotaga ndoti, ali'vi ku'du'hu' ninga yu'mo u'yo akowolile ku'ndotoolela, nanne nigagwa mmola yako ku'v'a u'lu' wigwa ndoti u'kowolile ku'yi'lotoola.” <verse eid="GEN 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Yosefu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ene nkakowola ku'lotoola, ali'vi Mulungu aku'lagi'la nguno nsoga.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Haho Falao wamuwi'laga Yosefu ati', “Nalotaga ni'mile ha mpelo na mongo gwa Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />na henanho, nawonaga ng'ombe mupungati' nsoga na nnonu zifumi'lile mu mongo zili'di'ma maswa. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Aho zyav'i'ta ng'ombe zyeni'zyo, lingaga zyafumaga hangi' ng'ombe zingi' mupungati' zili' wu'du'hu' nguzu, mbi na ngandu muno. Nkaali' mbonage ng'ombe mbi vyeni'vyo ku' nsi' yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Hohene zyeni'zyo ng'ombe mbi na ngandu, zyazimilaga i'zyo ng'ombe mupungati' nnonu. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Ali'vi aho zyazimilaga zyeni'zyo ng'ombe nnonu, ku'du'hu' muntu' u'yo wali' aku'manya ku'v'a zyazimilaga ku'nguno zyali' zikaali' zigandile ki'ti' ha mbu'ki'. Hohene napampamuki'laga ku'fuma mu tu'lo.<verse eid="GEN 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />“Hangi' nalotaga ndoti yi'ngi': Nawonaga ngala mupungati' nsoga i'zyo zyokalile viliwa zili'fuluma ha iwulule li'mo. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Lingaga, ngala mupungati' ngandu, i'zyo zili' wu'du'hu' nguzu, zyu'mi'kiv'agwa na muyaga gwa mu ki'ya, nazyo zyafulumaga henanho. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Hangi' zyeni'zyo ngala mupungati' ngandu zyazimilaga i'zyo ngala mupungati' nsoga. Hohene ene nav'agani'laga v'afumu ndoti zyeni'zyo, ali'vi ku'du'hu' muntu' u'yo wakowolaga ku'ndotoolela.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Haho Yosefu wasu'v'yaga ku'mwa Falao, “Ndoti zyako zyose iv'i'li' nguno yayo yi'li' yi'mo. Mulungu waku'lagi'laga ku'v'a lyegelaga itungo i'lo aku'v'ezya igambo lyeni'lo. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />I'zyo ng'ombe mupungati' nsoga yi'li' myaka mupungati', na zyeni'zyo ngala mupungati' nsoga yi'li' myaka mupungati'. Ndoti zyeni'zyo nguno yayo yi'li' yi'mo. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Ng'ombe mupungati' i'zyo mbi na ngandu na i'zyo zyalondaga ha nnuma, zili' myaka mupungati' zya nzala, na hu' vyene ngala mupungati' i'zyo zyu'mi'kiv'agwa na muyaga gwa mu ki'ya, zili' myaka mupungati' zya nzala.<verse eid="GEN 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />“Ki'ti' i'vyo naku'tentemuli'laga, ev'e gu'ku' Falao, Mulungu waku'lagi'laga ku'v'a lyegelaga itungo i'lo aku'v'ezya igambo lyeni'lo. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Degeleka, ku'lav'e na myaka mupungati' zya ndecha ku' nsi' yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Ali'vi zilalonde myaka mupungati' zya nzala. Haho ndecha yose ya mu Misili yi'kasye yizu'ki'lwe, na nsi' yose yi'lagwi'lwe na nzala. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Ndecha i'yo yi'lav'e mu nsi' yi'lalav'i'lwe, ku'nguno nzala i'yo yi'lalonde yi'lav'e ndaki muno. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Ndoti yeni'yi' yisu'v'i'li'zyaga kav'i'li' ku'kwizi'i'la, ev'e gu'ku' Falao, ku'nguno nhana lyegelaga itungo i'lo Mulungu walomaga ku'li'v'ezya igambo lyeni'li', nawe aku'li'gelani'zya.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />“Ku'nguno yeni'yo, ev'e gu'ku' Falao, yi'li'ku'dima u'mutu'u'le muntu' wa wu'manyi na wu'tekanu, ki'gele av'e mwi'mi'li'zi wa nsi' yeni'yi' ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Hangi', u'sogole v'i'mi'li'zi v'angi' mu nsi' yose, u'v'atu'me v'akuminge lwandi' lwa wu'tano lwa viliwa vyose vya mu Misili. U'v'ezye vyeni'vyo ku' itungo lyose lya myaka mupungati' zya ndecha. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />V'i'mi'li'zi v'enav'o v'akuminge viliwa vyose ku' itungo lya myaka mupungati' zya ndecha. Ku' ki'la kaya v'atu'u'le viliwa na hifadhi visoga, na vyose viv'e ha nsi'li'li' na wi'mi'li'zi wako. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Viliwa vyeni'vyo vilav'e mbi'i'ka mu nsi', ku'nguno ya myaka zyeni'zyo mupungati' zya nzala i'yo yi'lav'e mu nsi' ya Misili, ki'gele nsi' yi'leke ku'v'ipiwa na nzala.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosefu ali'piwa wu'hanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Hohene, wu'yangu' u'wo wawu'fumyaga Yosefu wigelaga wu'soga ha mbele yamwa Falao, haki'mo na v'akumba v'akwe v'ose. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Falao wav'awi'laga v'akumba v'akwe ati', “Ku'pandi'ke ku'he muntu' ki'ti' mwenu'yu', u'yo ali' na Loho ya Mulungu mugati' yakwe?”<verse eid="GEN 41:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Haho Falao wamuwi'laga Yosefu, “Ku'nguno Mulungu waku'lagi'laga gose genaga, ku'du'hu' muntu' yu'ngi' wa wu'manyi na wu'tekanu ki'ti' ev'e. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Ev'e u'ku'v'a mwi'mi'li'zi wa iku'lu' lyanne, na v'antu' v'anne v'ose v'aku'londa i'cho u'ku'yomba. Ali'vi ene du' hu' nku'v'a muhanya ku' wako ku'nguno nikali'lile isumbi' lya wu'temi.”<verse eid="GEN 41:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Hohene Falao wamuwi'laga Yosefu, “Gi'si' nu'ku'tu'u'la u'v'e mwi'mi'li'zi wa nsi' yose ya Misili.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Haho wazulaga pete yakwe ya muhuli ku' lyala, wamuzwi'kaga Yosefu. Hangi' wamuzwi'kaga myenda misoga zya mupango muhanya, haki'mo na mukufu gwa zahabu mu nhingo. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Falao wamuliiniaga mu mukokoteni gwakwe gwa wu'v'i'li' gwa ku'kweswa na falasi, na v'alindi'li'zi v'atongelaga ku' mbele yamwa Yosefu, v'ahamukaga na ku'yomba, “Musukambe!” Hu' vyene Falao i'vyo wamutu'u'laga Yosefu ku'v'a mwi'mi'li'zi wa nsi' yose ya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 41:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Hangi' wamuwi'laga Yosefu, “Ene ni' Falao. Nu'yomba, mu nsi' yose ya Misili, ku'du'hu' muntu' wa ku'wu'sya mukono gwakwe ninga mugu'lu' gwakwe u'lu' u'kayombile.”<verse eid="GEN 41:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Falao wamupaga Yosefu lina lya Ki'misili Safenati-panea, hangi' wamutozyaga ku'mwa Asenati, mwaniki' wamwa Potifela, muhozya wa kaya ya Oni. Haho Yosefu walamulaga ku'yi'yu'mbi'la nsi' yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Nawe Yosefu aho ali'wandya ku'mutu'mami'la Falao mutemi wa Misili, wasangwa ali' na musimo gwa myaka maku'mi adatu'. Yosefu wafumaga ha mbele yamwa Falao wayaga musi'nzo ku' nsi' yose ya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 41:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Yav'aga ha itungo lya myaka mupungati' zya ndecha, nsi' ndi' yapona viliwa vingi muno. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Yosefu wakumingaga viliwa vyose i'vyo ndi' vigela mu itungo lya myaka mupungati' zya ndecha, na ku'vitu'u'la mu ki'la kaya ya Misili. Watu'u'laga mbi'i'ka ya viliwa ku' ki'la kaya ku'fuma mu migu'nda i'zyo zyav'age bi'hi' na kaya. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yosefu watu'u'laga mbi'i'ka ya viliwa ku' wingi muno. Viliwa vyav'aga vingi ki'ti' musengasenga gwa mu nyanza, na vingi'haga muno, mpaka walekaga ku'viv'azya.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Aho myaka zya nzala zikaali' ku'lamula, Asenati mwaniki' wamwa Potifela, muhozya wa kaya ya Oni, wasangwa wamuv'yali'la Yosefu v'ana v'av'i'li' v'a ki'gosya. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Yosefu wamupaga lina muv'yalwa wakwe wa mbele Manase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Manase” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “ku'lav'i'li'zya.”</char></note> na ku'yomba, “Mulungu wambezyaga ndav'i'le lu'duko lwanne lose haki'mo na igongo lyose lya nnumba yamwa v'av'a.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Mwana wa wu'v'i'li' wamupaga lina Ifulaimu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Ifulaimu” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “ku'v'yala v'ana.”</char></note>, na ku'yomba, “Mulungu wampaga v'ana ku' nsi' ya lu'duko lwanne.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Zyeni'zyo myaka mupungati' zya ndecha mu nsi' ya Misili zyav'i'taga. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Hohene zyalamulaga myaka mupungati' zya nzala, ki'ti' i'vyo Yosefu ndi' wayomba. Yav'aga nzala mu nsi' zingi' zyose, ali'vi nsi' yose ya Misili yav'age yi'li' na viliwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Yav'aga ha itungo aho nsi' ya Misili ndi' yagwi'lwa na nzala, v'antu' v'amuli'li'la Falao ki'gele av'ape viliwa. Haho Falao wav'awi'laga V'amisili v'ose ati', “Yagi ku'mwa Yosefu, na inywe mukav'ezye i'cho aku'muwi'la.”<verse eid="GEN 41:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Nzala yav'aga ndaki muno, yasambalaga mu nsi' yose ya Misili. Haho Yosefu wazumyaga ku'v'a nhu'ngu'gu' zyose zilugu'lwe, na wav'agu'zi'zyaga V'amisili viliwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Hangi' v'antu' v'a nsi' zyose v'izaga mu Misili ku'mwa Yosefu, ki'gele v'agu'le viliwa, ku'nguno nzala yav'aga ndaki mu welelo yose.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">V'adu'gu' v'amwa Yosefu v'ali'ya ku' Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Aho Yakobo wigagwa ku'v'a ku' Misili ku'li' na viliwa, haho wav'awi'laga v'aane ati', “ku' ki' mwikalile na kwilingi'li'la du'? <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Degeleki, nigagwa ku'v'a ku' Misili ku'li' na viliwa. Yagi kwenu'ko mukagu'le viliwa, ki'gele ku'du' ku'fwe na nzala.”<verse eid="GEN 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Hohene v'adu'gu' v'amwa Yosefu iku'mi v'ayaga ku' nsi' ya Misili ku'kagu'la viliwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Ali'vi Benyamini muzunaye na Yosefu, akayile haki'mo nav'o kwenu'ko, ku'nguno Yakobo sav'o wamukaani'zyaga ku' kogoha ku'v'a akowolile ku'vulali'ka. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Hu' vyene v'ana v'amwa Izilaeli v'ayaga ku' Misili haki'mo na v'ahemezi v'angi', ku'nguno ku' nsi' ya Kanaani nako kwav'age na nzala.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Itungo lyeni'lo Yosefu wasangwa wav'ile muhanya wa ku' nsi' ya Misili. Hu' mwene wav'agu'zi'zyage v'antu' v'ose viliwa. Yav'aga aho v'adu'gu'ye v'afikaga kwenu'ko v'amuku'v'i'i'laga Yosefu ku' isima. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Aho Yosefu wav'awonaga v'adu'gu'ye, wav'amanyaga, ali'vi wiv'ezyaga ki'ti' akav'amanya na wayombaga nav'o ku' wu'daki na ku'v'awu'zya ati', “Inywe mufumi'i'lile ku'he?” V'asu'v'yaga ati', “Iswe ku'fumi'i'lile ku' nsi' ya Kanaani. Kwizaga ku'gu'la viliwa.” <verse eid="GEN 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Ninga i'vi Yosefu wav'amanyaga v'adu'gu'ye, sumbwa v'eni'ki'li' v'akamumanyile. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Haho Yosefu wizu'ki'laga ndoti zyakwe zya nsiku' nyingi i'zyo wav'alotelage v'aku'lu'ye, hene wav'awi'laga, “Inywe muli' v'asu'u'zi. Mwizaga ku'su'u'la muwone aho hadu'hu' nguzu ya wi'mi'li'zi wa nsi'.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />V'eni'ki'li' v'asu'v'yaga ati', “Yi'kav'ile vyene gu'ku' wiswe! Iswe v'akumba v'ako kwizaga ki'gele ku'gu'le viliwa. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Iswe v'ose ku'li' v'ana v'amwa v'av'a yu'mo, iswe ku'li' v'a lole, ku'kav'ile v'asu'u'zi.” <verse eid="GEN 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Ali'vi Yosefu walambaga ku'yomba, “Ng'o! Mwizaga henanha ku'su'u'la aho hadu'hu' nguzu ya wi'mi'li'zi wa nsi' yiswe.” <verse eid="GEN 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Sumbwa v'eni'ki'li' v'asu'v'yaga ati', “Iswe, v'akumba v'ako, ku'li' v'adu'gu' iku'mi na v'av'i'li', v'ana v'amwa v'av'a yu'mo wa ku' nsi' ya Kanaani. Sumbwa muzuna wiswe wa ku' mpelo ali' na v'av'a ku' lu'go, na yu'ngi' wamalile ku'gulala.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Haho Yosefu wav'awi'laga ati', “Ki'ti' i'vi namuwi'laga inywe muli' v'asu'u'zi! <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Ali'vi ku'kamudimya ku' nzi'la i'yi': Nhana nu'lahi'la ku' lina lyamwa Falao ku'v'a mukawu'ke henanha mpaka ize mwenu'yo muzuna winywe. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Mutu'mi yu'mo mugati' na inywe aye akamulete mudu'gu' winywe mudo, na v'angi' muku'lugali'lwa mu igelezya ki'gele ku'wona mihayo zinywe u'lu' muli'yomba nhana. U'lu' yi'kav'ile vyene nu'lahi'la ku' wikalo wamwa Falao, inywe muli' v'asu'u'zi!” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Hangi' wav'alugali'laga v'ose mu igelezya ku' itungo lya nsiku' idatu'.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Mu lu'siku' lwa wu'datu' wav'awi'laga ati', “Ene nu'mogoha Mulungu. Ku'nguno yeni'yo muv'ezye i'cho nu'muwi'la ki'gele mupandi'ke wu'panga. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />U'lu' nhana inywe muli' v'antu' v'a lole, mugati' na inywe yu'mo asigale mu igelezya, na v'angi' v'afile viliwa ku' v'antu' v'inywe av'o v'ali'tuka na nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Ali'vi yi'li'mudima mukamulete mudu'gu' winywe mudo ha wanne. Yeni'yi' yi'ligelisye mihayo zinywe u'lu' zya nhana, na inywe mulaleke ku'wu'lagwa.” Hohene v'azumyaga ku'v'ezya vyeni'vyo.<verse eid="GEN 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Haho v'eni'ki'li' v'iwi'laga ati', “Nhana ku'li'tusiwa ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wiswe u'wo kwamuv'ezezizye mudu'gu' wiswe. Ninga i'vi kwav'age ku'muwine i'vyo ali'saya mu moyo gwakwe na ku'kwikonga ali'vi ku'kamwigilwe, na yeni'yi' hu' nguno ya lu'duko lwenu'lu' lu'li'ku'pandi'ka.” <verse eid="GEN 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Lubeni wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ene ndi' nkamuwi'lile ati', muleke ku'muv'ezezya kav'i muzuna wiswe? Ali'vi mukandegelekile! Gi'si' ku'li'tusiwa ku'nguno ya magazi gakwe!”<verse eid="GEN 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Aho v'av'aga v'ali'yomba vyeni'vyo v'akamanyile ku'v'a Yosefu ali'v'igwa ki'yombele chav'o, ku'nguno wayombage nav'o ku'v'i'ti'la ku' mufumbu'zi wa viyombele. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Haho Yosefu wayaga ku' mpelo na kwenu'ko wali'laga ku'nguno ya mihayo zyav'o. Aho walembelaga, wasu'v'aga na ku'su'nsu'mu'la nav'o hangi', na wasemuzyaga adimwe Simiyoni na ku'tungwa mpi'ngu' ha mbele ya minso gav'o.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">V'adu'gu' v'amwa Yosefu v'ali'su'v'a ku' kaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Hangi' Yosefu wav'alagi'li'zyaga v'akumba v'akwe v'av'okazi'zye viliwa mu maguni'la gav'o na ku'tu'u'la hela i'zyo v'ali' v'agu'li'laga, ki'la yu'mo mu iguni'la lyakwe, na v'apiwe viliwa vya mu nzi'la. Haho v'av'av'ezezyaga vyeni'vyo. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Hangi' v'azipekekezyaga mpunda miligo zyav'o zya viliwa, haho v'awu'kaga.<verse eid="GEN 42:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Aho v'av'age v'ali' mu nzi'la v'afikaga ha lwandi' lu'mo lwa ku'lala, mugati' nav'o yu'mo watungu'laga iguni'la lyakwe ki'gele ayi'pe mpunda yakwe ki'liwa. Haho wakumyaga ku'sanga, kasinaga ku'li' na hela ha igu'lya na iguni'la lyakwe! <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Hohene wav'awi'laga v'adu'gu'ye ati', “Lingagi, hela zyanne v'azisu'v'yaga! I'zi aha ha igu'lya na iguni'la lyanne!” Aho v'igagwa vyeni'vyo v'agwaga magongofuka, ki'la yu'mo wamugalu'ki'laga mwiye ku'no ali'tetema, na kwiwu'zya ati', “Igambo ki' lyeni'li' Mulungu waku'v'ezezyaga?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Yav'aga aho v'afikaga ku' nsi' ya Kanaani ku'mwa sav'o, haho v'amutentemuli'laga yose i'yo v'ayi'pandi'kaga kwenu'ko, v'amuwi'laga ati', <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Muhanya wa nsi' yeni'yo wav'age ali'yomba niswe ku' wu'daki muno, hangi' wav'age ali'kwiganiki'la ku'v'a iswe ku'li' v'asu'u'zi v'a nsi' yav'o. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Ali'vi iswe kwamuwi'lile ati', ‘Iswe ku'li' v'antu' v'a lole, na ku'kav'ile v'asu'u'zi. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Iswe ku'li' v'adu'gu' iku'mi na v'av'i'li', v'ana v'amwa v'av'a yu'mo. Ali'vi yu'mo wamalile ku'gulala na muzuna wiswe wa ku' mpelo kwamulekile na v'av'a ku' lu'go ku' nsi' ya Kanaani.’<verse eid="GEN 42:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />“Haho mwenu'yo muhanya wa nsi' yeni'yo waku'wi'lile ati', ‘I'vi hu' vyene yi'kwigelisya ku'v'a nhana muli' v'a lole: Mumuleke yu'mo mugati' na inywe haki'mo nanne henanha, na v'angi' v'aye ki'gele v'afile viliwa ku'nguno ya v'adu'gu' v'inywe av'o v'ali'tuka na nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Hangi' mumulete ku' wanne u'yo mudu'gu' winywe mudo. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yi' nku'manya ku'v'a inywe mukav'ile v'asu'u'zi, sumbwa muli' v'a lole. Haho nku'muleku'li'la mudu'gu' winywe, na muku'zumi'ziwa ku'v'ezya wu'su'lu'zya mu nsi' yeni'yi'.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Yav'aga aho v'ali'fuki'la viliwa ku'fuma mu maguni'la gav'o, v'akumyaga ku'wona ki'la yu'mo mugati' na iguni'la lyakwe muli' na mbuguli ya hela zyakwe! Aho v'awonaga vyeni'vyo v'eni'ki'li' na sav'o v'ogohaga muno. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Haho sav'o Yakobo wav'awi'laga ati', “Inywe mwammali'laga v'ana v'anne! Yosefu wayile, Simiyoni nkamuwona, hangi' muli'koov'a mumusole na Benyamini. Magambo gose genaga gampandi'kaga ene!” <verse eid="GEN 42:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Haho Lubeni wamuwi'laga ise ati', “Muleke Benyamini nje nawe nanne nku'mwangali'la. U'lu' ndeke ku'musu'v'ya u'v'awu'lage v'ana v'anne v'av'i'li'.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Ali'vi Yakobo wayombaga ati', “Mwana wanne akakowola ku'ya na inywe. Mudu'gu'ye wagulalile, na mwenu'yu' hu' wasigalile inene. U'lu' akavulali'ke kwenu'ko muyile, ene muku'ndengela ku'ya mu ki'v'i'mbi' ku'nguno ya misayo na wu'kiku'lu' wanne.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">V'adu'gu' v'amwa Yosefu v'ali'su'v'a hangi' ku' Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Itungo lyeni'lo nzala yali' yi'kaali' ndaki mu nsi' ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Aho viliwa vyamalaga i'vyo v'agu'lile ku' Misili, sav'o Izilaeli wav'awi'laga v'aane, “Su'v'i hangi' ku' Misili mukagu'le viliwa.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Ali'vi Yuda wamuwi'laga ise ati', “Muntu' mwenu'yo waku'hanile ku' wu'daki ati', ‘Mukasye mwiwone nanne hangi' u'lu' mukizile na muzuna winywe.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />U'lu' u'ku'zumya muzuna wiswe Benyamini ku'ye haki'mo nawe, haho ku'ku'ya ku'kagu'la viliwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Ali'vi u'lu' u'kaanile ku'muyane, ninga iswe ku'kav'ile ku'ya, ku'nguno muntu' mwenu'yo waku'wi'lile ati', ‘Mukasye mwiwone nanne hangi' u'lu' mukizile na muzuna winywe.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Sav'o Izilaeli wawu'zyaga, “ku' ki' mwandetelaga makoye mu ku'muwi'la mwenu'yo muntu' ati', muli' na muzuna winywe yu'ngi'?” <verse eid="GEN 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Ali'vi v'eni'ki'li' v'asu'v'yaga ati', “Muntu' mwenu'yo waku'wu'zi'li'zyage lwa ku'tisi'la muno magambo giswe na mugana gwiswe. Ndi' waku'wu'zya, ‘U'sinywe akaali' ali'zuwu'ka? Vihe, muli' na mudu'gu' winywe yu'ngi'?’ Iswe kwasu'v'yaga ki'ti' i'vyo wawu'zyaga. Mbe ku'kamanye vihe ku'v'a akaku'wi'la ati', ‘Kamuleti muzuna winywe aha’?” <verse eid="GEN 43:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Haho Yuda wamuwi'laga ise Izilaeli, ati', “U'nzumi'zye ku'ya nawe. Ku'ye ku'kagu'le viliwa, ki'gele ku'du' ku'fwe na nzala, iswe, ev'e na v'ana v'iswe. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Ene mweni'ki'li' nkwi'ma ku' lwandi' lwa mwana wako ku' ki'la igambo. U'lu' naleka ku'musu'v'ya na ku'muleta ha mbele ya minso gako, musango gu'lav'e ku' wanne nhananhana. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Kwali' ku'leke kwikendelezya mbe kwakaya na ku'su'v'a kav'i'li'.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Haho sav'o Izilaeli wav'awi'laga ati', “U'lu' hu' vyene muv'ezye i'vi: Musole mugati' na vili'mwa visoga ku'fuma mu nsi' yiswe. Soli' wu'ki' wu'doo, wisu'lyu' wa zeli, wu'bani na manemane, haki'mo na visumo vya kungu na lozi, muvitu'u'le mu mifuko zinywe, na mumufili'le muhanya mwenu'yo, ziv'e hu' lu'holo. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Musole hela, mongezye kav'i'li' zya ku'li'pi'ki'zya, ki'gele musu'v'ye hela i'zyo ndi' zyatu'u'lagwa mu maguni'la ginywe. Hamo ndi' zyatu'u'lagwa ku' ku'hu'v'a. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Mumusole na mudu'gu' winywe Benyamini, muye nawe ku' muhanya mwenu'yo. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wa Nguzu amugwasye, muhanya mwenu'yo amuwonele ki'sa, ki'gele amuleku'li'le mudu'gu' winywe u'yo wasigalile kwenu'ko na muzuna winywe Benyamini musu'v'e haki'mo nav'o. Ene u'lu' ku'fwi'lwa na v'ana v'anne leka nfwi'lagwe!”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Hohene v'enav'o v'asu'mbana, v'ana v'amwa Yakobo, v'asolaga lu'holo haki'mo na hela zya ku'gu'li'la viliwa na zya ku'li'pi'ki'zya. V'awu'kaga ku'ya ku' Misili haki'mo na muzuna wav'o. Aho v'afikaga kwenu'ko, v'ayaga ha mbele yamwa Yosefu.<verse eid="GEN 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Nawe Yosefu aho wamuwona Benyamini ali' haki'mo nav'o, wamuwi'laga mwi'mi'li'zi wa nnumba yakwe ati', “U'v'afile v'antu' av'a ku' lu'go lwanne na u'kasi'nze mutugo gu'mo na ku'v'av'ezezya ki'liwa ki'soga, ku'nguno v'enav'a v'aku'lya haki'mo nanne ki'liwa cha lyu'v'a.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Haho mwi'mi'li'zi mwenu'yo wav'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo walagi'li'ziv'agwa na wav'afilaga v'ageni v'enav'o ku' lu'go lwamwa Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 43:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Ali'vi v'antu' v'enav'a v'ogohaga aho v'awonaga v'afililwe mu lu'go lwamwa Yosefu. V'iyombelaga ati', “Kwaletwa henanha ku'nguno ya hela i'zyo ndi' zyasu'v'iwa mu maguni'la giswe ha lu'gendo lwa kwandya. Ali'koov'a aku'gwi'li'le na ku'ku'kinda ki'gele aku'sole ku'v'e v'asese, na mpunda ziswe azisole.”<verse eid="GEN 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Haho v'amwegelaga mwi'mi'li'zi wa lu'go lwamwa Yosefu, na v'asu'nsu'mu'laga nawe ha muzigo gwa nnumba. <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />V'amuwi'laga, “Gu'ku' ku'ku'lomba chaki'sa, lu'gendo u'lo ndi' kwiza henanha ku'gu'la viliwa, <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />hangi' kwawu'kaga ku'su'v'a ku' lu'go. Yav'aga aho ndi' kwafika ha ku'suuha ha itungo lya mpi'ndi', kwatungu'laga maguni'la giswe, kwakumyaga ku'wona hela ziswe zyose zili' ha igu'lya mu maguni'la giswe! Hu' i'zi kwazisu'v'ya. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Hangi' kwaletaga hela zya ku'gu'li'la viliwa. Ali'vi ku'kamanya u'yo ndi' watu'u'la hela mu maguni'la giswe.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Mwi'mi'li'zi mwenu'yo wav'awi'laga ati', “Ku'du' mogohe. Muv'e na ku'hola, ku'nguno Mulungu winywe, u'yo hu' ali' Mulungu wamwa sinywe, hu' mwene wamupile mbi'i'ka yeni'yo mu maguni'la ginywe. Ene ndi' napiwa hela zinywe.” Haho wamulugu'li'laga Simiyoni, na wav'aletelaga.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Wav'akalibisyaga mu nnumba yamwa Yosefu, wav'apaga minzi' ga ku'kusi'la magu'lu', na mpunda zyav'o wazipaga ki'liwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Aho v'igagwa ku'v'a v'aku'lya ki'liwa haki'mo na Yosefu, haho v'agelani'zyaga lu'holo lwav'o ki'gele v'amupe.<verse eid="GEN 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Yav'aga aho Yosefu wizaga mu lu'go lwakwe, v'amupaga lu'holo lwav'o na ku'muku'v'i'i'la. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Yosefu wav'agisi'li'zyaga na wav'awu'zyaga ati', “U'sinywe munamala, u'yo mwambwi'lage mmola zyakwe, mupanga? Akaali' ali'zuwu'ka?” <verse eid="GEN 43:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />V'asu'v'yaga ati', “U'siswe, mukumba wako, ali'zuwu'ka na mupanga.” Haho v'asukambaga na ku'muku'v'i'i'la ku' isima.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Aho Yosefu wawu'syaga minso gakwe, wamuwonaga muzunaye Benyamini, mwana wamwa nnina. Wav'awu'zyaga ati', “U'yu' hu' muzuna winywe u'yo mwambwi'lage mmola zyakwe?” Haho wamuwi'laga, “Mulungu aku'wonele ki'sa, mwana wanne.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Ali'vi Yosefu wawu'wonaga wu'togwe wu'hanya ku' muzunaye, na ndi'li'lo zyayengayengaga. Wahafumaga wangu' wangu' na ku'koov'a ha ku'li'li'la. Wingi'laga ku'mbele kwa winene na ku'li'la mwenu'mo. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Aho wamali'la ku'li'la, wisukaga minzi' ku' wu'syu', na wafumaga ku'no ilambi'ki'zizye na ku'v'awi'la v'atu'mami v'akwe ati', “Ku'leteli ki'liwa.”<verse eid="GEN 43:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Hohene Yosefu waletelagwa ki'liwa inene, v'adu'gu'ye nav'o v'aletelagwa v'inene, V'amisili nav'o v'apiv'agwa ki'liwa chav'o na v'alyaga v'inene. V'av'ezyaga vyeni'vyo ku'nguno yi'li' igayi'li'zyo ku' V'amisili ku'lya na V'aebulania. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />V'adu'gu' v'enav'a v'amwa Yosefu v'ikalaga ha mbele yakwe v'ahelilwe ku'londana na misimo zyav'o, ku'lamuli'la muv'yalwa wa mbele mpaka wa ku' mpelo. Haho v'ilingaga na ku'kekev'ala! <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />V'afili'lagwa viliwa ku'fuma ha meza yamwa Yosefu, ali'vi Benyamini wafili'lagwa vingi kali' katano, ku'ki'la viliwa vya v'angi' v'ose. Hohene v'anywaga v'ose ku' miyeye haki'mo na Yosefu.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s">Yosefu ali'v'agema v'adu'gu'ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Hangi' Yosefu wamusemuzyaga mwi'mi'li'zi wa nnumba yakwe na ku'yomba, “Okazya maguni'la ga v'antu' v'enav'a, ki'la yu'mo ngelo ya viliwa i'vyo akowolile ku'somba. U'tu'u'le hela ya ki'la muntu' ha igu'lya na iguni'la lyakwe. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Hangi' u'tu'u'le ki'kombe channe cha mupango<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">44:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Ki'kombe cha mupango,” ku' Ki'ebulania ki'li' ki'kombe cha mawe ga mupango ga feza.</char></note> ha igu'lya na iguni'la lya u'yo mudo wav'o v'ose, haki'mo na hela zyakwe zyose i'zyo wagu'li'laga viliwa.” Nawe wav'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Yosefu wamuwi'laga.<verse eid="GEN 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Aho wasya ndiyu', v'antu' v'enav'o v'aleku'li'lagwa v'awu'ke haki'mo na mpunda zyav'o. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Hohene, v'alamulaga musi'nzo. Ali'vi itungo idoo aho v'av'age v'akaali' ku'fika ku'le ku'fuma mu kaya, Yosefu wamutu'maga mwi'mi'li'zi wa nnumba yakwe na ku'muwi'la, “V'alondezye v'antu' v'enav'a, aho u'ku'v'apandi'ka u'v'awu'zye, ‘ku' ki' mwali'pi'ki'zya wu'soga ku' wu'v'i? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Ku' ki' mwasolaga ki'kombe i'cho u'nywelaga gu'ku' wanne na ku'lagu'li'la? Mwapu'v'yaga muno ku' ku'v'ezya vyeni'vyo.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Haho mwi'mi'li'zi mwenu'yo wav'alondezyaga. Aho wav'apandi'kaga wav'awi'laga mihayo zyeni'zyo. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Ali'vi nav'o v'asu'v'yaga ati', “Gu'ku' wiswe, ku' ki' u'li'yomba mihayo zyeni'zi? Iswe ku'li' v'akumba v'ako, ku'kakowolile ku'v'ezya igambo ki'ti' lyeni'lo! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Izu'ki'la gu'ku', hela i'zyo ndi' kwazisanga ha igu'lya na maguni'la giswe, lingaga kwazisu'v'izye ku'fuma ku' nsi' ya Kanaani. Yi'li'kowoleka vihe hangi' iswe kwiv'a feza ninga zahabu mu lu'go lwamwa gu'ku' wako? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />U'yo akwigela ali'nacho ki'kombe mugati' niswe awu'lagwe, niswe v'angi' ku'ku'v'a v'asese v'ako.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Mwenu'yo mwi'mi'li'zi wasu'v'yaga, “Visoga muno, yi'v'e ki'ti' i'vyo mwayombaga. Muntu' u'yo aku'sangwa ali'nacho ki'kombe cheni'cho aku'v'a musese wanne. Ali'vi inywe v'angi' muku'v'a muli' wu'du'hu' musango.”<verse eid="GEN 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Hohene ki'la yu'mo wasosyaga iguni'la lyakwe wangu' wangu' na ku'li'tungu'la. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Haho mwi'mi'li'zi walamulaga ku'gafunyu'nku'la maguni'la, walamuli'laga ku' muku'lu' wav'o na ku'mali'zi'zya ku' muzuna wav'o. Ki'kombe cheni'cho chigelelaga mu iguni'la lyamwa Benyamini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo v'azemulaga vizwalo vyav'o ku' misayo. Ki'la yu'mo wayi'sombyaga mpunda yakwe muligo, nav'o v'asu'v'aga ku' kaya ku'mwa Yosefu.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yuda na v'adu'gu'ye aho v'afikaga ha lu'go lwamwa Yosefu, wasangwa Yosefu akaali' ali' ha lu'go. Hohene v'amuku'v'i'i'laga ku' wov'a. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Yosefu wav'awi'laga ati', “Igambo ki' i'lo mwav'ezyaga? Mukamanya muntu' ki'ti' ene nkowolile ku'manya magambo ku' nzi'la ya wu'lagu'zi?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Yuda wasu'v'yaga ati', “Gu'ku' wiswe, ki'mba ku'ku'wi'le ki'. Ki'mba ku'yombe ki' ki'gele ku'lagi'le ati' ku'li' wu'du'hu' musango. Mulungu walagi'laga wu'kenagu'zi wiswe v'akumba v'ako. Gi'si' iswe haki'mo na u'yo wasangagwa na ki'kombe mu iguni'la lyakwe, v'ose ku'li' v'asese v'ako.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Ali'vi Yosefu wayombaga ati', “Ayi' ng'o, nkakowola ku'v'ezya igambo lyeni'lo. Muntu' u'yo wasangagwa na ki'kombe channe mu iguni'la lyakwe, hu' mwene aku'v'a musese wanne. V'angi' v'ose musu'v'e na ku'hola ku'mwa sinywe.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Haho Yuda wamwegelaga Yosefu na ku'muwi'la, “Gu'ku' nu'ku'lomba u'ndegeleke, ene mukumba wako, njombe mihayo ninga midoo ha mbele yako. Nu'kwikonga ku'du' u'ngayi'le, ku'nguno ev'e u'li' ki'ti' Falao mweni'ki'li'. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Gu'ku' wanne ev'e ndi' waku'wu'zya ati', ‘Muli' na sinywe? Ninga mudu'gu' winywe yu'ngi'?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Niswe ndi' kwasu'v'ya ati', ‘V'av'a wiswe akaali' ali'zuwu'ka, ali'vi wakakiku'la. Hangi' ali'ho muzuna wiswe u'yo v'av'a wampandi'kile ku' wu'kiku'lu'. Muzuna wiswe mwenu'yo wav'age na muku'lu'ye u'yo v'av'yalilwe na nnina yu'mo, ali'vi muku'lu'ye mwenu'yo wamalile ku'gulala. Ku'nguno yeni'yo muzunaye wakasigala inene, nawe wav'ile mutoneke muno ku'mwa v'av'a.’<verse eid="GEN 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />“Haho ndi' waku'wi'la iswe v'akumba v'ako, ku'mulete ki'gele u'muwone ku' minso gako. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Iswe kwasu'v'yaga ati', ‘Musu'mbana mwenu'yu' akakowola ku'hafuma hamwa ise, ku'nguno u'lu' amuleke, ise aku'fwa.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Ali'vi ev'e gu'ku' ndi' waku'wi'la ati', ‘U'lu' mupotwe kwiza na muzuna winywe, mukasye mumbone wu'syu' wanne hangi'.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Yav'aga aho ndi' kwasu'v'a ku' lu'go lwa mukumba wako, v'av'a wiswe, haho ndi' kwamuwi'la mihayo i'zyo ndi' waku'lagi'li'zya, ev'e gu'ku' wanne.<verse eid="GEN 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />“Aho lyav'i'taga itungo v'av'a wiswe waku'wi'laga ati', ‘Musu'v'e ku' Misili mukagu'le viliwa vingi'.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Ali'vi iswe kwasu'v'yaga ati', ‘Ku'kakowolile ku'ya ku'muleke muzuna wiswe. Ku'nguno mutemi wa kwenu'ko wayombile, ku'kasye kwiwone nawe u'lu' ku'kayile haki'mo na muzuna wiswe.’<verse eid="GEN 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />“Haho v'av'a wiswe mukumba wako waku'wi'laga ati', ‘Mumanyile ku'v'a muki' wanne ndi' wambyali'la v'ana v'av'i'li' du'. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Mugati' nav'o v'enav'a yu'mo watagi'kile, nanne nayombile, “Nhana wakatandagu'lwa na idimu idaki.” Nkaali' mmuwonage hangi' mpaka walelo. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />U'lu' mumusole mwenu'yu' ku'fuma ha wanne, nawe akavulali'ke, hohene muku'ndengela ku'ya mu ki'v'i'mbi' ku'nguno ya misayo na wu'kiku'lu' wanne.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />Yuda walambaga ku'yomba, “Gu'ku' wiswe, ene u'lu' ndeke ku'su'v'a haki'mo na musu'mbana mwenu'yu' ku'mwa v'av'a wiswe mukumba wako, aku'fwa, ku'nguno wu'zuwu'ku wamwa v'av'a wu'li' haki'mo na wu'zuwu'ku wa musu'mbana mwenu'yu'. <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />U'lu' awone musu'mbana akav'ile haki'mo niswe, iswe v'akumba v'ako ku'ku'mulengela v'av'a wiswe ku'ya mu ki'v'i'mbi' ku' misayo na wu'kiku'lu' wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Ene mukumba wako nalahi'lile kwi'ma ku' lwandi' lwakwe na ku'yomba, ‘U'lu' ndeke ku'musu'v'ya musu'mbana mu makono gako musango gu'v'e nanne nhananhana.’<verse eid="GEN 44:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />“Gi'si' hohene nu'kwikonga muno, gu'ku' wanne, u'zumye ene nsigale mmbe musese wako, ali'vi musu'mbana mwenu'yu' u'muzumi'zye asu'v'e ku' lu'go haki'mo na v'aku'lu'ye. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Nku'su'v'a vihe ku'mwa v'av'a wiswe ku'no nkav'ile na musu'mbana mwenu'yu'? Nkakowola ku'wona i'vyo v'av'a wiswe ali'koya ku' misayo.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Yosefu ali'wiolecha ku' v'adu'gu'ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Henanho Yosefu wapotagwa kwilambi'ki'zya ku'leka ku'li'la. Ku'nguno yeni'yo, wahamukaga na ku'v'awi'la v'akumba v'akwe v'ose av'o v'av'age v'i'mile henanho bi'hi' nawe ati', “Fumi ha ibala!” V'ose v'afumaga na henanho wasigalaga mweni'ki'li' na v'adu'gu'ye aho wav'age ali'wiolecha. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Ali'vi wali'laga ku' muzwi muhanya mpaka V'amisili av'o v'av'age ha ibala v'igagwa, ninga v'antu' v'a mu iku'lu' lyamwa Falao nav'o v'apandi'kaga mmola yeni'yo.<verse eid="GEN 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Hangi' Yosefu wav'awi'laga v'adu'gu'ye ati', “Ene ni' Yosefu! Vihe, v'av'a wanne akaali' ali'zuwu'ka?” Ali'vi v'adu'gu'ye aho v'igagwa vyeni'vyo v'agwaga magongofuka ha mbele yakwe, ninga ku'su'v'ya v'apotagwa.<verse eid="GEN 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Haho Yosefu wav'awi'laga ati', “Nu'mulomba mwegele bi'hi' nanne!” Yav'aga aho v'egelaga wav'awi'laga ati', “Ene ni' Yosefu, mudu'gu' winywe, u'yo ndi' mwamugu'zya ku'ya ku' Misili! <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Ali'vi gi'si' muleke ku'nywagala ninga ku'saya ku'nguno ya ku'ngu'zya. Ku'nguno Mulungu mweni'ki'li' hu' mwene wantu'ma mmutongelele ku'no ki'gele nize ku'v'akomola v'antu' v'av'e na wu'panga. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Gi'si' zyav'aga myaka iv'i'li' ku'fuma aho nzala yagwile mu nsi', hangi' zikaali' myaka itano ku' mbele i'zyo zilav'e zili' wu'du'hu' ku'li'ma ninga kwi'mbu'la. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Ali'vi Mulungu wandetile mmutongelele ku'no, ki'gele ku'pi'zya wu'panga winywe na wu'v'yalwa winywe wendeleye ku'v'amo mu welelo, na ku'muv'ezezya wu'pi'zya wu'hanya.<verse eid="GEN 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />“Ku'nguno yeni'yo mukav'ile inywe av'o mwandetile ku'no, sumbwa ali' Mulungu du'. Hu' mwene wambezizye mmbe muyangu' muhanya wamwa Falao, gu'ku' wa v'antu' v'a mu nnumba yakwe yose, na mutemi wa nsi' yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 45:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />Hohene muwu'ke wangu' muye ku'mwa v'av'a na ku'kamuwi'la ati', ‘Yosefu, mwana wako, ali'yomba i'vi: “Mulungu wakambezya ene ku'v'a gu'ku' wa nsi' yose ya Misili. Wu'ka gi'si', ku'du' u'kendele kwiza ku' wanne. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />U'kwikala bi'hi' nanne ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni, ev'e, v'ana v'ako, v'izu'ku'lu' v'ako, mitugo zyako na vintu' vyako vyose. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Nku'ku'su'nga ev'e, mugana gwako na mitugo zyako, ki'gele muleke ku'pi'naha ku'nguno ya nzala, ku'nguno zikaali' myaka itano zya nzala ku' mbele.” ’ ”<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Hangi' Yosefu wav'awi'laga v'adu'gu'ye ati', “Lingagi inywe v'eni'ki'li', haki'mo na muzuna wanne Benyamini, wose mwawonaga ku' minso ginywe ku'v'a nhana ene hu' ni' Yosefu u'yo nu'su'nsu'mu'la na inywe. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Yagi mukamuwi'le v'av'a mmola ya iku'zyo i'lo napiv'ilwe ku'no ku' Misili, na ku' ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho mwaki'wonaga. Hangi' mwangu'he ku'muleta v'av'a ku'no.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Haho wamuwungati'laga muzunaye Benyamini, nav'o v'ali'laga ku'no v'iwungati'lile. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Hangi' wav'awungati'laga v'adu'gu'ye na ku'v'asu'na ku'no ali'li'la. Haho v'adu'gu'ye v'agimaga ku'yomba nawe.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo ali'sama ku'ya ku' Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Hohene mmola yeni'yi' aho yafikaga ku' v'antu' v'a mu iku'lu' lyamwa Falao ku'v'a v'adu'gu'ye na Yosefu v'izaga, Falao na v'akumba v'akwe v'atogeziv'agwa muno. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo Falao wamuwi'laga Yosefu ati', “V'awi'le v'adu'gu'yo, ‘V'ezi i'vi: Zitwi'ki mpunda zinywe miligo musu'v'e mpaka ku' nsi' ya Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />mukamulete sinywe na migana zinywe ku' wanne. Ene nku'mupa lwandi' lu'soga muno mugati' na nsi' yeni'yi' ya Misili, na inywe muku'togeziwa na visumo vya nsi' yeni'yi' ya lu'tongo.’ <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />V'awi'le i'vi: ‘Musole mikokoteni zya ku' Misili, ku'nguno ya ku'v'aleta v'aki' v'inywe na v'ana v'ado v'ado, mumusole na sinywe mumulete hano. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Hangi' muleke kwiganika ku'nguno ya nsawo zinywe, ku'nguno masoga gose ga mu nsi' ya Misili gaku'v'a ginywe.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Hohene v'ana v'amwa Izilaeli v'av'ezyaga vyeni'vyo. Yosefu wav'apaga mikokoteni, ki'ti' i'vyo Falao walagi'li'zizye, hangi' wav'apaga na viliwa vya mu nzi'la. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Hangi' wav'apaga ki'la yu'mo ki'zwalo cha kwiv'i'lu'la, sumbwa Benyamini wamupaga vizwalo vitano haki'mo na vipande magana adatu' vya feza. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Haho watu'mi'zyaga lu'holo ku'mwa ise vintu' i'vi: Mpunda iku'mi zya ku'somba vintu' visoga ku'fuma ku' nsi' ya Misili, mpunda iku'mi nki'ma zya ku'sombela migate na viliwa vya mu nzi'la ku'nguno yamwa ise. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Hohene, Yosefu widahyaga na v'adu'gu'ye. Ali'vi aho v'av'aga v'ali'wu'ka, wav'alangaga ku' ku'yomba, “Muleke kwikenia mu nzi'la!”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Hohene, v'adu'gu'ye v'awu'kaga ku' Misili na ku'su'v'a ku'mwa sav'o Yakobo, ku' nsi' ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Aho v'afikaga ku'mwa sav'o, v'amuwi'laga ati', “Yosefu ali'ho ali'zuwu'ka! Hu' mwene mutemi wa nsi' yose ya Misili!” Sav'o aho wigagwa vyeni'vyo wagwaga nkekev'azi, ku'nguno akasani'zizye mihayo zyav'o. <verse eid="GEN 45:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Ali'vi aho v'amutentemuli'laga yose ki'ti' i'vyo Yosefu wav'awi'lile, na ku'wona mikokoteni i'zyo wamutu'mi'lile ki'gele zimusole na ku'mufila ku' Misili, haho moyo gwamwa Yakobo gwatogagwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Haho Izilaeli wayombaga ati', “Gi'si' nazumya! Mwana wanne Yosefu akaali' ali'zuwu'ka. Nku'ya nkamuwone aho nkaali' ku'fwa!”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Hohene Izilaeli wawu'kaga ku'ya ku' nsi' ya Misili haki'mo na v'antu' v'akwe na vintu' vyakwe vyose. Aho wafikaga ku' Beeli-sheba, wafumyaga ki'taambo cha ku'si'nza ku' Mulungu wamwa Isaka ise.<verse eid="GEN 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Mulungu wayombaga na Izilaeli wu'ziku' ki'ti' ndoti, wamwitanaga, “Yakobo, Yakobo!” Nawe witawu'kaga, “Kalame! Ene aha.” <verse eid="GEN 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Ene ni' Mulungu, Mulungu wamwa so. Ku'du' wogohe ku'ya ku' nsi' ya Misili, ku'nguno ndaku'v'ezye ev'e ku'v'a nsi' nhanya kwenu'ko. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Ene nku'ya haki'mo nanho kwenu'ko ku' nsi' ya Misili, nhana nanne ndaku'su'v'ye ku' Kanaani. Lu'siku' lwa ku'gulala kwako, Yosefu alaku'kumbi'le minso gako.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Haho Yakobo wawu'kaga ku'fuma ku' Beeli-sheba. V'aane v'amusolaga sav'o, v'ana v'av'o v'ado v'ado haki'mo na v'aki' v'av'o, v'av'atu'u'laga mu mikokoteni i'zyo zyatu'mi'ziv'agwa na Falao ki'gele ziv'asombe. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />V'asolaga mitugo na nsawo zyose i'zyo v'asangwa v'akwav'ile mu nsi' ya Kanaani, nawe Yakobo haki'mo na v'av'yalwa wakwe v'ose v'asami'laga ku' Misili. <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />Wav'asolaga v'aane v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma, haki'mo na v'izu'ku'lu' v'akwe v'ose. I'vi hu' vyene wawu'kaga na wu'v'yalwa wakwe wose, wav'ayanaga ku' Misili.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Aga hu' mina ga wu'v'yalwa wamwa Izilaeli, ku' lina li'ngi' Yakobo, av'o v'ayaga ku' Misili:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 46:8" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 46:8">Lubeni ali' mwana wakwe wa mbele, <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya v'av'age: Hanoki, Palu, Heziloni na Kalimi.<verse eid="GEN 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Simiyoni v'av'age: Yemueli, Yamini, Ohadi, Yakini, Sohali na Shauli, u'yo wa ku'v'yalwa na muki'ma Mukanaani.<verse eid="GEN 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Lawi v'av'age: Gelesoni, Kohati na Melali.<verse eid="GEN 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Yuda v'av'age: Eli, Onani, Shela, Pelezi na Zela. Ali'vi Eli na Onani v'asangwa v'agulali'lile ku' nsi' ya Kanaani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 46:12">V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Pelezi v'av'age: Heziloni na Hamuli.<verse eid="GEN 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Isakali v'av'age: Tola, Puv'a, Yashubu na Shimuloni.<verse eid="GEN 46:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Sebuloni v'av'age: Seledi, Eloni na Yaleeli.<verse eid="GEN 46:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />V'enav'o hu' v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Yakobo av'o wamuv'yali'laga Leya mu nsi' ya Padani-alamu. Na mwane wa ki'ki'ma Dina, nawe wav'yali'lagwa kwenu'ko. V'ana na v'izu'ku'lu' v'akwe v'ose v'av'age v'afikile maku'mi adatu' na v'adatu'.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Gadi v'av'age: Sifioni, Hagi, Shuni, Eziboni, Eli, Alodi na Aleli.<verse eid="GEN 46:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Asheli v'av'age: Imna, Ishva, Ishvi, Belia na Sela ilu'mbu' lyav'o.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 46:17">V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Belia v'av'age: Hebeli na Malikieli.<verse eid="GEN 46:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />V'enav'o hu' v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Yakobo av'o wamuv'yali'laga Zilipa, u'yo Labani ndi' wamupa mwaniki' wakwe Leya av'e muzya wakwe. V'ana na v'izu'ku'lu' v'akwe v'ose v'av'age v'afikile iku'mi na mukaga.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Lahele wamuv'yali'laga Yakobo v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'av'i'li': Yosefu na Benyamini.<verse eid="GEN 46:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />U'ko ku' Misili, Asenati, mwaniki' wamwa Potifela, u'yo wav'age Muhozya wa kaya ya Oni, wamuv'yali'laga Yosefu v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'av'i'li': Manase na Ifulaimu.<verse eid="GEN 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Benyamini v'av'age: Bela, Bekeli, Ashibeli, Gela, Nemani, Ehi, Loshi, Mupimu, Hupimu na Alidi.<verse eid="GEN 46:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />V'enav'o hu' v'ana v'a ki'gosya na v'izu'ku'lu' av'o Lahele wamuv'yali'laga Yakobo. V'av'age iku'mi na v'ane.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Mwana wa ki'gosya wamwa Dani witanagwe Hushimu.<verse eid="GEN 46:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Nafutali v'av'age: Yaseeli, Guni, Yeseli na Shilemu.<verse eid="GEN 46:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />V'enav'o hu' v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Yakobo av'o wamuv'yali'laga Biliha, u'yo Labani ndi' wamupa mwaniki' wakwe Lahele av'e muzya wakwe. V'ana v'ose haki'mo na v'izu'ku'lu' v'av'age mupungati'.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />V'enav'a v'ose hu' v'av'yalwa av'o Yakobo ndi' wasama nav'o ku'ya ku' nsi' ya Misili. V'av'age maku'mi mukaga na mukaga, ku'leka lu'v'alo lwa v'akamwana v'akwe. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Haki'mo na v'ana v'av'i'li' v'amwa Yosefu, av'o v'av'yali'lagwa ku' nsi' ya Misili, lu'v'alo lwa wu'du'gu' wose wamwa Yakobo, av'o v'ingi'laga ku' nsi' ya Misili, v'av'age maku'mi mupungati'.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Hohene Yakobo wamutongezyaga Yuda ku'mwa Yosefu, ki'gele av'alagi'le nzi'la ya ku'ya ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni. Haho v'afikaga kwenu'ko. <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yosefu waliinaga mukokoteni gwakwe gwa ku'kweswa na falasi, wayaga ku'kamusu'mbi'la ise kwenu'ko ku' Gosheni. Aho wamufiki'laga, wamuwungati'laga na wali'laga ku' itungo ilihu.<verse eid="GEN 46:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Izilaeli wamuwi'laga Yosefu ati', “Ninga nfwe itungo li'li' yi'li' visoga du', ku'nguno nawu'wonaga wu'syu' wako na u'li'zuwu'ka.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Yosefu wav'awi'laga v'adu'gu'ye na v'antu' v'ose v'a mu lu'go lwamwa ise ati', “Nku'ya nkamuwi'le Falao ati', v'adu'gu' v'anne na v'antu' v'ose v'a mu lu'go lwamwa v'av'a av'o v'av'age ku' nsi' ya Kanaani, v'izaga ku' wanne. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Hangi' nku'muwi'la ati', v'adu'gu' v'enav'a v'asav'i v'a mitugo. V'izaga na ng'ombe, nkolo, mbu'li, na vintu' vyav'o vyose. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />U'lu' Falao wamwitana na ku'muwu'zya ati', ‘Muli'mo gwinywe ki'?’ <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />Inywe musu'v'ye ati', ‘Iswe v'akumba v'ako ku'li' v'asav'i v'a mitugo ku'fuma wu'yanda wiswe mpaka walelo, ki'ti' v'agu'ku' v'iswe i'vyo v'av'ezyage.’ Muyombe vyeni'vyo ki'gele muzumi'ziwe kwikala ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni, ku'nguno V'amisili v'av'agayile muno v'adi'mi v'a nkolo.”<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo ali'mudosya Falao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Haho Yosefu wayaga ku'kamuwi'la Falao ati', “V'av'a wanne na v'adu'gu' v'anne v'izaga ku'fuma ku' nsi' ya Kanaani, haki'mo na ng'ombe, nkolo, mbu'li na vintu' vyav'o vyose. Nav'o v'ali' ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Yosefu wasangwa wav'asogolaga v'adu'gu'ye v'atano, wav'afilaga ku'mwa Falao ki'gele v'akioleche. <verse eid="GEN 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Falao wav'awu'zyaga, “Muli'mo gwinywe ki'?” Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga “Iswe v'akumba v'ako ku'li' v'asav'i v'a mitugo ki'ti' v'agu'ku' v'iswe i'vyo v'av'age.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Hangi' v'amuwi'laga Falao ati', “Iswe v'akumba v'ako kwizaga kwikala mu nsi' yeni'yi' ki'ti' v'ageni, ku'nguno nzala yi'li' ndaki muno ku' nsi' ya Kanaani, na ku'du'hu' hangi' maswa ga ku'di'mi'zya mitugo ziswe. Hohene, ku'li' kwikonga iswe v'akumba v'ako u'ku'zumi'zye kwikala ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni.”<verse eid="GEN 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Falao wamuwi'laga Yosefu, “So haki'mo na v'adu'gu'yo v'izaga ku' wako, <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />nayo nsi' yose ya Misili yi'li' ha mbele yako. Ku'nguno yeni'yo u'v'aleke v'ikale ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni, ku'nguno lu'li' lwandi' lu'soga ku'ki'la nsi' yose ya Misili. Hangi' u'lu' u'v'amanyile v'antu' v'akowozi mugati' na v'enav'a, u'v'atu'u'le v'av'e v'i'mi'li'zi v'a mitugo zyanne.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Haho Yosefu wamuletaga ise Yakobo mugati', wamutu'u'laga ha mbele yamwa Falao, nawe Yakobo wamudosyaga Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Falao wamuwu'zyaga Yakobo ati', “U'li' na musimo gwa myaka zinga?” <verse eid="GEN 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ni'na musimo gwa myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi adatu'. Myaka zya wikalo wanne ki'ti' muv'i'tayi'la zili' midoo na zya lu'duko, nazyo zikagelani'la wingi wa myaka zya wikalo wa v'agu'ku' v'anne.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Haho Yakobo wamudosyaga Falao hangi', nawe wawu'kaga henanho.<verse eid="GEN 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Hohene Yosefu wav'apaga lwandi' lwa kwikala, ise haki'mo na v'adu'gu'ye, mu nsi' ya Misili ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni, ku' lina li'ngi' Lamesesi, u'lo lu'soga ku'ki'la nsi' yose. Hav'aga ha wikalo wav'o, ki'ti' Falao i'vyo wayombaga. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Hangi' Yosefu wamupaga ise, v'adu'gu'ye na v'antu' v'av'o v'ose viliwa vya ku'gelani'la wingi wa v'antu' na v'ana v'av'o.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wi'mi'li'zi wamwa Yosefu ha itungo lya nzala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Aho lyav'i'taga itungo viliwa vyalekaga kwigela mu nsi' yose ya Misili na Kanaani. Nzala yav'aga ndaki muno na yalengaga v'antu' v'av'o ku'tuka. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yosefu wakumingaga hela zyose zya nsi' ya Kanaani na Misili i'zyo ndi' v'agu'li'lile viliwa. Nawe wazifilaga ku' iku'lu' lyamwa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Yav'aga aho zyamalaga hela zya v'antu' v'a Misili na Kanaani, V'amisili v'ose v'izaga ku'mwa Yosefu na ku'muwi'la, “Hela ziswe zyamalaga. Ku'page ki'liwa! Ku' ki' ku'fwe ha mbele ya minso gako?” <verse eid="GEN 47:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yosefu wasu'v'yaga ati', “U'lu' hela zinywe zyamalaga, mundetele mitugo zinywe, nanne nku'mupa ki'liwa.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Haho v'antu' v'enav'o v'amuletelaga Yosefu mitugo zyav'o, nazyo zyav'age falasi, ng'ombe, nkolo, mbu'li na mpunda. Hohene Yosefu wav'apaga ki'liwa ku' mwaka gwenu'go.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Hangi' mwaka u'go ndi' gwalonda v'izaga na ku'muwi'la ati', “Gu'ku', yi'li' nhana hela ziswe zyose zyamalile, na mitugo ziswe zyav'aga zyako. Gi'si' ku'du'hu' ninga ki'mo i'cho ku'kowolile ku'ku'pa hamo miv'i'li' ziswe na migu'nda ziswe. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Ku' ki' ku'fwe ha mbele ya minso gako, na migu'nda ziswe ziv'ipe? U'ku'gu'le iswe haki'mo na migu'nda ziswe, ki'gele ku'pandi'ke ki'liwa. Iswe ku'ku'v'a v'asese v'amwa Falao, na migu'nda ziswe ziku'v'a zyakwe. Hangi' u'ku'pe mbiyu' zya ku'hamba, ku'du' kwize ku'fwe na nzala na migu'nda ziswe zisigale zili' wu'du'hu' ki'ntu'.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Hohene Yosefu wamugu'li'laga Falao migu'nda zyose zya mu Misili. V'amisili v'ose v'agu'zyaga migu'nda zyav'o, ku'nguno ya nzala yav'age ndaki muno. Ku'nguno yeni'yo nsi' yose ya Misili yav'aga yamwa Falao, <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />nawe Yosefu wav'av'ezyaga v'antu' v'ose ku'v'a v'asese, ku'fuma lwandi' lu'mo mpaka lwandi' lu'ngi' lwa nsi' ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Ali'vi Yosefu akagu'lile migu'nda zya v'ahozya, ku'nguno v'eni'ki'li' v'av'age v'ali'gawu'lwa lwandi' lwav'o ku'fuma ku'mwa Falao, nav'o v'av'age na viliwa vya ku'v'agelani'la ku'nguno ya wu'gawu'lwa u'wo wav'apage Falao. Yeni'yo hu' nguno ya ku'leka ku'gu'zya migu'nda zyav'o.<verse eid="GEN 47:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Yosefu wav'awi'laga v'antu' ati', “Lolagi, namugu'laga walelo inywe haki'mo na nsi' yinywe, na inywe mwav'aga nsawo yamwa Falao. Gi'si' mbiyu' i'zi mukav'i'v'e mu migu'nda. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Ali'vi ha itungo lya lyi'mbu'la u'lu' lyafika, ifungu li'mo mugati' na atano mulamupe Falao. Mafungu ane ago galasigali'le galav'e ga mbiyu' na ki'liwa chinywe, v'ana v'inywe, na migana zinywe.” <verse eid="GEN 47:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Nav'o v'ayombaga “Gu'ku' waku'pi'zyaga! Ku'nguno kwapandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yako, niswe ku'ku'v'a v'asese v'amwa Falao.”<verse eid="GEN 47:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Hohene Yosefu wayi'v'ezyaga yi'v'e nhama ya mu nsi' ya Misili ninga walelo, ku'v'a ifungu li'mo mugati' na atano lya lyi'mbu'la yi'li' nsawo yamwa Falao. Migu'nda zya v'ahozya du' hu' zyene zikav'ile zyamwa Falao.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo ali'fumya ilagi'li'zyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Hohene V'aizilaeli v'ikalaga ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni ku' nsi' ya Misili. Aho v'av'aga kwenu'ko, v'apandi'kaga nsawo nyingi muno, na v'iv'yalaga na kwingi'ha muno. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakobo wikalaga ku' nsi' ya Misili myaka iku'mi na mupungati', na musimo gwakwe wav'age na myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi ane na mupungati'.<verse eid="GEN 47:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Itungo lyakwe lya ku'fwa aho lyegelaga, Yakobo wamwitanaga mwane Yosefu na ku'muwi'la, “U'lu' nhana u'ntogilwe, tu'u'la mukono gwako mu matango ganne u'ndahi'li'le ati', u'kasye u'nzyi'ki'le henanha ha nsi' ya Misili. Nu'kwikonga wize u'mbezezye igambo lyeni'li' ku' chelu' na nhana. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Ali'vi aho ndav'e nalala na v'agu'ku' v'anne, wize u'nsole u'nsinie mu nsi' ya Misili, na u'kanzyi'kile ku' viv'i'mbi' vyav'o.” Yosefu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ndav'ezye ki'ti' i'vyo wayombaga.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Yakobo wamuwi'laga “Ndahi'li'le!” Yosefu wamulahi'li'laga. Haho Yakobo wakundamyaga mutwe gwakwe ku' nsagamutwe ya wu'li'li' wakwe.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo ali'v'adosya v'ana v'amwa Yosefu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Aho lyav'i'taga igambo lyeni'lo, Yosefu wawi'lagwa ati', “Lingaga so alwalile.” Hohene wav'asolaga v'ana v'akwe v'av'i'li', Manase na Ifulaimu, wayaga nav'o ku'mwa ise. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Haho Yakobo wawi'lagwa ati', “Lolaga mwano Yosefu wiza ku'ku'wona.” Yakobo, ku' lina li'ngi' Izilaeli, widugumaga kwiwu'ki'li'zya na kwikala ha wu'li'li'. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Haho Yakobo wamuwi'laga Yosefu ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu wa Nguzu ndi' wanifumi'i'la aho nav'age ku' Luzu, ku' nsi' ya Kanaani, na kwenu'ko wandosya. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Wambwi'la i'vi: ‘Lingaga, nku'ku'v'ezya u'v'e na wu'v'yalwa wingi, na ku'kwingi'hya muno, hangi' nku'ku'v'ezya u'v'e mbuto ya makabi'la. Nsi' yeni'yi' ndawu'pe wu'v'yalwa wako wu'yi'teme ku'fuma ku' wako nhananhana.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Yakobo walambaga ku'yomba, “Hohene gi'si', v'ana v'ako av'a Ifulaimu na Manase, av'o wapandi'kile ku'no ku' Misili ha itungo i'lo ndi' nkaali' kwiza ku'no, v'aku'v'aziwa ku'v'a v'ana v'anne, ki'ti' i'vi v'ali' Lubeni na Simiyoni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Ali'vi v'ana av'o u'lapandi'ke ha itungo lya mbele v'alav'aziwe ku'v'a v'ana v'ako. Ku' nsi' i'yo v'alasaale, v'alitanwe ku' lina lya v'adu'gu' v'av'o. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Nu'v'ezya vyeni'vyo ku'nguno ya ku'mongezezya wu'v'yazi nnoko Lahele. Aho nav'age nsu'v'ile ku'fuma ku' lwandi' lwa Padani-alamu, mu nzi'la ya ku' nsi' ya Kanaani bi'hi' na lwandi' lwa Efulati, hu' aho wagulali'laga. Hohene nadimagwa na misayo, na ku'muzyi'ki'la hene haho ha mpelo na nzi'la ya ku'ya ku' Efulati.” Gi'si' yi'li'witanwa Betelehemu.<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Yav'aga Izilaeli aho wav'awonaga v'ana v'amwa Yosefu, wamuwu'zyaga ati', “Ali' v'enav'a v'a nde?” <verse eid="GEN 48:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yosefu wasu'v'yaga ku'mwa ise ati', “V'enav'a v'ana v'anne av'o Mulungu wampile aho nav'aga kwenu'ku'.” Haho Izilaeli wamuwi'laga, “V'egezye hano ki'gele mbadosye.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Itungo lyeni'lo Izilaeli wasangwa wakiku'la, na ku'nguno yeni'yo minso gakwe gasangwa gakali' ku'wona visoga. Haho Yosefu wav'egezyaga v'aane ku'mwa ise. Hohene Izilaeli wav'asu'naga na ku'v'awungati'la.<verse eid="GEN 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Hangi' Izilaeli wamuwi'laga Yosefu ati', “Mwana wanne, nav'age nkav'ile kwiganika ku'v'a ndaku'wone wu'syu' wako hangi'. Ali'vi gi'si', kasinaga nayali'lagwa na Mulungu ninga ku'v'awona v'ano!” <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Haho Yosefu wav'asiniaga v'aane ha magu'lu' gamwa ise, nawe wamuku'v'i'i'laga. <verse eid="GEN 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Hangi' wav'ahelaga v'enav'o v'aane v'av'i'li', Ifulaimu ku' mukono gwa mulyi'la, wamulondolaga ku' mukono gwa mumoso gwamwa Izilaeli, na Manase ku' mukono gwa mumoso, wamulondolaga ku' mukono gwa mulyi'la gwamwa Izilaeli. Haho wav'egezyaga ku'mwa gu'ku' wav'o. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Ali'vi Izilaeli wapu'ganiaga makono gakwe. Mukono gwakwe gwa mulyi'la, wagu'tu'u'laga ku' mutwe gwamwa Ifulaimu u'yo wav'age mudo, na mukono gwakwe gwa mumoso, wagu'tu'u'laga ku' mutwe gwamwa Manase, ninga i'vi hu' mwene wav'age muv'yalwa wa mbele. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Haho wamudosyaga Yosefu ku' ku'yomba,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 48:15" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">“Mulungu u'yo v'agu'ku' v'anne Abalahamu na Isaka v'av'age v'alondile nzi'la yakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Mulungu u'yo hu' mudi'mi wa wikalo wanne ku'fiki'la walelo,<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />Malaika u'yo wampi'zyaga na mav'i gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">mwenu'yu' av'adosye v'asu'mbana av'a.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Lina lyanne haki'mo na mina ga v'agu'ku' Abalahamu na Isaka gatemulwe ku' v'enav'a,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">na v'ingi'he muno mu welelo.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Ali'vi Yosefu aho wawonaga ku'v'a ise watu'u'laga mukono gwakwe gwa mulyi'la ha igu'lya na mutwe gwamwa Ifulaimu, akatogeziv'ilwe. Hohene wagu'dimaga mukono gwamwa ise, ki'gele agu'tu'u'le ha igu'lya na mutwe gwamwa Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Hangi' wamuwi'laga ise ati', “V'av'a wanne, yi'kav'ile vyeni'vyo! Ku'nguno u'yu' hu' mwene muv'yalwa wanne wa mbele. Nu'ku'lomba chaki'sa, u'tu'u'le mukono gwako gwa mulyi'la ku' mutwe gwakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Ali'vi ise wakaanaga na ku'yomba, “Manyile, mwana wanne, manyile. Mwenu'yu' nawe aku'v'a kabi'la nhanya, na ku'v'a muntu' muhanya. Sumbwa muzunaye mwene alav'e muhanya ku'muki'la mwiye, na wu'v'yalwa wakwe wu'lav'e makabi'la mingi.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />I'vi hu' vyene lu'siku' lwenu'lo Izilaeli wav'adosyaga ku' ku'yomba,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 48:20" />
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:20">“V'aizilaeli v'alatu'mi'lage mina ginywe mu ku'dosya v'antu'.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:20">V'alayombage ati', ‘Mulungu aku'v'ezye u'v'e ki'ti' Ifulaimu na Manase!’ ”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 48:20" />
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:20">I'vi hu' vyene Izilaeli wamutongezyaga Ifulaimu ku' mbele yamwa Manase.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Hangi' Izilaeli wamuwi'laga Yosefu ati', “Lolaga, ene negelaga ku'fwa. Ali'vi Mulungu alav'e haki'mo na inywe, na ku'musu'v'ya ku' nsi' ya v'agu'ku' v'inywe. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo, nu'ku'gawu'li'la ev'e lwandi' lu'mo lwa ku' ngu'lu', u'lo nkav'apile v'adu'gu'yo. Nu'ku'gawu'li'la lwandi' u'lo nasampaga lwa lu'panga na wu'ta wanne, ku'fuma mu makono ga V'aamoli.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Yakobo ali'v'adosya v'aane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Haho Yakobo wav'itanaga v'ana v'akwe na ku'v'awi'la ati', “Mwikuminge haki'mo, ki'gele mmuwi'le ago galamupandi'ke ku' nsiku' i'zyo zizile.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />Ikumingi, inywe v'ana v'amwa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">mundegeleke ene Izilaeli, sinywe.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />Lubeni, ev'e u'li' muv'yalwa wanne wa mbele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">nguzu zyanne na ki'sumo cha wu'su'mba wanne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">ev'e u'v'aki'lile v'adu'gu'yo ku' wu'hanya na ku' nguzu.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Ali'vi u'li' ki'ti' minzi' ga muhu'mo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">u'kasye u'v'e mutongelezi hangi',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">ku'nguno waliinile ha wu'li'li' wanne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">ene so, na ku'wu'v'ezezya zoma wu'li'li' wanne.<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />Simiyoni na Lawi lyav'o li'mo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">mpanga zyav'o zili' vilwani'lo vya ku'v'ezezya wu'kandi.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Ev'e moyo gwanne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">ku'du' wingi'le mu mbisi'i'la zyav'o,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">ninga ku'du' wikale mu mav'anza gav'o.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Ku'nguno v'awu'lagile v'antu' ku' ki'sila chav'o,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">na ku' wu'pu'lu'nganu wav'o v'aputile matimba ga ng'ombe.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Ki'fwizi'i'lwe ki'sila chav'o ku'nguno ki'daki muno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">na ku'kilwa kwav'o ku'nguno ku'li' wu'du'hu' ki'sa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Ndav'agawu'lanie mu nsi' yamwa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">ndav'asambazye mu nsi' yamwa Izilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />Ev'e Yuda, v'adu'gu'yo v'alaku'kumi'li'zye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Mukono gwako gu'lanige nhingo zya v'anisi v'ako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">na v'av'yalwa v'ichako v'alaku'ku'v'i'i'le.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Yuda ali' ki'ti' mwana wa nsimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">i'yo yamali'laga ku'lya nyama na ku'su'v'a ku'fuma ku' iv'enda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">i'yo yi'li'wigolola na ku'lala ha nsi'.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Mwana wanne ali' ki'ti' nsimba nki'ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Nde wa ku'gima ku'yi'tunu'zya?<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Mulanga gwa ndekeli gu'kasye gu'fume ku'mwa Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">ninga isumbi' lya wu'temi ku'fuma mu magu'lu' gakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">mpaka aho alafike musav'a wu'temi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">u'yo nsi' zyose zilamuku'zye.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Mwene alav'e na wu'poni wa mizabibu mingi muno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">ninga alatunge mpunda yi'lye muzabibu musoga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Alakanze myenda zyakwe ku' ki'neneko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na vizwalo vyakwe mu minzi' ga mizabibu gazaa ki'ti' magazi.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Minso gakwe galazalu'ke ku' ki'neneko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:12">na mino gakwe galav'e gape ku' mav'eele.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />Sebuloni alikale ha mpwani ya nyanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">na henanho halav'e ha lwandi' lwa wu'salama kwi'mi'ki'zya mato.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Lu'v'i'mbi' lwakwe lu'lagali'nhe ku'ya ku' Sidoni.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />Isakali ali' ki'ti' mpunda ya malupo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">i'yo yi'li'wilali'ki'zya hagati' na miligo zyayo.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Yi'li'wona ku'v'a ha lwandi' lwa ku'suuhi'la lu'li' lu'soga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">na nsi' yi'li' ya kwiv'elelwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Yi'li'kundamya mugongo gwayo mu ku'sola muligo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">yi'lifumye ku'v'a nsese ya mili'mo milambu.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />Dani alav'e muyangu'zi wa v'antu' v'akwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">ki'ti' yu'mo mugati' na magongo ga mu Izilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Dani alav'e ki'ti' nzoka mu nzi'la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">nzoka ya ndu'li'la ha mpelo na wu'v'i'ti'lo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">i'yo yi'li'luma tu'sinsila twa falasi zya v'anisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">ki'gele u'yo ayi'liinile agwe kansaga.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />Ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu nu'lindi'la wu'pi'zya wako!<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />Gadi alagwi'li'lwe na v'anisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">ali'vi alav'agalu'ki'le na ku'v'akinda.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />Nsi' yamwa Asheli yi'lafumyage viliwa vingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">viliwa visoga mu ku'lya mutemi.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />Nafutali ali' ki'ti' nsya ya wiyagalu'le,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">i'yo yi'li'wu'ta v'ana v'asoga.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />Yosefu ali' ki'ti' muzabibu u'go gu'li'pamba visumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">u'go gu'li' ha mpelo na kasela ka minzi',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">na matambi' gakwe gali'landala ku' igu'lya na magelele.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />V'alasani ndi' v'amulasa ku' wu'daki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">v'amutagi'li'lile masonga na ku'mutusya muno.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Ali'vi wu'ta wakwe wav'age wu'jaamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">makono gakwe gongeziv'agwa nguzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">ku' wu'kowozi wamwa Gu'ku' Mutatambi' wamwa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">na ku' makono ga Mudi'mi na Itale lya Izilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Mulungu wamwa so alaku'gwasye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Gu'ku' Mulungu wa Nguzu alaku'dosye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">u'pandi'ke lu'v'ango lwa nvula ku'fuma ku' igu'lya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">lu'v'ango lwa minzi' ga kasela ga ha nsi',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">na lu'v'ango lwa mav'eele na wu'v'yazi.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Lu'v'ango lwamwa so</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">lu'ki'lile lu'v'ango lwa ngu'lu' zya nhananhana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Lu'ku'lile ku'ki'la hazina ya ngu'lu' zya kale.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Lu'v'ango lwenu'lo lwikale ha igu'lya na mutwe gwamwa Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">ha igu'lya na u'yo wasogolilwe av'e mutemi mugati' na v'adu'gu'ye.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />Benyamini ali' ki'ti' ipu'u'ge idaki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">Ndiyu' li'li'lyaga masapi'i'lo galyo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">na mpi'ndi' li'li'gawu'laga i'vyo lyadimaga.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Genago hu' magongo iku'mi na av'i'li' ga Izilaeli, na zyeni'zyo hu' mihayo i'zyo Yakobo wav'awi'laga v'ana v'akwe ha itungo lya ku'v'adosya. Wav'adosyaga yu'mo yu'mo, v'ose ki'la yu'mo i'vyo yi'mugelani'lile.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'fwa kwamwa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Haho Yakobo walagi'li'zyaga ati', “Ene negelaga ku'fwa mbe haki'mo na v'agu'ku' v'anne. Mulanzyi'ke haki'mo na v'anamala v'anne mu ipilinga i'lo li'li' mu ilale lyamwa Efuloni, Muhiti. <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />Ilale lyeni'lo li'li' ku' Makipela, lwandi' lwa ki'ya ya Mamule, mu nsi' ya Kanaani. Ipilinga lyeni'lo hu' i'lo Abalahamu ndi' wagu'la ku'mwa Efuloni, Muhiti, hav'e ha ku'zyi'ki'la v'antu' v'akwe. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Mu ipilinga mwenu'mo, v'amuzyi'ki'laga Abalahamu na muki' wakwe Sala, Isaka na muki' wakwe Lebeka, na Leya namuzyi'ki'laga mwenu'mo. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Ilale lyeni'lo na ipilinga lyeni'lo lyagu'lilwe ku'fuma ku' V'ahiti.”<verse eid="GEN 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Hohene Yakobo aho wamali'laga ku'v'alanga v'aane, wasu'v'yaga magu'lu' gakwe ha wu'li'li', wakindi'laga myu'ye, wagulalaga, na walondaga nzi'la ya v'agu'ku' v'akwe.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Haho Yosefu wagu'gwi'laga muv'i'li' gwamwa ise, wamuli'laga na ku'musu'na ha wu'syu'. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Hangi' Yosefu wav'alagi'li'zyaga v'ambeza v'akwe, v'agu'v'ile muv'i'li' gwamwa ise wu'ganga ki'gele gu'leke ku'wola. Nav'o v'av'ezyaga vyeni'vyo. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Muli'mo gwenu'go gwasolaga nsiku' maku'mi ane, ku'nguno hu' itungo i'lo ndi' li'li'koov'iwa lya ku'v'ila wu'ganga. V'amisili nav'o v'amuli'laga Yakobo ku' nsiku' maku'mi mupungati'.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Nsiku' zya ku'muli'la aho zyamala, Yosefu wav'awi'laga v'ayangu' v'amwa Falao ati', “U'lu' napandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yinywe, nu'mulomba musu'nsu'mu'le na Falao, mumuwi'le ati', v'av'a wanne ndi' wandahi'li'zya na ku'yomba ati', <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />‘Ene negelaga ku'fwa. U'lu' nafwa, u'kanzyi'ki'le ku' ki'v'i'mbi' i'cho nasi'mbile ku' nsi' ya Kanaani.’ Gi'si' nu'mulomba Falao anzumi'zye nje nkamuzyi'ke v'av'a wanne hangi' ndasu'v'e.” <verse eid="GEN 50:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Falao wasu'v'yaga ati', “Yaga u'kamuzyi'ke so ki'ti' i'vyo waku'lahi'li'zya.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Hohene, Yosefu wayaga ku'kamuzyi'ka ise. V'awu'kaga haki'mo na v'atu'mami v'ose v'amwa Falao, v'anamala v'a mu lu'go lwamwa Falao, na v'anamala v'ose v'a mu nsi' ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Hangi' wawu'kaga na v'antu' v'ose v'a ha lu'go lwakwe, v'adu'gu'ye, haki'mo na v'antu' v'a lu'go lwamwa ise. V'ana v'ado v'ado na mitugo du' hu' i'zyo zyasigalaga ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Hangi' v'awu'kaga na v'aliina falasi na mikokoteni zya ku'kweswa na falasi. Nalyo lyav'aga idale ihanya muno lya v'antu'.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Aho v'afikaga ha lwandi' lwa Atadi ha lu'mbu'ga, bi'hi' na ngu'ka ya mongo gwa Yolodani, v'ali'laga ku' misayo mihanya. Yosefu wikalaga kwenu'ko ku' nsiku' mupungati' ku'muli'la ise. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />V'akanaani av'o v'av'age v'ikazi v'a henanho, aho v'awonaga v'antu' v'ali'li'la ha lwandi' lwa lu'mbu'ga lwa ha Atadi, v'ayombaga ati', “Ki'li'lo cha V'amisili ki'li' ki'hanya muno!” Ku'nguno yeni'yo, henanho hitanagwa Abeli-misili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">50:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Abeli-misili” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “ku'li'la kwa Misili.”</char></note>, na henanho hu' yi'li' ngu'ka ya mongo gwa Yolodani.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />V'ana v'akwe v'amuv'ezezyaga sav'o Yakobo ki'ti' i'vyo ndi' walagi'li'zya. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />V'agu'filaga muv'i'li' ku' nsi' ya Kanaani, na ku'muzyi'ki'la mu ipilinga ha ilale i'lo lyav'age ku' Makipela, bi'hi' na Mamule. Ilale lyeni'lo hu' i'lo ndi' wagu'la Abalahamu ku'mwa Efuloni, Muhiti, ki'gele hav'e ha ku'zyi'ki'la v'antu' v'akwe.<verse eid="GEN 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Aho Yosefu wamali'laga ku'muzyi'ka ise, wasu'v'aga ku' Misili haki'mo na v'adu'gu'ye, na v'antu' v'ose av'o ndi' v'amufili'li'zya ku'kamuzyi'ka ise.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosefu ali'v'asini'zya hi'mba v'adu'gu'ye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Yav'aga aho ki'li'lo chamwa sav'o chamalaga, v'adu'gu' v'amwa Yosefu v'ayombaga ati', “Yi'ku'v'a vihe Yosefu u'lu' atu'u'le nsika na ku'ku'li'pi'ki'zya mav'i gose ago ndi' kwamuv'ezezya?” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Haho v'amutu'mi'laga nkombe Yosefu ku'yomba ati', “Aho so akaali' ku'gulala ndi' walagi'li'zya i'vi: <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />‘Muwi'li Yosefu ati', “Nu'ku'lomba u'v'atondole v'adu'gu'yo ku' wu'kenagu'zi wav'o na magambo mav'i gose ago v'aku'v'ezezya.”’ Gi'si' ku'li'ku'lomba u'ku'tondole, iswe v'akumba v'amwa Mulungu wamwa so.” Yosefu wali'laga aho wigwa mihayo zyeni'zi.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Haho v'adu'gu'ye v'izaga na ku'muku'v'i'i'la ku' wov'a na ku'yomba, “Lingaga, iswe ku'li' v'asese v'ako.” <verse eid="GEN 50:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Ali'vi Yosefu wav'awi'laga ati', “Ku'du' mogohe. Ene nkav'ile Mulungu. <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Inywe ndi' muli' na ndaka ya ku'nvulazya, ali'vi Mulungu ndi' ali' na ndaka nsoga, ki'gele li'gelani'le i'li' li'li'v'ezyeka gi'si', ku'v'akomola v'antu' v'ingi ki'gele v'av'e na wu'panga. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo ku'du' mogohe. Ene nku'musu'nga inywe haki'mo na v'ana v'inywe.” Haho wasu'nsu'mu'laga nav'o visoga na ku'zitunia myoyo zyav'o.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'fwa kwamwa Yosefu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />I'vi hu' vyene Yosefu wikalaga ku' nsi' ya Misili, mweni'ki'li' haki'mo na igongo lyose lyamwa ise. Wikalaga mu welelo ku' itungo lya myaka igana li'mo na iku'mi. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Yosefu wapandi'kaga lu'v'ango lwa ku'v'awona v'ana v'amwa Ifulaimu, ninga wu'v'yalwa wakwe wa wu'datu'. Hangi' wav'awonaga v'ana v'amwa Makili, mwana wamwa Manase, nawe wav'azumyaga v'av'e ki'ti' v'ana v'akwe.<verse eid="GEN 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Haho Yosefu wav'awi'laga v'adu'gu'ye ati', “Ene gi'si' ni' bi'hi' ku'fwa. Ali'vi nhana Mulungu alize ku'mugwasya ku' ku'mufumya mu nsi' yeni'yi', na alamufile ku' nsi' i'yo ndi' wav'alagana Abalahamu, Isaka na Yakobo ku' mulahi'.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Hangi' Yosefu wav'alahi'li'zyaga v'ana v'amwa Izilaeli na ku'yomba ati', “Mulungu aho alamwizi'i'le ku'mugwasya, ku'du' mwize muleke maguha ganne henanha.”<verse eid="GEN 50:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Hohene Yosefu wagulalaga, ali' na muv'i'li' gwa myaka igana li'mo na iku'mi, nav'o v'agu'v'ilaga wu'ganga mulambo na ku'gu'tu'u'la mu ijeneza kwenu'ko ku' Misili.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>